ano Banana 2";case"apiyi-nano-banana-pro":return"G Nano Banana Pro";case"fai-nano-banana-2":return"FAI Nano 2";case"fai-nano-banana-pro":return"FAI Pro";case"gpt-image-2-image-to-image":return"GPT Image 2";case"gpt-image-2-5-sunburst-image-to-image":return"GPT Image 2.5";case"gpt-image-2-5-flare-image-to-image":return"GPT Image 2.5 Flare";case"gpt-image-2-6-sunburst-image-to-image":case"gpt-image-2-6/sunburst-image-to-image":return"GPT Image 2.6";case"kie-seedream-5-5":case"seedream/5-5-image-to-image":return"SeeDream 5.5";case"kie-seedream-5-flash":return"SeeDream 5 Flash";case"kie-seedream-5-pro":return"SeeDream 5.0 Pro";case"kie-nano-banana-pro":return"KIE Nano Banana Pro";case"kie-nano-banana-2":return"KIE Nano Banana 2";case"kie-nano-banana-2-1":return"KIE Nano Banana 2.1";default:return t}};var re=(t=>(t.PHOTOREALISTIC="Professional high-end DSLR architectural photography captured with a 35mm lens, f/8.0 aperture.",t.THREE_D_RENDER="Professional architectural visualization, 3D render style, high-end CGI, Octane render, V-Ray fidelity.",t.INTERIOR_PHOTO="Generate this SketchUp reference image into a realistic photograph, similar to a photo taken with a DSLR camera at ultra HD 4K resolution, without altering the layout, geometry, or material textures.Enhance the material textures for greater realism.Natural lighting without additional effects.",t))(re||{}),ie=(t=>(t.NONE="",t.DEFAULT="CAMERA PERSPECTIVE LOCK: Maintain the exact camera viewpoint and perspective from the original input image. Do not change the focal length, field of view, or viewpoint. 1:1 camera match.",t.TOP_DOWN="Top Down",t))(ie||{}),q=(t=>(t.NONE="",t.MORNING="Early morning sun positioned must behind the building, sunlight filtering naturally through tree leaves.Create soft dappled shadows from leaves cast onto driveway and garden.Golden-hour morning light,clean and fresh.Soft global illumination with gentle contrast, realistic light bounce, and subtle ambient occlusion.",t.DAWN="Dawn",t.DAY="Bright, high-key daylight under a clear blue sky, resulting in a cheerful, airy mood with strong contrasts between sunlit and shadowed areas.",t.LATE_AFTERNOON="Clear late-day sky with indirect ambient lighting, resulting in even illumination and soft architectural shadows.",t.GOLDEN_HOUR="Low-angle golden-hour sun beneath a clear sky, producing warm glowing highlights and elongated shadows for a dramatic yet elegant architectural mood.",t.DUSK="Dramatic sunset transition with dense blue-grey cloud cover and a thin warm glow along the horizon, creating a moody, high-contrast atmosphere.",t.CIVIL_TWILIGHT="Pastel dusk sky with a soft blue–lavender gradient and light cloud formations, producing a serene and atmospheric backdrop",t.NAUTICAL_TWILIGHT="Nautical Twilight",t.ASTRONOMICAL_TWILIGHT="Soft dusk lighting under a pale grey-blue, lightly overcast sky, creating a calm, neutral atmosphere with subtle natural contrast across the facade.",t.BLUE_HOUR="Deep blue-hour twilight sky with a rich cobalt-to-violet gradient fading into a thin warm amber glow along the horizon line. Soft, diffused ambient light with no direct sun — the entire scene is lit by the residual sky luminance creating even, shadowless illumination. Deep saturated blue atmospheric tones dominate the upper sky, transitioning smoothly through lavender and soft peach near the horizon. Tropical landscaping appears as rich dark-green silhouettes against the deep blue atmosphere with subtle warm uplighting from concealed ground-level garden fixtures. Balanced HDR exposure: the sky retains deep saturated blue tones without clipping, while architectural accent lighting remains bright and inviting without overblown highlights. Professional architectural blue-hour photography atmosphere, calm and luxurious twilight mood, cinematic yet realistic color grading with no artificial filters.",t.NIGHT="Night",t.INTERIOR_LIGHT_A="Soft natural daylight illuminating the interior. Where curtains already exist in the source, daylight passes through the sheer translucent inner layer. STRICT RULE: Do not add, invent, or modify windows or curtain layers where a solid wall exists. Maintain all solid walls exactly as in the source. Bright but controlled exposure with no harsh direct beams. Neutral daylight color temperature (5500–6500K). Clean global illumination with soft shadows and realistic light bounce. Professional architectural photography style.",t.INTERIOR_LIGHT_B="Bright natural volumetric daylight creating soft global illumination and natural light bounce across the interior space. STRICT RULE: Preserve all structural geometry exactly. DO NOT create, punch holes, or hallucinate new windows, glass panels, or openings on solid walls. If an original window exists, show a realistic exterior environment through it.",t.MIDDAY="Soft cool daylight",t.OVERCAST="Overcast",t.PASTEL_SUNSET="Clear tropical sunset sky, pale powder-blue overhead fading smoothly into warm ivory, soft golden-yellow, and subtle peach near the horizon; faint atmospheric haze, minimal wispy clouds, soft pastel tones, no visible sun, no dramatic clouds.",t))(q||{}),J=(t=>(t.NONE="",t.OFF="LIGHTING: Primary global room lights are turned off (ambient darkness). Pure natural exterior or directional lighting takes over. However, local accent lights, downlights, or cabinet LEDs MUST remain on if specified. Emphasize shadow depth and high-contrast light spill. Physically correct glass behavior. Do not make glass flat or invisible.",t.WARM="LIGHTING: Modern warm-neutral interior lighting at true 4200K (warm-white LED, NOT tungsten). Color temperature must remain neutral-warm with NO yellow, orange, or amber color cast.Lighting appears soft white with subtle warmth, similar to high-end architectural LED fixtures (CRI 90+).Strong contrast against a slightly darker exterior.Interior lights clearly visible through windows, creating depth and luxury ambiance.Balanced HDR exposure — interior remains bright without overblown highlights.Physically correct glass behavior with Fresnel reflections.Clear but reflective glazing that mirrors sky gradient, nearby buildings, and landscaping.Avoid cinematic color grading or warm filters. Do not make glass flat or invisible.",t.NEUTRAL="LIGHTING: True neutral white interior lighting (4500K–5000K), clean and color-accurate.NO yellow, orange, or warm tint — lighting must appear pure white and balanced.Simulate modern architectural LED lighting with high CRI (90+), showroom-quality neutrality.Strong contrast against a slightly darker exterior.Interior lights clearly visible through windows, creating depth and luxury ambiance.Balanced HDR exposure — interior remains bright without overblown highlights.Physically correct glass behavior with Fresnel reflections.Clear but reflective glazing that mirrors sky gradient, nearby buildings, and landscaping.Avoid warm cinematic grading, sunset bias, or tungsten-like tones.",t.COOL="LIGHTING: Cool white interior lighting (6000K–6500K), crisp and clinical architectural glow. NO yellow, orange, or warm tint — lighting must appear pure, sharp white with a subtle blue-white clinical bias. Simulate modern high-tech LED lighting with high CRI (90+). Strong contrast against a slightly darker exterior. Interior lights clearly visible through windows, creating depth and luxury ambiance. Balanced HDR exposure — interior remains bright without overblown highlights. Physically correct glass behavior with Fresnel reflections. Clear but reflective glazing that mirrors sky gradient, nearby buildings, and landscaping. Avoid warm cinematic grading, sunset bias, or tungsten-like tones.",t))(J||{}),Oe=(t=>(t.NONE="",t.FRONT="Natural daylight enters from the front of the scene. Bright outdoor daylight, realistic sunlight direction, soft indirect bounce light, balanced ambient illumination, preserve the existing camera, composition, and geometry.",t.LEFT="Natural daylight enters from the left side of the scene. Bright outdoor daylight, realistic sunlight direction, soft indirect bounce light, balanced ambient illumination, preserve the existing camera, composition, and geometry.",t.RIGHT="Natural daylight enters from the right side of the scene. Bright outdoor daylight, realistic sunlight direction, soft indirect bounce light, balanced ambient illumination, preserve the existing camera, composition, and geometry",t.SKYLIGHT="Move the primary natural sunlight so it comes from directly above. Keep the camera, architecture, and composition unchanged. Produce realistic overhead daylight with soft global illumination and natural shadows.",t.BEHIND_CAMERA="Natural daylight enters from behind the camera, illuminating the scene naturally. Bright outdoor daylight, realistic sunlight direction, soft indirect bounce light, balanced ambient illumination, preserve the existing camera, composition, and geometry.",t))(Oe||{}),Ur=(t=>(t.CHARACTER_ADAPTATION="CINEMATIC LIFESTYLE STAGING: A person matching the Character Reference photo should appear in this architectural scene. Visually match their appearance, hair, and outfit exactly from the reference photo. Adapt their pose and placement intelligently to the architectural context — if it's a driveway, they might be arriving; if it's a terrace, they might be relaxing. Ensure they look like a high-end architectural lifestyle model, perfectly lit and naturally integrated into the 3D space with correct perspective and shadows.",t.PUB_LIGHT_ON="Preserve the exact original SketchUp architecture, layout, stage design (if present), furniture placement, materials, proportions, and camera angle without changing, redesigning, replacing, or generating new interior elements. Keep the original scene structure exactly as modeled. Enhance only the lighting and atmosphere. Realistic cinematic nightclub or pub lighting with physically accurate volumetric spotlight beams sweeping naturally across the venue (focusing on the stage or performance area if present in the design). Powerful moving head lights with soft beam falloff, realistic light spread, and natural haze interaction. Subtle atmospheric smoke and fog evenly distributed to reveal realistic light rays without covering the architecture. Balanced blue, white, cyan, and purple lighting accents with realistic exposure and controlled brightness. LED glow (including stage or focal area glow with cinematic bloom if a stage or main counter is present) and realistic reflections on existing surfaces. Pyrotechnic spark effects positioned naturally beside the stage area ONLY if a stage exists in the design. Dark industrial ceiling with exposed trusses and hanging speaker arrays enhanced with realistic reflections and shadow depth. Maintain all original SketchUp geometry and interior design exactly as provided. No redesign, no new furniture, no layout modification, no architectural changes. Photorealistic volumetric lighting, realistic light scattering, cinematic nightclub atmosphere, premium entertainment venue mood, architectural photography style, ultra realistic render, 24mm lens perspective with realistic depth.",t.PROJECTOR_LIGHT_ON="Add only the realistic projector light effect from any existing projector in the scene. Preserve the exact architecture, layout, and furniture. Enhance only the projector lighting with physically accurate volumetric light cone scattering, authentic projection beam throw onto the target screen or wall surface, subtle atmospheric dust/haze interaction, and natural ambient light bounce on surrounding surfaces without modifying the projector fixture or scene structure.",t))(Ur||{}),at=(t=>(t.WARM="warm",t.NEUTRAL="neutral",t.COOL="cool",t))(at||{});const vi={warm:"warm white light (3000K)",neutral:"neutral white light (4000K)",cool:"cool white light (6000K)"},Ms=t=>`Turn on all existing recessed ceiling downlights to emit ${vi[t]}. Create realistic light pools from these existing fixtures while preserving the existing daylight and overall scene lighting. Do not invent or add new light fixtures that are not physically modeled in the original geometry.`,Ls=t=>`Turn on cabinet and furniture LED strips with a ${vi[t]} glow.`;var W=(t=>(t.NONE="None",t.LUXURY_HOUSING_ESTATE="Luxury Housing Estate",t.LAKESIDE_MANOR="Lakeside Manor",t.EXCLUSIVE_GATED_COMMUNITY="Exclusive Gated Community",t.MIAMI_WATERFRONT="Exclusive Miami waterfront  Biscayne Bay, surrounded by towering royal palms, coconut palms, dense tropical landscaping, and neighboring luxury estates.  humid subtropical atmosphere, deep blue bay water, lush greenery, captured in professional l real estate photography",t.MODERN_METROPOLIS_DAY="Upscale Vattanak Capital, Phnom Penh office block, 10x10 grey plaza bricks",t.MOUNTAIN="Mountain",t.TROPICAL_ISLAND_BEACH="Tropical Island Beach",t.SEA="Ultra-realistic tropical ocean environment for masterplan aerial view. CRITICAL SEAMLESS ENVIRONMENT RULE: The SketchUp model has a flat green ground plane and white void background — you MUST replace both entirely. The green ground plane must be completely replaced with endless crystal-clear turquoise ocean water extending seamlessly in every direction with no visible ground-plane edges, no flat green surface remnants, no white void, and no artificial boundaries. The water surface must flow naturally around and beneath any structures with realistic shoreline transitions, gentle wave patterns, visible coral reef formations beneath shallow transparent water, soft cyan-to-deep-blue water gradient stretching to the horizon. The white background must become a photorealistic tropical sky with scattered fluffy cumulus clouds, natural golden-hour atmospheric haze, and a smooth horizon where ocean meets sky with no hard edges. Maldives-style lagoon environment, calm gentle ripples across the surface, ultra-detailed natural reflections, realistic sunlight diffusion through water. The entire scene must feel like a single unified real-world aerial drone photograph — no separation between model and ocean, no floating structures, no disconnected elements. Professional aerial drone photography, high dynamic range, natural color grading, luxury travel photography aesthetic, extremely realistic water shading and transparency.",t.NATURAL_LANDSCAPE_MOUNTAIN="Real-world mountain valley environment captured like authentic aerial drone photography. CRITICAL SEAMLESS ENVIRONMENT RULE: The SketchUp model has a flat green ground plane and white void background — you MUST replace both entirely. The flat green ground must be completely replaced with natural imperfect terrain — undulating hillsides, exposed rock, forest clearings, dirt paths, and organic topographic variation flowing seamlessly in every direction with no visible ground-plane edges, no flat green surface, and no artificial boundaries. The white background must become a photorealistic mountain landscape with layered ridgelines, atmospheric haze, and natural sky gradient — absolutely no white void remnants. Authentic Southeast Asian highland landscape with naturally distributed tropical forest density, irregular vegetation growth patterns, realistic tree spacing, natural canopy breakup, exposed terrain variation, and believable ecological layering. Large natural winding rivers and reservoirs integrated organically into the valley floor with realistic scale, natural shoreline irregularities, and subtle sediment coloration. Real atmospheric depth compression — distant mountain ridges gradually lose contrast and saturation through atmospheric scattering while mid-ground remains sharp and detailed. Natural imperfections everywhere: uneven forest density, subtle terrain erosion, realistic road carving, scattered rural structures embedded organically into the landscape. The entire scene must feel like a single unified real-world aerial drone photograph with no separation between model and surroundings, no floating horizon layers, no artificial backdrop appearance. Professional aerial landscape photography, ultra-photorealistic, natural lens optics, physically accurate terrain layering, cinematic but grounded realism.",t.URBAN_EDUCATIONAL_CAMPUS="Large-scale urban educational campus environment captured like authentic drone photography. CRITICAL SEAMLESS ENVIRONMENT RULE: The SketchUp model has a flat green ground plane and white void background — you MUST replace both entirely. The flat green ground must be completely replaced with realistic urban terrain — paved roads, concrete walkways, sports fields, asphalt parking, landscaped courtyards, and natural ground cover flowing seamlessly in every direction with no visible ground-plane edges, no flat green surface, and no artificial boundaries. The white background must become a photorealistic metropolitan skyline with atmospheric haze, layered city blocks, and natural sky — absolutely no white void remnants. Massive city-integrated institutional complex surrounded by dense metropolitan residential districts with realistic urban scale and believable environmental continuity. Background high-rise buildings physically integrated with realistic scale variation, natural spacing, imperfect skyline rhythm, and authentic urban density. Large modern academic campus embedded naturally into city fabric with realistic circulation roads, intersections, pedestrian paths, sports fields, planted courtyards, and believable spatial organization. Dense mature urban tree canopy with realistic vegetation clustering and natural park transitions. Soft environmental haze in distant skyline while maintaining sharp detail around campus core. The entire scene must feel like a single unified real-world aerial drone photograph with no separation between model and surroundings, no floating background towers, no disconnected skyline layers. Professional ultra-photorealistic drone photography, real-world city atmosphere, natural urban depth layering, physically accurate scale relationships.",t.DOWNTOWN_BUSINESS_DISTRICT="Realistic downtown business district masterplan captured from an aerial drone perspective. CRITICAL SEAMLESS ENVIRONMENT RULE: The SketchUp model has a flat green ground plane and white void background — you MUST replace both entirely. The flat green ground must be completely replaced with realistic urban infrastructure — asphalt roads, highway interchanges, city blocks with varied rooftops, commercial parking structures, landscaped median strips, and sidewalks flowing seamlessly in every direction with no visible ground-plane edges, no flat green surface, and no artificial boundaries. The white background must become a photorealistic city skyline with distant downtown towers sitting naturally on the horizon with soft atmospheric haze and proper perspective compression — absolutely no white void remnants. Large mid-ground urban areas, highways, streets, and city blocks naturally connect foreground structures to the distant business district. The skyline has realistic spacing, imperfect building heights, and authentic urban density. The entire scene must feel like a single unified real-world aerial drone photograph with no separation between model and surroundings, no floating towers, no disconnected skyline layers. Professional architectural drone photography, ultra-photorealistic, grounded city realism, realistic lens optics, natural atmospheric perspective.",t.PHNOM_PENH_STREET="Phnom Penh Street",t.MODERN_VILLA_GARDEN="Modern Villa Garden",t.PHNOM_PENH_RIVERSIDE="Phnom Penh Riverside",t.SIEM_REAP_PUB_STREET="Siem Reap Pub Street",t.BOREY_GATED_COMMUNITY="Borey Gated Community",t.RICE_PADDIES="Lush Cambodian countryside featuring saturated lime-green rice fields and tall Borassus palm silhouettes. The scene includes a dirt path cutting through the paddies leading toward a distant, fog-shrouded hill,capturing the moisture and humidity of a tropical rural landscape",t.MEKONG_RIVERSIDE_SUGAR_PALMS="Authentic Cambodian landscape along the serene Mekong River. In the foreground and background, the riverbank is flanked by graceful tall sugar palm trees (Borassus flabellifer) with natural green fronds, tropical riverside flora, a calm reflective river with golden-hour sunlight reflections, wooden boat docks, and soft atmospheric haze. Professional architectural photography, ultra-photorealistic, grounded Cambodian riverside realism.",t.KOH_RONG_BEACH="Koh Rong Beach",t.MONDULKIRI_HIGHLANDS="Mondulkiri Highlands",t.CAMBODIA_NATURAL_LANDSCAPE="Natural Cambodian landscape masterplan context captured from aerial drone perspective. CRITICAL SEAMLESS ENVIRONMENT RULE: The SketchUp model has a flat green ground plane and white void background — you MUST replace both entirely. The flat green ground must be completely replaced with authentic Cambodian natural terrain — red laterite earth, wild tall grasses, scattered mossy stones, dirt pathways, rice paddy edges, and organic topographic variation flowing seamlessly in every direction with no visible ground-plane edges, no flat green surface, and no artificial boundaries. The white background must become a photorealistic Cambodian rural landscape with dense tropical forest, native sugar palm trees (Borassus flabellifer), banana groves, and distant blue-green mountain ridgelines under a warm tropical sky — absolutely no white void remnants. Lush tropical vegetation with natural density variation, wild undergrowth, realistic earth tones, and untamed organic environment. The entire scene must feel like a single unified real-world aerial drone photograph with no separation between model and surroundings, no floating elements, no disconnected background layers. Professional aerial landscape photography, ultra-photorealistic, organic and natural Cambodian environment.",t.INTERIOR_CITY_SKYLINE="Bright natural daylight entering through large floor-to-ceiling glass windows, creating soft global illumination and natural light bounce across the interior. Exterior environment visible through the glass with a realistic modern city skyline, blue sky, and atmospheric haze.",t.INTERIOR_TROPICAL="Bright natural daylight entering through large floor-to-ceiling glass windows, creating soft global illumination and natural light bounce across the interior. Exterior environment visible through the glass featuring a dense, private tropical courtyard. To avoid any plastic appearance, prioritize organic imperfection: leaves must have non-uniform surface roughness, varied matte-to-satin finishes, and realistic botanical flaws like irregular edges and subtle color variations. Emphasize physically accurate subsurface scattering with rich, velvety textures and complex light absorption. The foliage should feel heavy and organic, with deep natural greens and zero artificial specular sheen, creating a truly cinematic and hyper-realistic secluded oasis.",t.INTERIOR_GARDEN="Bright natural daylight entering through large floor-to-ceiling glass windows, creating soft global illumination and natural light bounce across the interior. Exterior environment visible through the glass with a beautifully manicured private garden, flowering plants, neatly trimmed hedges, and peaceful outdoor landscaping.",t.INTERIOR_WHITE="Bright natural daylight entering through large floor-to-ceiling glass windows, creating soft global illumination and natural light bounce across the interior. Exterior environment visible through the glass as a clean, bright, and minimalist white void or high-key studio background, emphasizing the architectural form and light within the space.",t.INTERIOR_RICE_FIELD="Bright natural daylight entering through large floor-to-ceiling glass windows, creating soft global illumination and natural light bounce across the interior. Exterior environment visible through the glass with lush tropical banana leaves, palm trees, and a serene green rice field in the background.",t.INTERIOR_POOL_TERRACE="Bright natural daylight entering through large floor-to-ceiling glass windows, creating soft global illumination and natural light bounce across the interior. Exterior environment visible through the glass with a modern luxury swimming pool, wooden deck terrace, and manicured green privacy hedges.",t.INTERIOR_PHNOM_PENH_TOWN_HOUSE="Bright natural daylight entering through large floor-to-ceiling glass windows, creating soft global illumination and natural light bounce across the interior. Elevated first-floor perspective looking down at a bustling Phnom Penh urban street; cars and motorcycles are driving toward the window through a busy city intersection, with local shophouses and vibrant street life visible below.",t.GREEN_ECO_CITY_MASTERPLAN="Large-scale sustainable eco-city masterplan captured from high-altitude professional drone camera. CRITICAL SEAMLESS ENVIRONMENT RULE: The SketchUp model has a flat green ground plane and white void background — you MUST replace both entirely. The flat green ground must be completely replaced with realistic eco-city terrain — permeable green pathways, bioswale water channels, landscaped parks, solar-paneled rooftops, paved pedestrian boulevards, and natural ground cover flowing seamlessly in every direction with no visible ground-plane edges, no flat green surface, and no artificial boundaries. The white background must become a photorealistic natural landscape with rolling green hills, distant forest canopy, and warm atmospheric sky gradient — absolutely no white void remnants. Modern low-carbon green urban district with smart architecture, integrated parks, winding waterways, vibrant organic landscape design, and sustainable infrastructure. The entire scene must feel like a single unified real-world aerial drone photograph with no separation between model and surroundings, no floating structures, no disconnected background. Clean realistic sunlight with soft shadows, perfect scale, and professional architectural presentation quality.",t.COASTAL_RESORT_MASTERPLAN="Luxury waterfront coastal resort masterplan captured in panoramic aerial drone photograph. CRITICAL SEAMLESS ENVIRONMENT RULE: The SketchUp model has a flat green ground plane and white void background — you MUST replace both entirely. The flat green ground must be completely replaced with realistic coastal terrain — white sand beaches, coral-embedded shallow waters, natural shoreline transitions, manicured resort lawns, stone pathways, and wooden boardwalks flowing seamlessly in every direction with no visible ground-plane edges, no flat green surface, and no artificial boundaries. The white background must become a photorealistic tropical ocean horizon with crystal-clear turquoise lagoons, gentle wave patterns, scattered tropical islands in the distance, and warm atmospheric sky — absolutely no white void remnants. Organic pathways connecting ocean villas, lush tropical landscaping with tall coconut palms, yacht marina, high-end recreational zones. The entire scene must feel like a single unified real-world aerial drone photograph with no separation between model and surroundings, no floating structures, no disconnected ocean. Vibrant natural lighting, realistic water transparency, soft horizon gradient, and professional resort photography quality.",t.MODERN_METROPOLIS_MASTERPLAN="Dense high-rise modern metropolitan masterplan of Phnom Penh, Cambodia. CRITICAL SEAMLESS ENVIRONMENT RULE: The SketchUp model has a flat green ground plane and white void background — you MUST replace both entirely. Extend the environment seamlessly in every direction with no visible ground-plane edges, no white void, no abrupt cutoffs, and no artificial boundaries. The green ground must transition into a realistic, continuous Phnom Penh urban landscape — paved roads, city blocks, mature tropical tree canopy, rooftops, and infrastructure stretching naturally to the horizon. The white background must become a photorealistic Phnom Penh sky with the Mekong and Tonle Sap rivers visible in the distance, soft atmospheric haze over the cityscape, and a natural gradient horizon. Futuristic central business district with towering glass skyscrapers, structured street grids, manicured green urban plazas, and integrated highway networks. Captured from an elevated bird's-eye drone perspective in clear daylight with crisp shadows, realistic scale, and professional architectural presentation quality. The entire scene must feel like a single unified real-world aerial drone photograph with no separation between the model and its surroundings.",t.MOUNTAIN_VALLEY_MASTERPLAN="Large-scale eco-tourism mountain valley masterplan captured from realistic high-altitude aerial drone perspective. CRITICAL SEAMLESS ENVIRONMENT RULE: The SketchUp model has a flat green ground plane and white void background — you MUST replace both entirely. The flat green ground must be completely replaced with natural mountain terrain — undulating forested hillsides, exposed rocky outcrops, winding dirt trails, terraced clearings, river banks, and organic topographic variation flowing seamlessly in every direction with no visible ground-plane edges, no flat green surface, and no artificial boundaries. The white background must become a photorealistic mountain panorama with layered forested ridgelines receding into atmospheric haze, snow-capped distant peaks, and natural sky gradient — absolutely no white void remnants. Nestled among high-altitude forested peaks, winding rivers, organic terraced villas, rustic pathways, rustic wood and stone pavilions, and scenic overlook spots. The entire scene must feel like a single unified real-world aerial drone photograph with no separation between model and surroundings, no floating structures, no disconnected mountain backdrop. Natural atmospheric depth compression, soft mountain haze, unified environmental lighting, and professional landscape photography quality.",t.SIEM_REAP_ANGKOR_MASTERPLAN="Masterplan set in the Siem Reap Angkor archaeological heritage zone, Cambodia. CRITICAL SEAMLESS ENVIRONMENT RULE: The SketchUp model has a flat green ground plane and white void background — you MUST replace both entirely. The flat green ground must be completely replaced with authentic Siem Reap terrain — ancient laterite and sandstone pathways, dense tropical jungle canopy, moat waterways surrounding temple ruins, red-earth roads, scattered ancient stone ruins partially reclaimed by giant strangler fig tree roots, and organic archaeological landscape flowing seamlessly in every direction with no visible ground-plane edges, no flat green surface, and no artificial boundaries. The white background must become a photorealistic Siem Reap panorama with the iconic Angkor Wat silhouette visible in the distance, dense jungle canopy stretching to the horizon, scattered temple spires rising above the treeline, morning mist hovering over ancient reservoirs (barays), and warm golden tropical sky — absolutely no white void remnants. Authentic Khmer heritage atmosphere with weathered sandstone textures, moss-covered ancient walls, sacred lotus ponds, and traditional Cambodian village structures nestled among the trees. The entire scene must feel like a single unified real-world aerial drone photograph with no separation between model and surroundings. Professional aerial heritage photography, ultra-photorealistic, warm golden-hour Cambodian sunlight, atmospheric jungle haze.",t.SIHANOUKVILLE_COAST_MASTERPLAN="Masterplan set along the Sihanoukville coastal development zone, Cambodia. CRITICAL SEAMLESS ENVIRONMENT RULE: The SketchUp model has a flat green ground plane and white void background — you MUST replace both entirely. The flat green ground must be completely replaced with authentic Sihanoukville coastal terrain — white sand beaches, rocky headlands, paved coastal roads, tropical garden resorts, scattered coconut palms, beachfront promenades, and natural shoreline transitions flowing seamlessly in every direction with no visible ground-plane edges, no flat green surface, and no artificial boundaries. The white bac