 feel like a single unified real-world aerial drone photograph with no separation between model and surroundings. Professional riverside aerial photography, ultra-photorealistic, warm golden-hour Cambodian atmosphere, soft river reflections.",t.KEP_SEASIDE_MASTERPLAN="Masterplan set in the Kep seaside resort area, Cambodia. CRITICAL SEAMLESS ENVIRONMENT RULE: The SketchUp model has a flat green ground plane and white void background — you MUST replace both entirely. The flat green ground must be completely replaced with authentic Kep coastal terrain — rocky shoreline with natural tidal pools, crab market jetties, overgrown ruins of 1960s French colonial villas, winding coastal roads through pepper hills, mangrove edges, and natural seaside landscape flowing seamlessly in every direction with no visible ground-plane edges, no flat green surface, and no artificial boundaries. The white background must become a photorealistic Kep seascape with the calm Gulf of Thailand waters, Rabbit Island (Koh Tonsay) clearly visible offshore, scattered traditional wooden fishing boats, distant Vietnamese Phú Quốc island silhouette on the horizon, and warm tropical sky with soft atmospheric haze — absolutely no white void remnants. Elegant but relaxed Cambodian seaside town character with the iconic Kep crab statue area, hillside villas nestled among tropical vegetation, and Kep National Park forested hills. The entire scene must feel like a single unified real-world aerial drone photograph with no separation between model and surroundings. Professional seaside aerial photography, ultra-photorealistic, serene coastal atmosphere, warm Cambodian daylight.",t.KOH_RONG_ISLAND_MASTERPLAN="Masterplan set on Koh Rong Island, Cambodia. CRITICAL SEAMLESS ENVIRONMENT RULE: The SketchUp model has a flat green ground plane and white void background — you MUST replace both entirely. The flat green ground must be completely replaced with authentic Koh Rong island terrain — pristine white sand beaches, shallow turquoise lagoons with visible sandy seabed, dense untouched tropical jungle interior, natural rock formations, wooden boardwalk paths through mangrove areas, and organic island landscape flowing seamlessly in every direction with no visible ground-plane edges, no flat green surface, and no artificial boundaries. The white background must become a photorealistic tropical island seascape with crystal-clear turquoise-to-deep-blue ocean surrounding the island, distant smaller islands visible on the horizon, traditional longtail boats anchored in the bay, bioluminescent-quality clear water, and brilliant tropical sky with dramatic white clouds — absolutely no white void remnants. Untouched paradise island atmosphere with pristine beaches, dense coconut palm groves, natural rock headlands dividing beaches, and rustic island village character. The entire scene must feel like a single unified real-world aerial drone photograph with no separation between model and surroundings. Professional island aerial photography, ultra-photorealistic, vivid tropical colors, crystal-clear water transparency.",t.TONLE_SAP_FLOATING_MASTERPLAN="Masterplan set on the Tonle Sap Great Lake floating community, Cambodia. CRITICAL SEAMLESS ENVIRONMENT RULE: The SketchUp model has a flat green ground plane and white void background — you MUST replace both entirely. The flat green ground must be completely replaced with the vast Tonle Sap lake surface — expansive muddy-brown freshwater lake with realistic sediment coloration, floating hyacinth patches, traditional Cambodian floating house clusters, wooden boat channels between dwellings, submerged mangrove forest edges, and organic aquatic landscape flowing seamlessly in every direction with no visible ground-plane edges, no flat green surface, and no artificial boundaries. The white background must become a photorealistic Tonle Sap panorama with the enormous lake stretching to the horizon, distant flooded forest (prek) treeline, scattered fishing boats with traditional nets, floodplain vegetation, and dramatic Cambodian sky with towering monsoon clouds — absolutely no white void remnants. Authentic Cambodian floating village atmosphere with colorful painted wooden houses on stilts, floating schools and pagodas, fish farms with net enclosures, and bustling waterway activity. The entire scene must feel like a single unified real-world aerial drone photograph with no separation between model and surroundings. Professional lake aerial photography, ultra-photorealistic, warm tropical atmosphere, realistic muddy water tones.",t.BATTAMBANG_HERITAGE_MASTERPLAN="Masterplan set in Battambang heritage city, Cambodia. CRITICAL SEAMLESS ENVIRONMENT RULE: The SketchUp model has a flat green ground plane and white void background — you MUST replace both entirely. The flat green ground must be completely replaced with authentic Battambang urban terrain — French colonial-era wide boulevards, traditional Khmer shophouse blocks with faded Art Deco facades, the winding Sangker River with its stone-banked embankment, mature rain tree-lined avenues, traditional market areas, and organic heritage city landscape flowing seamlessly in every direction with no visible ground-plane edges, no flat green surface, and no artificial boundaries. The white background must become a photorealistic Battambang panorama with flat Cambodian plains stretching to the horizon, Phnom Sampeau and Phnom Banan temple hills visible in the distance, patchwork rice paddies surrounding the city, scattered sugar palm silhouettes, and warm golden Cambodian sky — absolutely no white void remnants. Charming Cambodian provincial heritage city character with colorful colonial buildings, traditional bamboo train tracks, Wat Ek Phnom temple ruins nearby, and authentic rural-urban Cambodian atmosphere. The entire scene must feel like a single unified real-world aerial drone photograph with no separation between model and surroundings. Professional heritage city aerial photography, ultra-photorealistic, warm nostalgic Cambodian atmosphere, soft golden-hour lighting.",t.MONDULKIRI_HIGHLAND_MASTERPLAN="Masterplan set in the Mondulkiri highland plateau, Cambodia. CRITICAL SEAMLESS ENVIRONMENT RULE: The SketchUp model has a flat green ground plane and white void background — you MUST replace both entirely. The flat green ground must be completely replaced with authentic Mondulkiri highland terrain — rolling red laterite hills covered in wild grasslands, pine forest clearings, Bousra waterfall cascades, winding dirt roads through indigenous Bunong village areas, elephant sanctuary meadows, and organic highland landscape flowing seamlessly in every direction with no visible ground-plane edges, no flat green surface, and no artificial boundaries. The white background must become a photorealistic Mondulkiri panorama with endless rolling green hills stretching to the horizon, dense tropical forest canopy in the valleys, morning mist settling in highland depressions, scattered traditional Bunong longhouse structures, and dramatic highland sky with towering clouds — absolutely no white void remnants. Unique Cambodian highland atmosphere distinctly different from lowland Cambodia — cooler climate vegetation, pine trees mixed with tropical species, red earth contrasting with vivid green grasslands, wild elephant habitat. The entire scene must feel like a single unified real-world aerial drone photograph with no separation between model and surroundings. Professional highland aerial photography, ultra-photorealistic, dramatic Mondulkiri atmosphere, misty highland depth.",t.RIVERSIDE_PENINSULA_MASTERPLAN="Riverside residential peninsula masterplan set along a winding river curving around a green land tongue. CRITICAL SEAMLESS ENVIRONMENT RULE: The SketchUp model has a flat green ground plane and white void background — you MUST replace both entirely. The flat green ground must be completely replaced with realistic peninsular terra