graph with no separation between model and surroundings. Professional industrial architecture photography, ultra-photorealistic, clear logistics zoning, realistic scale, and clean technical presentation quality.",t.CAMBODIAN_RICE_PADDIES_MASTERPLAN="Masterplan set in the Cambodian rural rice plains, captured from an elevated aerial drone perspective. CRITICAL SEAMLESS ENVIRONMENT RULE: The SketchUp model has a flat green ground plane and white void background — you MUST replace both entirely. The flat green ground must be completely replaced with authentic Cambodian agricultural terrain — vast patchwork grids of flooded and lush emerald-green rice paddies, reflective shallow waters, earthen dikes and bunds (phleuu srae), narrow irrigation canals, reddish laterite dirt paths, and organic agricultural landscape flowing seamlessly in every direction with no visible ground-plane edges, no flat green surface, and no artificial boundaries. The white background must become a photorealistic Cambodian rural panorama with iconic tall sugar palm trees (Borassus flabellifer) standing majestically along paddy dikes, distant blue-green mountain silhouettes fading into soft atmospheric haze, endless checkerboard green fields stretching to the horizon, and a warm golden tropical sky with soft cumulus clouds — absolutely no white void remnants. Authentic Cambodian countryside atmosphere with traditional wooden stilt farmhouses nestled beneath coconut palms and banana groves, calm reflective waters reflecting the morning or golden-hour sky, small irrigation sluice gates, and tranquil rural Khmer living. The entire scene must feel like a single unified real-world aerial drone photograph with no separation between model and surroundings. Professional aerial drone landscape photography, ultra-photorealistic, authentic Cambodian countryside colors, natural atmospheric depth.",t.POIPET_BAVET_LOGISTICS_HUB_MASTERPLAN="Masterplan set in the Poipet and Bavet cross-border special economic zone and logistics hub corridor, Cambodia. CRITICAL SEAMLESS ENVIRONMENT RULE: The SketchUp model has a flat green ground plane and white void background — you MUST replace both entirely. The flat green ground must be completely replaced with authentic border logistics infrastructure — wide heavy-duty concrete and asphalt transport corridors, container staging yards with organized colorful ISO freight shipping containers, customs clearance plazas, solar-paneled warehouse rooftops, truck parking bays, landscaped green buffer swales, and industrial logistics district terrain flowing seamlessly in every direction with no visible ground-plane edges, no flat green surface, and no artificial boundaries. The white background must become a photorealistic cross-border industrial panorama with active expressway overpasses, arterial highway connections, distant modern factory silhouettes, transmission towers, and expansive flat Cambodian plains stretching toward the horizon under a realistic daytime sky with soft atmospheric haze — absolutely no white void remnants. Modern industrial and special economic zone character with clear freight circulation routes, security gates, weigh stations, and high-efficiency cargo logistics facilities. The entire scene must feel like a single unified real-world aerial drone photograph with no separation between model and surroundings. Professional aerial drone industrial photography, ultra-photorealistic, high-precision zoning, physically accurate scale and perspective.",t.PPAP_PORT_LOGISTICS_CITY_MASTERPLAN="Masterplan set around the Phnom Penh Autonomous Port (PPAP LM17) logistics city and container terminal along the Lower Mekong River, Cambodia. CRITICAL SEAMLESS ENVIRONMENT RULE: The SketchUp model has a flat green ground plane and white void background — you MUST replace both entirely. The flat green ground must be completely replaced with authentic river port logistics terrain — deep-water river quay terminals, massive STS and gantry container cranes, neat stacks of intermodal freight containers, wide heavy-vehicle access boulevards, bonded warehouse complexes, customs inspection facilities, and industrial riverbank landscape flowing seamlessly in every direction with no visible ground-plane edges, no flat green surface, and no artificial boundaries. The white background must become a photorealistic lower Mekong River panorama — expansive silt-rich river waters with realistic sediment flow and gentle ripples, cargo barges, container vessels and tugboats navigating the waterways, lush tropical riverbank vegetation with scattered sugar palms, and distant suburban Phnom Penh horizon with soft atmospheric haze — absolutely no white void remnants. Modern multimodal river port hub atmosphere combining international trade infrastructure with authentic Cambodian river landscape. The entire scene must feel like a single unified real-world aerial drone photograph with no separation between model and surroundings. Professional aerial drone port photography, ultra-photorealistic, realistic water reflections and crane infrastructure, crisp natural daylight.",t))(W||{}),Xe=(t=>(t.NONE="",t.CLEAR_BLUE_SKY="Clear blue sky",t.PARTLY_CLOUDY="Partly Cloudy",t.OVERCAST="Overcast",t.LIGHT_RAIN="Light Rain",t.RAINY="Rainy",t.STORMY="Stormy",t.THUNDERSTORM="Thunderstorm",t.FOGGY="Foggy",t.HAZY="Hazy",t.DUST_STORM="Dust Storm",t.SNOWY="Snowy",t.BLIZZARD="Blizzard",t.AFTER_RAIN="After Rain",t))(Xe||{}),Vt=(t=>(t.NONE="None",t.LIGHT_BREEZE="WIND: Subtle gentle breeze. Soft motion in the foliage, light rustling of tree leaves, and gentle swaying of thinner branches. Create a sense of calm, living atmosphere.",t.STRONG_WIND="WIND: Powerful dynamic wind. Trees swaying significantly, leaves rustling vigorously with visible motion, branches bending under the force. The environment should feel energetic and lively with clear sense of atmospheric movement.",t))(Vt||{}),De=(t=>(t.SIMILAR="Similar",t.MODERN="Modern",t.FUTURISTIC="Futuristic",t.NEO_FUTURISM="Neo-Futurism",t.DECONSTRUCTIVISM="Deconstructivism",t.PARAMETRIC="Parametric",t.ORGANIC="Organic",t.CONTEMPORARY="Contemporary",t.MINIMALIST="Minimalist",t.INDUSTRIAL="Industrial",t.CLASSIC="Classic",t.NEO_CLASSICAL="Neo-Classical",t.FRENCH_COLONIAL="French Colonial",t.GOTHIC="Gothic",t.ART_DECO="Art Deco",t.RUSTIC="Rustic",t.BRUTALISM="Brutalism",t.SUSTAINABLE_GREEN_ARCHITECTURE="Sustainable Green Architecture",t.RAINSCREEN_CLADDING="Rainscreen Cladding",t.KHMER_MODERN="Khmer Modern",t.NEW_KHMER_ARCHITECTURE="New Khmer Architecture",t.KHMER_TRADITIONAL_HOUSE="Khmer Traditional House",t))(De||{}),ha=(t=>(t.LIVING_ROOM="Living Room",t.KITCHEN="Kitchen",t.BEDROOM="Bedroom",t.BATHROOM="Bathroom",t.DINING_ROOM="Dining Room",t.HOME_OFFICE="Home Office",t.CLOTHES_ROOM="Clothes Room",t.SWIMMING="Swimming",t))(ha||{}),Ut=(t=>(t.MODERN="Modern",t.SCANDINAVIAN="Scandinavian",t.INDUSTRIAL="Industrial",t.MIDCENTURY_MODERN="Mid-Century Modern",t.LUXURY="Luxury",t.FARMHOUSE="Farmhouse",t.COASTAL="Coastal",t.STANDARD="Standard",t.NEOCLASSICAL="Neoclassical",t))(Ut||{}),Nt=(t=>(t.NONE="None",t.SUBTLE="Camera: Apply a subtle depth of field effect focus on building to the rendering.",t.MODERATE="Camera: Apply a moderate depth of field effect focus on building to the rendering.",t.STRONG="Camera: Apply a strong depth of field effect focus on building to the rendering.",t))(Nt||{}),It=(t=>(t.NONE="None",t.LIGHT="Photography: Incorporate light motion blur on moving Vechicles elements and people that repesent in scene.",t.MEDIUM="Photography: Incorporate medium motion blur on moving Vechicles elements and people that repesent in scene.",t.HEAVY="Photography: Incorporate heavy motion blur on moving Vechicles elements and people that repesent in scene.",t))(It||{}),yt=(t=>(t.NONE="None",t.LIGHT_CAUSTIC="WATER EFFECTS: Clear light blue swimming pool. Render exceptionally soft, photorealistic sun caustics on the pool floor. NO sharp glowing lines or unnatural webs. Natural water depth and smooth light dispersion only.",t.DARK_BLUE_CAUSTIC="WATER EFFECTS: Deep indigo blue pool water. Add subtle, delicate light refraction on the underwater tiles. The caustics must be completely authentic and softly blurred by water depth. Avoid artificial contrast.",t.DEEP_EMERALD_CAUSTIC="WATER EFFECTS: Luxurious dark teal and emerald pool water. Generate very soft, organic sunlight caustics fading into the deep water. Must look like a real photograph, zero neon or sharp lighting.",t))(yt||{}),xt=(t=>(t.ARCHITECTURE="architecture",t.VIDEO="VIDEO",t.THREESIXTY="threesixty",t.POST_PRODUCTION="postproduction",t))(xt||{}),A=(t=>(t.FURNITURE="Furniture",t.INDOOR_FURNITURE="High-end contemporary indoor furniture set with PBR materials",t.VEHICLES="Vehicles",t.MOTORCYCLES="Motorcycles",t.PEOPLE="CINEMATIC LIFESTYLE MODELS: Elegant luxury asian people behaving like professional high-end architectural models. They should be performing intelligent actions based on the scene context — walking along paths, enjoying the terrace, entering the building, or relaxing. Ensure perfect integration with the environment's lighting and shadows.",t.OUTDOOR_PEOPLE="Outdoor People",t.INDOOR_PEOPLE="Indoor People",t.STREET_Furniture="Street Furniture",t.GARDEN_STRUCTURES="Garden Structures",t.GARDEN_TREES="Garden Trees",t.GARDEN_PLANTS="Garden Plants",t.LANDSCAPING_FEATURES="Landscaping Features",t.WOODEN_PERGOLA="Wooden Pergola",t.STONE_PATHWAY="Stone Pathway",t.KOI_POND="Koi Pond",t.ZEN_GARDEN_ROCKS="Zen Garden Rocks",t.OUTDOOR_SEATING="Outdoor Seating",t.GARDEN_BENCH="Garden Bench",t.OUTDOOR_LANTERNS="Outdoor Lanterns",t.BAMBOO_FENCE="Bamboo Fence",t.PLANT_PONG_PONG="Cerbera odollam (Pong Pong Tree)",t.PLANT_ROYAL_PALM="Roystonea regia (Royal Palm)",t.PLANT_TEMBUSU="Cyrtophyllum fragrans (Tembusu)",t.PLANT_FRANGIPANI="Plumeria (Frangipani)",t.PLANT_MANGO="Mango Tree",t.PLANT_SUGAR_PALM="Borassus flabellifer (Sugar Palm)",t.PLANT_COCONUT_PALM="tall coconut palm trees with layered fronds",t.PLANT_RAIN_TREE="Samanea saman (Rain Tree)",t.PLANT_BACKGROUND_TREES="Background Trees",t.PLANT_STAKED_GARDEN_TREE="Staked Garden Tree",t.PLANT_MILLINGTONIA="Millingtonia hortensis",t.FLOWERING_BUSHES="Flowering Bushes",t.HANGING_PLANTS="Hanging Plants",t.PLANT_CRAPE_JASMINE="Crape Jasmine",t.PLANT_DWARF_MURRAYA="Dwarf Murraya",t.PLANT_RED_LIP="Red Lip",t.PLANT_DRACAENA="Dracaena",t.PLANT_CROTON="Croton",t.PLANT_IXORA="Ixora",t.PLANT_HIBISCUS="Hibiscus",t.PLANT_BOUGAINVILLEA="Bougainvillea",t.PLANT_MONDO_GRASS="Mondo Grass",t.PLANT_VARIEGATED_GROUND="Varigated Ground Cover",t.PLANT_SMALL_HEDGE="Small Hedge",t.PLANT_FENCE_HEDGE="Fence Hedge",t.PLANT_CALATHEA_LUTEA="Calathea Lutea",t.PLANT_BIRD_OF_PARADISE="Bird of Paradise",t.PLANT_HAWAIIAN_TI="Hawaiian Ti",t.PLANT_TARO="Taro",t.PLANT_LUSH_FERNS="Lush Ferns",t.PLANT_MANICURED_HEDGES="Manicured Hedges",t.PLANT_ANCIENT_OLIVE="Ancient Olive",t.PLANT_ARAUCARIA="Norfolk Island Pine",t.PLANT_ARAUCARIA_SUPPORTED="Include established Araucaria heterophylla trees 5-10 meters tall with wooden tree supports",t.PLANT_SCULPTURAL_PALM_LINED="Include mature sculptural palm trees lined precisely",t.PLANT_MONSTERA="Monstera",t.PLANT_LEMON_BUTTON_FERN="Lemon Button Fern",t.PLANT_STRELITZIA_NICOLAI="Strelitzia Nicolai",t.DRIVEWAY_TILED="Tiled Driveway",t.DRIVEWAY_MODERN_TILED="Dark stone paired with textured, stamped grey concrete for a moder, multi-tonal driveway",t.WOODEN_DECK="Wooden Deck",t.REFLECTING_POOL_FOREGROUND="Reflecting Pool",t.MANICURED_LAWN_FOREGROUND="Manicured emerald-green lawns",t.GRAVEL_PATH_FOREGROUND="Gravel Path",t.FLOWER_BED_FOREGROUND="Flower Bed",t.RICE_PADDY_FOREGROUND="Rice Paddy Foreground",t.LANDSCAPE_LIGHTING="Landscape Lighting",t.NATURAL_WATERFALL="Natural Waterfall",t.STEPPING_STONES="Stepping Stones",t.TROPICAL_UNDERGROWTH="Tropical Undergrowth",t.LOTUS_POND="Lotus Pond",t.CLASSIC_VILLA_GARDEN="Classic Villa Garden",t.MANSION_VILLA_GARDEN="Mansion Villa Garden",t.MODERN_LANDSCAPE="Modern Landscape",t.VILLA_MANSION_FOUNTAIN="Villa Mansion Fountain",t.LUXURY_SWIMMING_POOL="Luxury Swimming Pool",t.GRAB_DRIVER="Grab Driver on Motorcycle",t.FOREGROUND_OVERHANGING_TREES="FOREGROUND VEGETATION: Add beautiful overhanging tree branches with lush green leaves framing the top and sides of the frame. Cast complex, artistic dappled tree shadows across the asphalt street and pavement.",t.FOREGROUND_DAPPLED_TREE_SHADOWS="FOREGROUND: dappled tree shadows (13:30), subtle warm ambient highlights.",t.FOREGROUND_FRAMING_SHADE_TREE="FOREGROUND LANDSCAPING: A mature broad-canopy shade tree with gently spreading branches and medium-density green leaves. Tree partially frames the house from the side, allowing sunlight to filter through the foliage. Natural, well-maintained residential landscape tree.",t.FOREGROUND_STREET="STREETSCAPE: In the immediate foreground, show a clean, high-end side walk and asphalt street with concrete pixel details.",t.HARDSCAPE_FLOOR_TILED="Hardscape Floor Tiled",t.SIDEWALK_AND_STREET="Sidewalk and Street",t.DAMAGED_STREET="Damaged Street",t.SPIDER_LILY_FOREGROUND="foreground spider lily flowers (Hymenocallis littoralis), shallow depth of field, soft blurred foreground, cinematic composition",t))(A||{}),js=(t=>(t.NONE="none",t.STATIC="static",t.DOLLY_IN="dolly_in",t.DOLLY_OUT="dolly_out",t.PAN_LEFT="pan_left",t.PAN_RIGHT="pan_right",t.TILT_UP="tilt_up",t.TILT_DOWN="tilt_down",t.GLIDE_LEFT="glide_left",t.GLIDE_RIGHT="glide_right",t.AMBIENT_MOTION="ambient_motion",t.DAY_TO_NIGHT="day_to_night",t.AERIAL_REVEAL="aerial_reveal",t.ORBIT_LEFT="orbit_left",t.ORBIT_RIGHT="orbit_right",t.CUSTOM="custom",t))(js||{});const _s={headerTitle:{en:"Sal AI Studio",kh:"សំបុក AI"},backToApp:{en:"Back to App",kh:"ត្រឡប់ទៅកម្មវិធីវិញ"},backToHome:{en:"Back to Home",kh:"ត្រឡប់ទៅទំព័រដើម"},apiKeyStatusValid:{en:"API Key Valid",kh:"API Key ត្រឹមត្រូវ"},apiKeyStatusChecking:{en:"Checking...",kh:"កំពុងពិនិត្យ..."},apiKeyStatusInvalid:{en:"Invalid API Key",kh:"API Key មិនត្រឹមត្រូវ"},apiKeyStatusNetworkError:{en:"Network Error",kh:"បញ្ហាបណ្តាញ"},apiKeyStatusNetworkIdle:{en:"Not Set",kh:"មិនទាន់កំណត់"},apiKeyStatusIdle:{en:"Not Set",kh:"មិនទាន់កំណត់"},updateApiKey:{en:"Update API Key",kh:"កែប្រែ API Key"},setApiKey:{en:"Set API Key",kh:"កំណត់ API Key"},appearance:{en:"Appearance",kh:"រូបរាង"},mode:{en:"Mode",kh:"ម៉ូដ"},themeColor:{en:"Accent Color",kh:"ពណ៌"},light:{en:"Light",kh:"ភ្លឺ"},dark:{en:"Dark",kh:"ងងឹត"},on:{en:"ON",kh:"បើក"},off:{en:"OFF",kh:"បិទ"},background:{en:"Background",kh:"ផ្ទៃខាងក្រោយ"},bgParticles:{en:"Particles",kh:"គ្រាប់ល្អិត"},bgModern:{en:"Modern Glow",kh:"ពន្លឺទំនើប"},bgGlassVibe:{en:"Glass Vibe",kh:"កញ្ចក់ថ្លា"},bgNone:{en:"Classic Black",kh:"ខ្មៅបុរាណ"},donate:{en:"Donate",kh:"បរិច្ចាគ"},logout:{en:"Sign Out",kh:"ចាកចេញ"},getApiKey:{en:"Get API Key",kh:"យក API Key"},resources:{en:"Resources",kh:"ធនធាន"},welcomeTitle:{en:"Welcome to Sombok AI",kh:"សូមស្វាគមន៍មកកាន់ សំបុក AI"},version:{en:"Version ",kh:"ជំនាន់ "},welcomeButton:{en:"Get Started",kh:"ចាប់ផ្តើម"},usageLimitTitle:{en:"Daily Usage Limit",kh:"ដែនកំណត់ប្រើប្រាស់ប្រចាំថ្ងៃ"},welcomeFeature1Title:{en:"Upload & Transform",kh:"បញ្ចូល & បំប្លែង"},welcomeFeature2Title:{en:"Advanced Controls",kh:"ការកំណត់កម្រិតខ្ពស់"},welcomeFeature3Title:{en:"Drawing Tools",kh:"ឧបករណ៍គូរ"},donateTitle:{en:"Support Sombok AI",kh:"គាំទ្រ សំបុក AI"},close:{en:"Close",kh:"បិទ"},apiKeyTitle:{en:"Set API Key",kh:"កំណត់ API Key"},apiKeyRequired:{en:"API Key Required",kh:"ត្រូវការ API Key"},yourApiKey:{en:"Your API Key",kh:"API Key របស់អ្នក"},saveKey:{en:"Save Key",kh:"រក្សាទុក Key"},history:{en:"History",kh:"ប្រវត្តិ"},useAsBase:{en:"Use as Base",kh:"ប្រើជាមូលដ្ឋាន"},sendToEditor:{en:"Send to Editor",kh:"បញ្ជូនទៅកន្លែងកែ"},saveImage:{en:"Save Image",kh:"រក្សាទុករូបភាព"},saveAll:{en:"Save as ZIP",kh:"រក្សាទុកជា ZIP"},cropImage:{en:"Crop",kh:"កាត់"},cancelCrop:{en:"Cancel",kh:"បោះបង់"},resetCrop:{en:"Reset",kh:"កំណត់ឡើងវិញ"},applyCrop:{en:"Apply",kh:"អនុវត្ត"},featureArchitecture:{en:"Arch | Interior",kh:"ស្ថាបត្យកម្ម | ខាងក្នុង"},featurePostProduction:{en:"Color",kh:"ពណ៌"},featureProduct:{en:"Product",kh:"ផលិតផល"},featureVideo:{en:"Video",kh:"វីដេអូ"},featureEditImage:{en:"Edit Image",kh:"កែរូបភាព"},controlsTab:{en:"Controls",kh:"ការកំណត់"},step1_edit:{en:"1. Upload Image",kh:"១. បញ្ចូលរូបភាព"},changeImage:{en:"Change",kh:"ផ្លាស់ប្តូរ"},selectImage:{en:"Select Image",kh:"ជ្រើសរើសរូបភាព"},canvasActions:{en:"Canvas Actions",kh:"សកម្មភាពផ្ទាំងក្រណាត់"},expandCanvas:{en:"Expand Canvas",kh:"ពង្រីកផ្ទាំងក្រណាត់"},step3_edit:{en:"3. Description",kh:"៣. ការពិពណ៌នា"},applyEdit:{en:"Render Edit",kh:"Render ការកែប្រែ"},resetAll:{en:"Reset All",kh:"កំណត់ឡើងវិញទាំងអស់"},resolution:{en:"Resolution",kh:"គុណភាព"},res1K:{en:"1K",kh:"1K"},res2K:{en:"2K",kh:"2K"},res4K:{en:"4K",kh:"4K"},googleSearchGrounding:{en:"Search Grounding",kh:"ស្វែងរកមូលដ្ឋាន"},searchGroundingDesc:{en:"Use Google Search to improve result accuracy.",kh:"ប្រើ Google Search ដើម្បីបង្កើនភាពត្រឹមត្រូវ។"},nanoBananaProSettings:{en:"Settings",kh:"ការកំណត់"},enhanceImagePro:{en:"Render (Pro)",kh:"Render (Pro)"},cameraControl:{en:"Camera Control",kh:"គ្រប់គ្រងកាមេរ៉ា"},visualEffects:{en:"Post-FX",kh:"Post-FX"},environment:{en:"Environment",kh:"បរិស្ថាន"},addObjects:{en:"Add Objects",kh:"បន្ថែមវត្ថុ"},siteContext:{en:"Site Context",kh:"បរិបទទីតាំង"},step1:{en:"Base Image",kh:"រូបភាពមូលដ្ឋាន"},step2:{en:"2. Style Reference",kh:"២. រូបភាពយោងរចនាប័ទ្ម"},changeStyleRef:{en:"Change",kh:"ផ្លាស់ប្តូរ"},cropStyleRef:{en:"Crop",kh:"កាត់"},removeStyleRef:{en:"Remove",kh:"លុប"},styleStrength:{en:"Stylization Intensity",kh:"កម្រិតឥទ្ធិពលរចនាប័ទ្ម"},uploadStyleImage:{en:"Upload Style Image",kh:"បញ្ចូលរូបភាពរចនាប័ទ្ម"},styleRefDescription:{en:"Professionally transplant the building from your base image into the environment of this reference.",kh:"ប្តូរបរិស្ថានសំណង់ពីរូបភាពគោល ទៅតាមបរិស្ថាននៃរូបភាពគំរូនេះដោយវិជ្ជាជីវៈ។"},customSky:{en:"Custom Sky",kh:"ផ្ទៃមេឃផ្ទាល់ខ្លួន"},skyMode:{en:"Sky Mode",kh:"ម៉ូដផ្ទៃមេឃ"},skyModeReplace:{en:"Replace Sky Only",kh:"ជំនួសផ្ទៃមេឃតែប៉ុណ្ណោះ"},skyModeLighting:{en:"Sky + Lighting Match",kh:"ផ្ទៃមេឃ + ផ្គូផ្គងពន្លឺ"},skyModeFull:{en:"Full Environment Sync",kh:"ផ្គូផ្គងបរិស្ថានពេញលេញ"},skyStrength:{en:"Sky Strength",kh:"កម្រិតឥទ្ធិពលផ្ទៃមេឃ"},uploadCustomSky:{en:"Upload Custom Sky",kh:"បញ្ចូលផ្ទៃមេឃផ្ទាល់ខ្លួន"},changeSky:{en:"Change Sky",kh:"ផ្លាស់ប្តូរផ្ទៃមេឃ"},cropSky:{en:"Crop Sky",kh:"កាត់ផ្ទៃមេឃ"},removeSky:{en:"Remove Sky",kh:"លុបផ្ទៃមេឃ"},advancedModes:{en:"Advanced Modes",kh:"មុខងារកម្រិតខ្ពស់"},step4:{en:"4. Description (Prompt)",kh:"៤. ការពិពណ៌នា"},customInstructions:{en:"Special Instructions",kh:"ការណែនាំបន្ថែម"},customInstructionsPlaceholder:{en:"e.g., add mist, warm lighting, change materials...",kh:"ឧ. បន្ថែមអ័ព្ទ, ពន្លឺស្រទន់, ផ្លាស់ប្តូរសម្ភារៈ..."},customInstructionsTemplateLabel:{en:"Quick Template",kh:"គំរូរហ័ស"},customInstructionsTemplateMistLabel:{en:"Ground Mist & Tranquility",kh:"អ័ព្ទផ្ទៃដី និងបរិយាកាសស្ងប់ស្ងាត់"},customInstructionsTemplateMist:{en:"A small amount of mist at a height of 1 meter, slight localized water stains and color differences, soft and tranquil ambient light, overall elegant and refined atmosphere.",kh:"មានអ័ព្ទស្រាលៗកម្ពស់ប្រហែល ១ម៉ែត្រពីដី ស្នាមទឹកស្តើងៗ និងពណ៌ខុសគ្នាបន្តិចបន្តួច ពន្លឺស្រទន់ និងបរិយាកាសស្ងប់ស្ងាត់ ឆើតឆាយ និងប្រណិត។"},customInstructionsTemplatePlateLabel:{en:"Cambodia Plate",kh:"ស្លាកលេខកម្ពុជា"},customInstructionsTemplatePlate:{en:"Add a realistic Cambodian license plate to the vehicle. Ensure correct fonts, proportions, and Phnom Penh province text.",kh:"បន្ថែមស្លាកលេខកម្ពុជាដ៏ត្រឹមត្រូវលើរថយន្ត។ ធានាឱ្យមានហ្វុនអក្សរ សមាមាត្រ និងអក្សរខេត្តភ្នំពេញត្រឹមត្រូវ។"},customInstructionsTemplateGreenToMirrorLabel:{en:"Green to Mirror",kh:"ប្តូរពណ៌បៃតងទៅជាកញ្ចក់"},customInstructionsTemplateGreenToMirror:{en:"Find all surfaces with green textures or materials and replace them with solid, opaque, high-fidelity mirrors. Ensure they reflect the interior environment perfectly. IMPORTANT: Do NOT render these as windows, transparent glass, or openings to the outside. They must be solid reflective mirrors.",kh:"ស្វែងរកផ្ទៃទាំងអស់ដែលមានពណ៌បៃតង ហើយជំនួសវាដោយកញ្ចក់ឆ្លុះកម្រិតខ្ពស់ (Solid Mirror)។ ធានាថាវាឆ្លុះបញ្ចាំងបរិយាកាសខាងក្នុងបានយ៉ាងល្អ។ បញ្ជាក់៖ មិនត្រូវបង្ហាញជាបង្អួច ឬកញ្ចក់ថ្លាមើលធ្លុះទៅក្រៅឡើយ។"},customInstructionsTemplateCeilingLedLabel:{en:"Ceiling LED",kh:"LED ពិដាន"},customInstructionsTemplateCeilingLed:{en:"Identify light orange or yellow color patterns on the ceiling and render them as active, glowing LED architectural lighting.",kh:"សម្គាល់ពណ៌ទឹកក្រូចខ្ចី ឬពណ៌លឿងនៅលើពិដាន ហើយបង្ហាញវាជាពន្លឺ LED ស្ថាបត្យកម្ម។"},customInstructionsTemplateFreshWoodLabel:{en:"Fresh Chestnut Wood",kh:"ឈើថ្មីលាបវែនីរលោង"},customInstructionsTemplateFreshWood:{en:"Freshly painted and varnished luxury Cambodian dark chestnut-mahogany wood. Smooth, uniform deep reddish-brown hardwood color with a clean satin-gloss lacquer sheen and soft sunlight reflections on columns and carvings. Brand-new, spotless, finely grained carpentry; no weathering, no grey fading, no stains, no aged wood look.",kh:"ឈើប្រណិតកម្ពុជាទើបលាបថ្នាំ និងវែនីថ្មី (ពណ៌ត្នោតក្រហមក្រម៉ៅរលោង)។ ផ្ទៃឈើរាបស្មើ ពណ៌ត្នោតក្រហមជ្រៅស្មើគ្នា មានទឹកវែនីរលោងកម្រិត Satin-Gloss និងមានពន្លឺថ្ងៃចាំងទន់ៗលើសសរ និងក្បាច់ចម្លាក់។ ការងារឈើថ្មីស្រឡាង ស្អាតឥតខ្ចោះ សរសៃឈើល្អិត; គ្មានស្នាមចាស់ គ្មានពណ៌ប្រផេះស្លេក គ្មានស្នាមប្រឡាក់ និងមិនមើលទៅដូចឈើចាស់ឡើយ។"},customInstructionsTemplateWoodOverrideLabel:{en:"Wood Finish Override (SketchUp)",kh:"ប្តូរផ្ទៃឈើថ្មី (SketchUp)"},customInstructionsTemplateWoodOverride:{en:"WOOD FINISH OVERRIDE: Render all exterior and interior wood (gable, columns, plank walls, railings, stairs, and shutters) as brand-new, freshly sanded and newly lacquered luxury Cambodian hardwood (rich warm reddish-brown mahogany/beng tone matching the SketchUp color). Apply a fresh, smooth satin-gloss clear varnish coat with clean wood grain visible beneath, crisp specular highlights on edges and carvings, and uniform vibrant color. Strictly NO weathering, NO grey fading, NO dry matte texture, NO water stains, and NO aged patina.",kh:"កែសម្រួលផ្ទៃឈើថ្មី (WOOD FINISH OVERRIDE): បង្ហាញផ្ទៃឈើខាងក្រៅ និងខាងក្នុងទាំងអស់ (ហោជាង សសរ ជញ្ជាំងក្តារ បង្កាន់ដៃ ជណ្តើរ និងបង្អួច) ជាឈើប្រណិតកម្ពុជាថ្មីស្រឡាងដែលទើបឈូស និងលាបវែនីថ្មី (ពណ៌ឈើបេង/ត្នោតក្រហមដូចពណ៌ក្នុង SketchUp)។ លាបស្រទាប់វែនីថ្លាកម្រិត Satin-Gloss រលោងស្អាត មើលឃើញសរសៃឈើច្បាស់ មានពន្លឺចាំងតាមគែម និងក្បាច់ចម្លាក់ និងមានពណ៌ស្រស់ស្មើគ្នា។ ហាមដាច់ខាតភាពចាស់ ស្លេកប្រផេះ ផ្ទៃស្ងួតគ្មានទឹកថ្នាំ ស្នាមទឹក និងស្នាមប្រឡាក់ចាស់។"},customInstructionsTemplateHighGlossRosewoodLabel:{en:"High-Gloss Rosewood",kh:"ឈើក្រញូងរលោងចាំង"},customInstructionsTemplateHighGlossRosewood:{en:"HIGH-GLOSS LACQUERED WOOD OVERRIDE: Finish all exterior and interior wood (gable panels, fascia, columns, railings, brackets, and doors) in a deep, rich reddish-mahogany / oxblood rosewood stain with a freshly sprayed HIGH-GLOSS clear polyurethane lacquer coat. The wood surface must look glass-smooth, newly varnished, and highly reflective, showing crisp specular sky and light reflections across flat panels, recessed moldings, and carved edges, with only subtle wood grain visible beneath the glossy clear coat. Strictly NO matte texture, NO dry rough timber, NO grey fading, NO weathering, and NO aged patina.",kh:"កែសម្រួលផ្ទៃឈើបាញ់វែនីរលោងចាំង (HIGH-GLOSS LACQUERED WOOD): លាបផ្ទៃឈើខាងក្រៅ និងខាងក្នុងទាំងអស់ (បន្ទះហោជាង ជាយដំបូល សសរ បង្កាន់ដៃ ដងក្តារ និងទ្វារ) ជាពណ៌ឈើក្រញូង/ត្នោតក្រហមជ្រៅ ដោយបាញ់ថ្នាំវែនីរលោងកម្រិត HIGH-GLOSS ថ្មីស្រឡាង។ ផ្ទៃឈើត្រូវតែរាបរលោងដូចកញ្ចក់ និងចាំងឆ្លុះពន្លឺមេឃ និងពន្លឺថ្ងៃយ៉ាងច្បាស់នៅលើបន្ទះហោជាង ក្បាច់ចម្លាក់ និងទ្វារ ដោយមានសរសៃឈើស្រាលៗនៅក្រោមស្រទាប់រលោង។ ហាមដាច់ខាតផ្ទៃស្ងួត Matte ឈើគ្រើម ស្លេកប្រផេះ និងភាពចាស់យូរឆ្នាំ។"},customInstructionsTemplateRoofTilesLabel:{en:"Fresh Glazed Roof Tiles",kh:"ក្បឿងថ្មីរលោង"},customInstructionsTemplateRoofTiles:{en:"ROOF TILES OVERRIDE: Render all roof tiles as brand-new, freshly glazed Khmer terracotta clay tiles (vibrant warm burnt-orange / terracotta color). Every tile must have a clean, smooth semi-gloss ceramic glaze that catches subtle sunlight reflections, with crisp neat overlapping rows and spotless ridge trims. Strictly NO moss, NO black mildew, NO dirt streaks, NO chipped or weathered old tiles.",kh:"កែសម្រួលក្បឿងថ្មី (ROOF TILES OVERRIDE): បង្ហាញក្បឿងដំបូលទាំងអស់ជាក្បឿងដីដុតខ្មែរថ្មីស្រឡាងដែលលាបទឹករលោងស្អាត (ពណ៌ទឹកក្រូចដុតភ្លឺស្រស់)។ ក្បឿងនីមួយៗមានស្រទាប់រលោងកម្រិត Semi-Gloss ស្អាត មានពន្លឺថ្ងៃចាំងទន់ៗ រៀបជួរត្រង់ស្អាតឥតខ្ចោះ។ ហាមដាច់ខាតស្នាមស្លែ ផ្សិតខ្មៅ ស្នាមធូលីប្រឡាក់ និងក្បឿងចាស់បាក់បែក។"},customInstructionsTemplateKhmerHouseNewLabel:{en:"New Khmer House (Wood + Tiles)",kh:"ផ្ទះខ្មែរថ្មី (ឈើ + ក្បឿងរលោង)"},customInstructionsTemplateKhmerHouseNew:{en:"KHMER HOUSE BRAND-NEW FINISH: (1) WOOD: Finish all exterior and interior wood (gable, columns, plank walls, railings, carvings, and doors) in a rich, uniform dark reddish-mahogany / rosewood tone with a freshly applied satin-gloss clear varnish and crisp sunlight highlights. (2) ROOF TILES: Render all roof tiles as brand-new, freshly glazed vibrant terracotta-orange Khmer clay tiles with a clean semi-gloss ceramic sheen, neat overlapping rows, and spotless ridges. Strictly NO weathering, NO grey fading, NO moss, NO water stains, and NO aged patina on either wood or roof tiles.",kh:"ផ្ទះខ្មែរថ្មីស្រឡាង (ឈើ + ក្បឿងរលោង): (១) ឈើ៖ បង្ហាញផ្ទៃឈើខាងក្រៅ និងខាងក្នុងទាំងអស់ (ហោជាង សសរ ជញ្ជាំងក្តារ បង្កាន់ដៃ ក្បាច់ និងទ្វារ) ជាពណ៌ឈើក្រញូង/ត្នោតក្រហមជ្រៅស្មើស្អាត លាបវែនីរលោង Satin-Gloss ថ្មីស្រឡាង។ (២) ក្បឿង៖ ក្បឿងដំបូលថ្មីស្រឡាងពណ៌ទឹកក្រូចដុតលាបទឹករលោងកម្រិត Semi-Gloss រៀបជួរស្អាតឥតខ្ចោះ។ ហាមដាច់ខាតភាពចាស់ ស្លេកប្រផេះ ស្នាមស្លែ ស្នាមទឹក និងស្នាមប្រឡាក់។"},enableSombokEditor:{en:"Sombok Editor",kh:"កម្មវិធីកែ សំបុក"},enableSombokPostProduction:{en:"Post Production",kh:"ប៉ុស្តិ៍ផលិតកម្ម"},enableSombokRenovation:{en:"Renovation",kh:"ការជួសជុល"},negativePrompt:{en:"Negative Prompt",kh:"Negative Prompt"},numberOfImages:{en:"Number of Images",kh:"ចំនួនរូបភាព"},totalImages:{en:"Total",kh:"សរុប"},enhanceImage:{en:"Render",kh:"Render"},generate:{en:"Render",kh:"Render"},generating:{en:"Rendering...",kh:"កំពុង Render..."},regenerate:{en:"Re-render",kh:"Render ឡើងវិញ"},loadMore:{en:"Load More",kh:"បង្ហាញបន្ថែម"},showLess:{en:"Show Less",kh:"បង្ហាញតិច"},renderStyle:{en:"Render Style",kh:"រចនាប័ទ្ម Render"},interiorPhoto:{en:"Interior",kh:"រូបភាពផ្ទៃក្នុង"},batchEnhance:{en:"Batch Enhance",kh:"Batch Enhance"},uploadBatchImages:{en:"Upload Batch Images",kh:"បញ្ចូលរូបភាព Batch"},baseImage:{en:"Base",kh:"មូលដ្ឋាន"},facadeDesignMode:{en:"Facade Design",kh:"រចនាផ្នែកខាងមុខ"},creativityLevel:{en:"Creativity Level",kh:"កម្រិតច្នៃប្រឌិត"},facadeStyle:{en:"Facade Style",kh:"រចនាប័ទ្ម"},furnitureReplacement:{en:"Furniture Replacement",kh:"ជំនួសគ្រឿងសង្ហារឹម"},uploadFurnitureImages:{en:"Upload Furniture",kh:"បញ្ចូលគ្រឿងសង្ហារឹម"},interiorDesignMode:{en:"Interior Design",kh:"រចនាផ្ទៃខាងក្នុង"},spaceType:{en:"Room Type",kh:"ប្រភេទបន្ទប់"},interiorStyle:{en:"Style",kh:"រចនាប័ទ្ម"},replaceModel:{en:"Replace Model in Scene",kh:"ជំនួសម៉ូដែលក្នុងឆាក"},detectedModelAngle:{en:"Detected Angle",kh:"មុំដែលចាប់បាន"},analyzingAngle:{en:"Analyzing...",kh:"កំពុងវិភាគ..."},analyzing:{en:"Analyzing...",kh:"កំពុងវិភាគ..."},enhancingXofY:{en:"Rendering {current} of {total}...",kh:"កំពុង Render {current} នៃ {total}..."},changeSceneWithMask:{en:"Change Scene",kh:"ផ្លាស់ប្តូរឆាក"},cropSceneWithMask:{en:"Crop Scene",kh:"កាត់ឆាក"},removeSceneWithMask:{en:"Remove Scene",kh:"លុបឆាក"},uploadSceneWithMask:{en:"Upload Scene (Red Mask)",kh:"បញ្ចូលឆាក (ម៉ាសក្រហម)"},skyReplacement:{en:"Sky Replacement",kh:"ជំនួសផ្ទៃមេឃ"},removeSkyImage:{en:"Remove Sky",kh:"លុបផ្ទៃមេឃ"},uploadSkyImage:{en:"Upload Sky",kh:"បញ្ចូលផ្ទៃមេឃ"},perspective:{en:"Perspective",kh:"ស្វែងរកមុំបន្ថែម"},multiAngles:{en:"Multi-Angles",kh:"មុំច្រើន"},multiAnglesLivePreview:{en:"Live Preview",kh:"ការបង្ហាញផ្ទាល់"},renderingPreview:{en:"Rendering Preview",kh:"កំពុង Render ផ្ទាល់"},subject:{en:"Subject",kh:"វត្ថុ"},rotate:{en:"Rotate",kh:"បង្វិល"},tilt:{en:"Tilt",kh:"ទ្រេត"},scale:{en:"Scale",kh:"ពង្រីក/បង្រួម"},noSourceImage:{en:"No source image",kh:"មិនមានរូបភាពប្រភព"},geometryGuide:{en:"Geometry Guide (SketchUp / 3D)",kh:"មគ្គុទ្ទេសក៍រូបរាង 3D (SketchUp)"},geometryGuideDesc:{en:"Upload a SketchUp viewport snapshot to enforce exact 3D geometry.",kh:"ផ្ទុកឡើងរូបភាពប្លង់ 3D ពី SketchUp ដើម្បីចាក់សោរូបរាងពិតប្រាកដ។"},lockLandscapeAndTrees:{en:"Lock Landscape & Trees",kh:"ចាក់សោដើមឈើ និងបរិស្ថាន"},geometryActive:{en:"Geometry Guide Active",kh:"បានភ្ជាប់ប្លង់ 3D"},quickPresets:{en:"Quick Angles",kh:"មុំរហ័ស"},uploadGeometry:{en:"Upload SketchUp Viewport",kh:"បញ្ចូលប្លង់ 3D ពី SketchUp"},dropGeometryHere:{en:"Drop SketchUp snapshot or click to browse",kh:"ទម្លាក់រូបភាព SketchUp ឬចុចដើម្បីជ្រើសរើស"},newPerspective:{en:"Perspective-Gallery",kh:"វិចិត្រសាលមុំកាមេរ៉ា"},perspectiveGallery:{en:"Perspective-Gallery",kh:"វិចិត្រសាលមុំកាមេរ៉ា"},cameraFront:{en:"Front",kh:"ពីមុខ"},cameraLeft:{en:"Left",kh:"ឆ្វេង"},cameraRight:{en:"Right",kh:"ស្តាំ"},cameraBack:{en:"Back",kh:"ក្រោយ"},perspectiveFront:{en:"Front Perspective",kh:"មុំកាមេរ៉ាពីមុខ"},perspectiveLeft:{en:"Left Perspective",kh:"មុំកាមេរ៉ាឆ្វេង"},perspectiveRight:{en:"Right Perspective",kh:"មុំកាមេរ៉ាស្តាំ"},perspectiveLeftElevation:{en:"Left Elevation",kh:"ប្លង់កម្ពស់ខាងឆ្វេង"},perspectiveRightElevation:{en:"Right Elevation",kh:"ប្លង់កម្ពស់ខាងស្តាំ"},perspectiveBack:{en:"Back Perspective",kh:"មុំកាមេរ៉ាក្រោយ"},perspectiveTop:{en:"Top Perspective",kh:"មុំកាមេរ៉ាពីលើ"},perspectiveBirdsEye:{en:"Bird's-Eye Perspective",kh:"ប្លង់ពីលើបែប Bird's Eye"},perspectiveDetail:{en:"Detail Perspective",kh:"ទិដ្ឋភាពលម្អិត"},perspectiveLastView:{en:"Last Perspective",kh:"ទិដ្ឋភាពចុងក្រោយ"},perspectiveStandardGrid:{en:"Standard Perspectives Grid",kh:"ក្រឡាផ្ទៃទស្សនៈមុំកាមេរ៉ាស្តង់ដារ"},perspectiveTwoRowGrid:{en:"Two-Row Perspectives Grid",kh:"ក្រឡាផ្ទៃទស្សនៈមុំកាមេរ៉ាពីរជួរ"},perspectiveFrontRowOnly:{en:"Front Row Only",kh:"តែជួរមុខប៉ុណ្ណោះ"},perspectiveMaterialDetailsGrid:{en:"Detail Trio (3 Shots)",kh:"ប្លង់លម្អិតទាំង ៣ (៣ ប្លង់)"},perspectivePlantsDetailsGrid:{en:"Plants & Trees Trio (3 Shots)",kh:"ប្លង់លម្អិតដើមឈើ និងរុក្ខជាតិ (៣ ប្លង់)"},perspectiveAerialSite:{en:"Aerial Site Expansion",kh:"ការពង្រីកទីតាំងពីលើអាកាស"},cameraTopElevation:{en:"Top Elevation",kh:"ប្លង់ពិតាន"},cameraTop:{en:"Top View",kh:"ប្លង់ពីលើ"},cameraCorner:{en:"Corner",kh:"ជ្រុង"},cameraBird:{en:"Bird's Eye",kh:"ពីលើ"},cameraBirdsEyeHub:{en:"Bird's-Eye Perspective",kh:"ប្លង់ពីលើបែប Bird's Eye"},cameraStreet:{en:"Street",kh:"កម្រិតផ្លូវ"},cameraHero:{en:"Hero Shot",kh:"ប្លង់ស្អាតបំផុត"},cameraDetail:{en:"Detail Shot",kh:"ថតលម្អិត"},cameraPlantCloseup:{en:"Plant Close-up",kh:"រុក្ខជាតិលម្អិត"},cameraCarCloseup:{en:"Car Close-up",kh:"រថយន្តលម្អិត"},cameraFamilyGarden:{en:"Family Lifestyle",kh:"សកម្មភាពគ្រួសារ"},cameraFamilyPicnic:{en:"Family Picnic",kh:"ដំណើរកម្សាន្តគ្រួសារ"},cameraFamilyPlaying:{en:"Family Playing",kh:"គ្រួសារលេងកម្សាន្ត"},cameraBBQParty:{en:"Home BBQ Party",kh:"ដំណើរកម្សាន្ត BBQ"},cameraFashionWalking:{en:"Cinematic Walk",kh:"សកម្មភាពដើរ"},cameraOwnerRelaxing:{en:"Owner Relaxing",kh:"ម្ចាស់ផ្ទះសម្រាក"},cameraOwnerCloseup:{en:"Owner Close-up",kh:"ប្លង់ថតម្ចាស់ផ្ទះជិត"},cameraYoungCouple:{en:"Young Couple (KH)",kh:"គូសេ្នហ៍យុវវ័យខ្មែរ"},cameraLuxuryCoupleCar:{en:"Luxury Couple & Car",kh:"គូសេ្នហ៍ប្រណិត & រថយន្ត"},cameraArchDetail:{en:"Arch. Detail",kh:"ស្ថាបត្យកម្មលម្អិត"},cameraCinematicDrive:{en:"Cinematic Drive",kh:"ប្លង់រថយន្តបើកបរ"},cameraCinematicRearDrive:{en:"Cinematic Rear Glow",kh:"ប្លង់ពន្លឺឡានខាងក្រោយ"},cameraLockedByStyle:{en:"Camera angle locked by style",kh:"មុំកាមេរ៉ាត្រូវបានចាក់សោដោយរចនាប័ទ្ម"},cameraRainReflection:{en:"Post-Rain Freshness",kh:"ប្លង់សើមទឹកភ្លៀងតិចៗ"},cameraRainyEveningWalk:{en:"Rainy Evening Walk",kh:"ប្លង់ដើរក្រោមភ្លៀងពេលល្ងាច"},cameraHeroFrontWalk:{en:"Front Hero Walk",kh:"ប្លង់ដើរទៅមុខបែប Hero"},cameraCoupleBlueHourStroll:{en:"Twilight Couple Stroll",kh:"គូស្នេហ៍ដើរកម្សាន្តពេលព្រលប់"},cameraGoldenHourSideWalk:{en:"Golden Hour Side Stride",kh:"ប្លង់ដើរចំហៀងពេលថ្ងៃលិច"},cameraValetArrival:{en:"Valet Long Shot",kh:"ប្លង់ម្ាស់មកដល់ (ឆ្ី)"},cameraLightTrails:{en:"Long Exposure",kh:"ប្លង់ពន្លឺរថយន្ត"},cameraOwnerOpeningDoor:{en:"Owner Opening Door",kh:"ប្លង់ម្ាស់បើកទ្វារ"},cameraInsideBuilding:{en:"Inside Looking Out",kh:"ប្លង់ពីក្នុងមើលទៅក្រៅ"},cameraStudioModel:{en:"Studio Model",kh:"ម៉ូដែលស្ទូឌីយោ"},cameraStudioTimberWood:{en:"Timber & Balsa Wood Model",kh:"ម៉ូដែលឈើស្ថាបត្យកម្ម"},cameraStudioMonolithicWhite:{en:"Monolithic White Museum Model",kh:"ម៉ូដែលពណ៌សសុទ្ធស្ទូឌីយោ"},cameraStudioIlluminatedNight:{en:"Illuminated Night Scale Model",kh:"ម៉ូដែលបំភ្លឺពន្លឺរាត្រី"},cameraStudioDesktopWorkshop:{en:"Architect's Desktop Model",kh:"ម៉ូដែលលើតុធ្វើការស្ថាបត្យករ"},cameraStudioConcreteResin:{en:"Cast Concrete & Resin Model",kh:"ម៉ូដែលបេតុង និងជ័រថ្លា"},cameraStudioTopographicContour:{en:"Layered Topographic Model",kh:"ម៉ូដែលដីស្រទាប់ និងប្លង់មេ"},cameraStudioSectionalCutaway:{en:"Sectional Cutaway Model",kh:"ម៉ូដែលកាត់ទទឹងបង្ហាញផ្ទៃក្នុង"},cameraStudioConcept:{en:"Concept Analysis",kh:"ប្លង់វិភាគគោលគំនិត"},studioScaleModelsTitle:{en:"Physical Architectural Models",kh:"ម៉ូដែលស្ថាបត្យកម្មរូបវន្ត"},studioConceptBoardsTitle:{en:"Design Concepts & Analysis",kh:"ប្លង់វិភាគ និងក្តារគំនិត"},cameraRooftopDown:{en:"Rooftop Look-down",kh:"ប្លង់ពីលើដំបូល"},cameraSiteClearance:{en:"Site Clearance",kh:"ការឈូសឆាយដី"},cameraUnderConstruction:{en:"Under Construction",kh:"កំពុងសាងសង់"},cameraFoundation:{en:"Foundation Phase",kh:"ដំណាក់កាលចាក់គ្រឹះ"},cameraStructuralShell:{en:"Structural Frame",kh:"គ្រោងដែក/បេតុង"},cameraFacadeInstall:{en:"Facade Installation",kh:"ការតម្លើង όψη"},cameraNightSite:{en:"Night Shift Site",kh:"ការដ្ឋានពេលយប់"},cameraBlueprintTechnical:{en:"Technical Drawing",kh:"ប្លង់គំនូរបច្ចេកទេស"},cameraBlueprintNeon:{en:"Neon Visualization",kh:"ការបង្ហាញប្លង់នេអុង"},cameraBlueprintAR:{en:"AR Technical Overlay",kh:"ប្លង់ AR បច្ចេកទេស"},cameraBlueprintConcept:{en:"Concept Board",kh:"ក្តារគោលគំនិត"},cameraInsideDetail:{en:"Close-up Detail",kh:"ប្លង់ជិតលម្អិត"},cameraInsideFunctional:{en:"Functional Area",kh:"ប្លង់តំបន់ប្រើប្រាស់"},cameraInsideQuad:{en:"4-in-1 Interior Presentation",kh:"ប្លង់បទបង្ហាញផ្ទៃក្នុង ៤-ក្នុង-១"},cameraDrone:{en:"Drone View",kh:"ប្លង់ពីដ្រូន"},cameraCloseup:{en:"Closeup View",kh:"ប្លង់ថតជិត"},cameraEntrance:{en:"Entrance Focus",kh:"ប្លង់ផ្តោតលើច្រកចូល"},cameraBalcony:{en:"Balcony garden",kh:"ប្លង់សួនច្បារនៅយ៉រ"},cameraGardenDetail:{en:"Garden Closeup",kh:"ប្លង់សួនច្បារជិត"},cameraFacadeDetail:{en:"Architecture Detail",kh:"ស្ថាបត្យកម្មលម្អិត"},cameraDetailView:{en:"Detail View",kh:"ទិដ្ឋភាពលម្អិត"},cameraLastView:{en:"Last View",kh:"ទិដ្ឋភាពចុងក្រោយ"},cameraTreeFraming:{en:"Natural Tree Framing",kh:"ប្លង់តាមចន្លោះមែកឈើ"},cameraInsideWormEye:{en:"Worm's Eye View",kh:"ប្លង់ពីក្រោម (Worm's Eye)"},cameraInsideIsometric:{en:"Isometric Cutaway",kh:"ប្លង់កាត់ 3D (Isometric)"},customCharacter:{en:"Custom Character",kh:"ប្ដូរតួអង្គតាមចិត្ត"},customCharacterDesc:{en:"Upload face or pose model",kh:"បញ្ចូលរូបភាពមុខ ឬរូបរាង"},customCharacterTip:{en:"For best results: Upload a clear photo. Use the Crop Tool to focus tightly on the face for exact identity match.",kh:"ដើម្បីទទួលបានលទ្ធផលល្អបំផុត៖ បញ្ចូលរូបភាពច្បាស់។ ប្រើឧបករណ៍កាត់ (Crop) ដើម្បីផ្តោតលើផ្ទៃមុខសម្រាប់ការផ្គូផ្គងអត្តសញ្ញាណបានត្រឹមត្រូវ។"},customCharacterStatus:{en:"Identity Shield — Accurate Face Capture On",kh:"Identity Shield — កំពុងចាប់យកផ្ទៃមុខឱ្យបានត្រឹមត្រូវ"},cameraAerialMasterPlan:{en:"Aerial Master Plan",kh:"ប្លង់មេពីលើអាកាស"},cameraMotoDrive:{en:"Motorcycle Dynamic Drive",kh:"ប្លង់ម៉ូតូបើកបរ"},cameraMotoRearGlow:{en:"Moto Cinematic Rear Glow",kh:"ប្លង់ពន្លឺម៉ូតូខាងក្រោយ"},cameraInteriorLivingRoom:{en:"Living Room",kh:"បន្ទប់ទទួលភ្ញៀវ"},cameraInteriorBedroom:{en:"Bedroom",kh:"បន្ទប់គេង"},cameraInsideWide:{en:"Wide Angle",kh:"ប្លង់ទូលាយ"},cameraInteriorCharacter:{en:"Character & Lifestyle",kh:"សកម្មភាពតួអង្គ"},cameraInteriorCharacterCloseUp:{en:"Character Close-Up",kh:"ប្លង់តួអង្គជិត"},cameraInteriorActivityTrio:{en:"Everyday Activity Trio (3 Views)",kh:"សកម្មភាពប្រចាំថ្ងៃ ៣ ប្លង់"},cameraInteriorMoodboard:{en:"Material Moodboard",kh:"ប្លង់ក្តារគំនិតសម្ភារៈ"},cameraInteriorGrandHall:{en:"Grand Hall",kh:"សាលធំប្រណិត"},cameraInteriorKitchen:{en:"Kitchen",kh:"ផ្ទះបាយ"},cameraInteriorDining:{en:"Dining Room",kh:"បន្ទប់បរិភោគ"},cameraInteriorStudyRoom:{en:"Study Room",kh:"បន្ទប់សិក្សា"},cameraInteriorBathroom:{en:"Bathroom",kh:"បន្ទប់ទឹក"},cameraInteriorCorridor:{en:"Corridor",kh:"ច្រករបៀង"},cameraInteriorCloseUp:{en:"Interior Close-Up",kh:"ប្លង់ផ្ទៃក្នុងជិត"},cameraInteriorBalconyGarden:{en:"Balcony/Garden",kh:"យ៉រ/សួនច្បារ"},neuralGeometryHubTitle:{en:"SketchUp View Hub",kh:"មជ្ឈមណ្ឌលប្លង់ SketchUp"},neuralGeometryHubStep1:{en:"Upload 3D perspective blueprints or capture directly from SketchUp.",kh:"បញ្ជូលប្លង់យោង 3D ឬថតផ្ទាល់ពី SketchUp។"},neuralGeometryHubStep2:{en:"Select corresponding views in the",kh:"ជ្រើសរើសមុំកាមេរ៉ាដែលត្រូវគ្នានៅក្នុង"},neuralGeometryHubStep2Tab:{en:"Architecture tab",kh:"ផ្នែកស្ថាបត្យកម្ម"},neuralGeometryHubStep2End:{en:"above to render with extreme structural accuracy.",kh:"ខាងលើដើម្បី Render ជាមួយនឹងភាពត្រឹមត្រូវខ្ពស់។"},neuralGeometryHubStep3:{en:"For best results, match each Hub slot to its render view. Upload the Left reference → Render Left, upload the Right reference → Render Right. The AI will automatically select the matching blueprint for you.",kh:"សម្រាប់លទ្ធផលល្អបំផុត ផ្គូផ្គង Hub នីមួយៗទៅនឹងមុំ Render របស់វា។ បញ្ជូលរូបឆ្វេង → Render ឆ្វេង, បញ្ជូលរូបស្តាំ → Render ស្តាំ។ AI នឹងជ្រើសរើសរូបយោងដែលត្រូវគ្នាដោយស្វ័យប្រវត្តិ។"},neuralViewsTitle:{en:"SketchUp View Perspectives",kh:"មុំកាមេរ៉ាប្លង់ SketchUp"},howToUse:{en:"How to Use SketchUp View Hub",kh:"របៀបប្រើប្រាស់មជ្ឈមណ្ឌលប្លង់ SketchUp"},hubTopView:{en:"Top View",kh:"ទិដ្ឋភាពពីលើ"},hubLeftView:{en:"Left View",kh:"ទិដ្ឋភាពខាងឆ្វេង"},hubFrontView:{en:"Front (Hero)",kh:"ទិដ្ឋភាពខាងមុខ"},hubRightView:{en:"Right View",kh:"ទិដ្ឋភាពខាងស្តាំ"},hubBackView:{en:"Back View",kh:"ទិដ្ឋភាពខាងក្រោយ"},hubDetail:{en:"Detail",kh:"លម្អិត"},hubBirdsEye:{en:"Bird's Eye",kh:"ទិដ្ឋភាពបែបភ្នែកបក្សី"},hubLastView:{en:"Last View",kh:"ទិដ្ឋភាពចុងក្រោយ"},hubEnvironment:{en:"Random View",kh:"ប្លង់ចៃដន្យ"},standardViewsTitle:{en:"Standard Perspectives",kh:"មុំកាមេរ៉ាស្ដង់ដារ"},tabConstruction:{en:"Construction",kh:"ការដ្ឋានសំណង់"},tabBlueprint:{en:"Blueprint",kh:"ប្លង់បច្ចេកទេស"},modelSelection:{en:"AI Model",kh:"ម៉ូដែល AI"},modelGeminiFlash31:{en:"Nano Banana 2",kh:"Nano Banana 2"},modelGeminiPro:{en:"Nano Banana Pro",kh:"Nano Banana Pro"},modelApiyiNanoBanana2:{en:"G Nano Banana 2",kh:"G Nano Banana 2"},modelApiyiNanoBananaPro:{en:"G Nano Banana Pro",kh:"G Nano Banana Pro"},modelProDesc:{en:"Highest quality & Google Search",kh:"គុណភាពខ្ពស់ & Google Search"},sourceActive:{en:"Source Active",kh:"ប្រភពរូបភាពគោល"},sourceTypeMasterpiece:{en:"Masterpiece",kh:"ស្នាដៃឯក"},sourceTypeBaseImage:{en:"Base Image",kh:"រូបភាពមូលដ្ឋាន"},sourceTypeAIRender:{en:"AI Render",kh:"AI Render"},sourceDescUpscale:{en:"4K Neural Reconstruction",kh:"ការបង្កើតឡើងវិញកម្រិត 4K"},sourceDescOriginal:{en:"Original Blueprint/Upload",kh:"ប្លង់ដើម/រូបភាពដែលបានបញ្ចូល"},sourceDescStandard:{en:"Standard AI Generation",kh:"ការបង្កើតដោយ AI ស្តង់ដារ"},viewGeneratedCount:{en:"1 Perspective Generated",kh:"បានបង្កើត ១ មុំកាមេរ៉ា"},viewsGeneratedCount:{en:"{count} Perspectives Generated",kh:"បានបង្កើត {count} មុំកាមេរ៉ា"},masterpieceLabel:{en:"Masterpiece",kh:"ស្នាដៃឯក"},versionLabel:{en:"Version",kh:"ជំនាន់"},renderMoreAngleViews:{en:"Render more angle views",kh:"Render មុំកាមេរ៉ាបន្ថែម"},aiAccuracy:{en:"AI Accuracy",kh:"ភាពត្រឹមត្រូវនៃ AI"},clearHub:{en:"Clear Hub",kh:"សម្អាត Hub"},verifiedSources:{en:"Verified Sources",kh:"ប្រភពដែលបានផ្ទៀងផ្ទាត់"},neuralReconstruction:{en:"Neural Reconstruction",kh:"ការបង្កើតឡើងវិញដោយ AI"},renderingHistory:{en:"Rendering History",kh:"ប្រវត្តិ Render"},galleryHistory:{en:"Gallery History",kh:"ប្រវត្តិវិចិត្រសាល"},sourceLabelText:{en:"Source",kh:"ប្រភព"},perspectiveViewLabel:{en:"View",kh:"មុំកាមេរ៉ា"},deadlineExpiredTitle:{en:"GOOGLE NEEDS REST",kh:"GOOGLE ត្រូវការសម្រាក"},deadlineExpiredDesc:{en:"The neural engine is under intense architectural calculation. Google's servers need a short breather before continuing your render.",kh:"ម៉ាស៊ីន AI កុងធ្វើការយ៉ាងធ្ងន់ធ្ងរលើការគណនាស្ថាបត្យកម្ម។ Google ត្រូវការពេលសម្រាកបន្តិចសិន មុននឹងបន្តការ Render របស់អ្នក។"},modelConfigUnsupportedTitle:{en:"Model Configuration Not Supported",kh:"ការកំណត់ម៉ូដែលមិនត្រូវបានគាំទ្រ"},modelConfigUnsupportedDesc:{en:"The selected AI model configuration (resolution, aspect ratio, or complex reference layers) is not supported by the APIYI inference engine. Your credits have been preserved.",kh:"ការកំណត់ម៉ូដែល AI ដែលបានជ្រើសរើស (ទំហំ Resolution ឬការដាក់រូបភាពយោងច្រើន) មិនត្រូវបានគាំទ្រដោយម៉ាស៊ីន APIYI ទេ។ Credits របស់អ្នកត្រូវបានរក្សាទុកដោយសុវត្ថិភាព។"},modelConfigAdjustBtn:{en:"Adjust Settings Manually",kh:"កែសម្រួលការកំណត់ដោយខ្លួនឯង"},magicPrompt:{en:"Magic Prompt",kh:"Magic Prompt"},generatingMagicPrompts:{en:"Generating...",kh:"កំពុងបង្កើត..."},savePreset:{en:"Save Preset",kh:"រក្សាទុក Preset"},deletePreset:{en:"Delete Preset",kh:"លុប Preset"},syncPreset:{en:"Sync Preset",kh:"ធ្វើបច្ចុប្បន្នភាព Preset"},sync:{en:"Sync",kh:"ធ្វើបចុប្បន្នភាព"},save:{en:"Save",kh:"រក្សាទុក"},preset:{en:"Preset",kh:"Preset"},presetNamePlaceholder:{en:"Preset Name...",kh:"ឈ្មោះ Preset..."},templateLibrary:{en:"Template Library",kh:"វិចិត្រសាលគំរូ"},templatesCount:{en:"{count} Professional Visual Styles",kh:"{count} រចនាប័ទ្មរូបភាពអាជីព"},searchTemplatesPlaceholder:{en:"Search templates (e.g. Mansion, Modern, Interior...)",kh:"ស្វែងរកគំរូ (ឧ. វីឡា, ទំនើប, ផ្ទៃក្នុង...)"},selectTemplateFooter:{en:"Select a template to apply its architectural DNA",kh:"ជ្រើសរើសគំរូដើម្បីអនុវត្ត DNA ស្ថាបត្យកម្មរបស់វា"},noTemplatesFound:{en:"No templates found",kh:"រកមិនឃើញគំរូទេ"},aspectRatio:{en:"Aspect Ratio",kh:"ទំហំរូបភាព"},aspectRatioDefault:{en:"Auto",kh:"ដើម"},aspectRatioBase:{en:"Auto",kh:"ដើម"},aspectRatioNote:{en:"Note: Aspect ratio selection requires Gemini 3 Pro model.",kh:"បញ្ជាក់៖ ការជ្រើសរើសទំហំរូបភាពតម្រូវឱ្យប្រើម៉ូដែល Gemini 3 Pro។"},generativeExpand:{en:"Generative Expand",kh:"ពង្រីកដោយបញ្ញាសិប្បនិម្មិត"},expandDirection:{en:"Expand Direction",kh:"ទិសដៅពង្រីក"},expansionAmount:{en:"Expansion Amount",kh:"កម្រិតពង្រីក"},applyExpansion:{en:"Apply Expansion",kh:"អនុវត្តការពង្រីក"},expandAll:{en:"All Directions",kh:"គ្រប់ទិសដៅ"},expandTop:{en:"Top",kh:"ខាងលើ"},expandBottom:{en:"Bottom",kh:"ខាងក្រោម"},expandLeft:{en:"Left",kh:"ខាងឆ្វេង"},expandRight:{en:"Right",kh:"ខាងស្តាំ"},add:{en:"Add",kh:"បន្ថែម"},getObjectIdeas:{en:"Get Ideas",kh:"យកគំនិត"},gettingObjectIdeas:{en:"Getting Ideas...",kh:"កំពុងយកគំនិត..."},siteContextDefault:{en:"Clear Context",kh:"លុបបរិបទ"},suggestions:{en:"Suggestions",kh:"ការណែនាំ"},refreshSuggestions:{en:"Refresh",kh:"ធ្វើឱ្យស្រស់"},detailedConfiguration:{en:"Config",kh:"ការកំណត់"},openInNewTab:{en:"Open in New Tab",kh:"បើកក្នុង Tab ថ្មី"},refineView:{en:"Refine Perspective",kh:"កែសម្រួលមុំកាមេរ៉ា"},refineViewDesc:{en:"Maintain current design while shifting view",kh:"រក្សាការរចនាបច្ចុប្បន្ន ខណៈពេលប្តូរមុំមើល"},cancelRefinement:{en:"Cancel Refinement",kh:"បោះបង់ការកែសម្រួល"},generateScene:{en:"Render Scene",kh:"Render ទិដ្ឋភាព"},step1_product:{en:"1. Product Images",kh:"១. រូបភាពផលិតផល"},removeProductImage:{en:"Remove Product",kh:"លុបផលិតផល"},addProductImage:{en:"Add Product",kh:"បន្ថែមផលិតផល"},selectProductImage:{en:"Select Product",kh:"ជ្រើសរើសផលិតផល"},sceneReference:{en:"Scene Reference",kh:"រូបភាពយោងទិដ្ឋភាព"},changeSceneRef:{en:"Change",kh:"ផ្លាស់ប្តូរ"},cropSceneRef:{en:"Crop",kh:"កាត់"},removeSceneRef:{en:"Remove",kh:"លុប"},sceneInfluence:{en:"Scene Influence",kh:"ឥទ្ធិពលទិដ្ឋភាព"},uploadSceneRef:{en:"Upload Scene Ref",kh:"បញ្ចូលរូបយោងទិដ្ឋភាព"},sceneRefDesc:{en:"Influences background logic",kh:"ជះឥទ្ធិពលលើផ្ទៃខាងក្រោយ"},step3_product:{en:"3. Scene Selection",kh:"៣. ជ្រើសរើសទិដ្ឋភាព"},sceneStyle:{en:"Scene Style",kh:"រចនាប័ទ្មទិដ្ឋភាព"},gettingSceneIdeas:{en:"Analyzing...",kh:"កំពុងវិភាគ..."},getSceneIdeas:{en:"Get Scene Ideas",kh:"យកគំនិតទិដ្ឋភាព"},step4_product:{en:"4. Visual Props",kh:"៤. គ្រឿងបង្គុំប្លង់"},photographySettings:{en:"Studio Settings",kh:"ការកំណត់បែបស្ទូឌីយោ"},enableAdvancedEffects:{en:"Advanced Effects",kh:"ផលប៉ះពាល់កម្រិតខ្ពស់"},lightingStyle:{en:"Lighting",kh:"ពន្លឺ"},shadowStyle:{en:"Shadows",kh:"ស្រមល"},reflectionStyle:{en:"Reflections",kh:"ចំណាំង"},shotType:{en:"Shot Type",kh:"ប្រភេទប្លង់"},gallerySettings:{en:"Gallery Display",kh:"ការបង្ហាញវិចិត្រសាល"},enablePerspectiveGallery:{en:"Perspective-Gallery",kh:"វិចិត្រសាលមុំកាមេរ៉ា"},enableSombokVideo:{en:"Sombok Video",kh:"វីដេអូ សំបុក"},groupLifestyleAngles:{en:"Lifestyle Views",kh:"ប្លង់សកម្មភាព"},lockEnvironment:{en:"Lock Environment",kh:"ចាក់សោបរិស្ថាន"},syncEnvironmentMode:{en:"Sync Environment",kh:"ផ្គូផ្គងបរិស្ថាន"},syncEnvironmentDesc:{en:"Keep this environment for revised models",kh:"រក្សាបរិស្ថាននេះសម្រាប់ម៉ូដែលដែលបានកែប្រែ"},envRefPlaceholder:{en:"Environment Reference",kh:"បរិស្ថានយោង"},customViewpoint:{en:"Custom Viewpoint",kh:"មុំកាមេរ៉ាផ្ទាល់ខ្លួន"},customViewpointPlaceholder:{en:"e.g. 'View from the roof looking down'",kh:"ឧ. 'មើលពីលើដំបូលចុះក្រោម'"},customViewpointSupport:{en:"Supports English & Khmer",kh:"គាំទ្រភាសាអង់គ្លេស និងខ្មែរ"},loginTitle:{en:"Sign in to Sombok AI",kh:"ចូលប្រើ សំបុក AI"},emailAddress:{en:"Email Address",kh:"អាសយដ្ឋានអ៊ីមែល"},password:{en:"Password",kh:"ពាក្យសម្ងាត់"},accessCode:{en:"Access Code",kh:"កូដសម្ងាត់"},accessCodePlaceholder:{en:"Enter your unique client code",kh:"បញ្ចូលកូដអតិថិជនរបស់អ្នក"},rememberMe:{en:"Remember Me",kh:"ចងចាំខ្ញុំ"},loginWithEmail:{en:"Login",kh:"ចូលប្រើ"},loginSuccess:{en:"Login Successful",kh:"ការចូលប្រើបានជោគជ័យ"},loginWithGoogle:{en:"Continue with Google",kh:"បន្តជាមួយ Google"},loginWelcome:{en:"Professional visualization is one step away.",kh:"រូបភាពស្ថាបត្យកម្មអាជីពគឺនៅជិតអ្នកបំផុត។"},errorUnauthorizedEmail:{en:"Your email is not authorized to use Sombok AI.",kh:"អ៊ីមែលរបស់អ្នកមិនត្រូវបានអនុញ្ញាតឱ្យប្រើ សំបុក AI ទេ។"},errorInvalidCredentials:{en:"Invalid email or password.",kh:"អ៊ីមែល ឬពាក្យសម្ងាត់មិនត្រឹមត្រូវ។"},errorPasswordTooShort:{en:"Password must be at least 6 characters.",kh:"លេខសម្ងាត់ត្រូវមានយ៉ាងតិច ៦ ខ្ទង់។"},errorEmailAlreadyInUse:{en:"This email is already linked to another account.",kh:"អ៊ីមែលនេះត្រូវបានភ្ជាប់ជាមួយគណនីផ្សេងរួចហើយ។"},errorUpgradeFailed:{en:"Account security update failed. Please try again.",kh:"ការការពារគណនីបានបរាជ័យ។ សូមព្យាយាមម្តងទៀត។"},errorInvalidAccessCode:{en:"Invalid access code. Please contact admin.",kh:"កូដសម្ងាត់មិនត្រឹមត្រូវ។ សូមទាក់ទងអ្នកគ្រប់គ្រង។"},forgotPassword:{en:"Forgot Password?",kh:"ភ្លេចពាក្យសម្ងាត់?"},resetEmailSent:{en:"Password reset email sent! Check your inbox.",kh:"អ៊ីមែលសម្រាប់ប្តូរពាក្យសម្ងាត់ត្រូវបានផ្ញើ! សូមពិនិត្យប្រអប់សំបុត្ររបស់អ្នក។"},tutorial:{en:"Tutorial",kh:"មេរៀនណែនាំ"},tutorialTitle:{en:"Guided Tour",kh:"មេរៀនណែនាំ"},tutorialNext:{en:"Next Step",kh:"បន្ទាប់"},tutorialPrev:{en:"Previous",kh:"ថយក្រោយ"},tutorialFinish:{en:"Finish",kh:"រួចរាល់"},setPassword:{en:"Set Password",kh:"កំណត់ពាក្យសម្ងាត់"},setPasswordPlaceholder:{en:"Minimum 6 characters",kh:"យ៉ាងតិច ៦ ខ្ទង់"},securingAccount:{en:"Securing Account...",kh:"កំពុងការពារគណនី..."},upgradeToPasswordAccount:{en:"Upgrade to Permanent Account",kh:"តម្លើងទៅគណនីអចិន្ត្រៃយ៍"},loginWithPassword:{en:"Login with Password",kh:"ចូលប្រើដោយពាក្យសម្ងាត់"},upgradeSuccess:{en:"Account upgraded successfully! You can now login with your password.",kh:"ការតម្លើងគណនីបានជោគជ័យ! ឥឡូវនេះអ្នកអាចចូលប្រើជាមួយពាក្យសម្ងាត់របស់អ្នកបាន។"},passwordResetSent:{en:"Password reset email sent! Check your inbox.",kh:"អ៊ីមែលសម្រាប់ប្តូរពាក្យសម្ងាត់ត្រូវបានផ្ញើ! សូមពិនិត្យប្រអប់សំបុត្ររបស់អ្នក។"},aiMistakeNote:{en:"Note: AI is a tool and can still make mistakes. Always review the output for accuracy.",kh:"ចំណាំ៖ AI គឺជាឧបករណ៍ជំនួយប៉ុណ្ោះ ហើយវាអាចនឹងមានការខុសឆ្គងខ្លះៗ។ សូមពិនិត្យ lទ្ធផលឱ្យបានច្បាស់លាស់។"},modelOverloadedTitle:{en:"System Busy",kh:"ម៉ាស៊ីន AI កំពុងមមាញឹកខ្លាំង"},modelOverloadedDesc:{en:"Our neural cores are currently handling high traffic. We have fully refunded your credits. Please come back tomorrow.",kh:"ម៉ូដែល AI កំពុងមានការប្រើប្រាស់ច្រើនហួសកម្រិត។ យើងបានប្រគល់ Credits ជូនអ្នកវិញហើយ។ សូមព្យាយាមម្តងទៀតនៅថ្ងៃស្អែក។"},quotaExceededTitle:{en:"System Overloaded",kh:"ម៉ាស៊ីនមមាញឹកខ្លាំង"},quotaExceededDesc:{en:"So many people are using Sombok AI right now! We've reached our system limit or the model is overloaded. We have returned your credits to your balance. Please come back tomorrow.",kh:"មានអ្នកប្រើប្រាស់ សំបុក AI ច្រើនណាស់នៅពេលនេះ! ប្រព័ន្ធកំពុងមមាញឹកខ្លាំង។ យើងបានប្រគល់ Credits ជូនអ្នកវិញហើយ។ សូមព្យាយាមម្តងទៀតនៅថ្ងៃស្អែក។"},retryNow:{en:"Try Again Now",kh:"ព្យាយាមម្តងទៀត"},cooldownActive:{en:"Cooldown Active",kh:"កំពុងរង់ចាំ"},accuracyNoteTitle:{en:"Neural Fidelity Advisory",kh:"ការណែនាំអំពីភាពត្រឹមត្រូវនៃរូបភាព"},accuracyNote1:{en:"AI can still hallucinate or distort structural symmetry in complex perspective shifts.",kh:"AI អាចនឹងមានការភាន់ច្រឡំ ឬបង្ខូចទ្រង់ទ្រាយសំណង់ក្នុងមុំកាមេរ៉ាស្មុស្មាញ។"},accuracyNote2:{en:"Best results are achieved through Iteration. Render a view multiple times if the first attempt lacks fidelity.",kh:"លទ្ធផលល្អបំផុតគឺទទួលបានតាមរយៈការសាកល្បងច្រើនដង (Iteration)។"},accuracyNote3:{en:"Utilizing all Spatial Blueprints in the Hub significantly increases geometry accuracy.",kh:"ការប្រើប្រាស់ប្លង់យោង (Blueprints) គ្រប់ជ្រុងជួយឱ្យរូបរាងសំណង់កាន់តែត្រឹមត្រូវ។"},accuracyUnderstand:{en:"I Understand",kh:"យល់ព្រម"},productObjectDramaticSmokeIce:{en:"Dramatic Smoke & Ice",kh:"ផ្សែង និងទឹកកក"},productObjectWaterSplashes:{en:"Water Splashes",kh:"ដំណក់ទឹកខ្ទាត"},productObjectFloatingPetals:{en:"Floating Petals",kh:"ស្រទាប់ផ្កាហោះ"},productObjectNeonLightStreaks:{en:"Neon Light Streaks",kh:"ខ្សែពន្លឺនេអុង"},productObjectGoldDust:{en:"Gold Dust",kh:"ម្សៅមាស"},productObjectFreshFruitSlices:{en:"Fresh Fruit Slices",kh:"ចំណិតផ្ែឈើស្រស់"},lightingStudio:{en:"Studio Softbox",kh:"ពន្លឺស្ទូឌីយោ"},shadowSoft:{en:"Soft & Subtle",kh:"ស្រមោលស្រទន់"},reflectionSubtle:{en:"Subtle Gloss",kh:"ចំណាំងស្រាលៗ"},shotEyeLevel:{en:"Eye-level",kh:"កម្រិតភ្នែក"},seed:{en:"Seed Code",kh:"លេខកូដ Seed"},sceneCafeTable:{en:"Cafe Table",kh:"តុហាងកាហ្វេ"},sceneCafeBackground:{en:"Cafe Background",kh:"បរិយាកាសក្នុងហាងកាហ្វេ"},sceneCoffeeShopWindow:{en:"Coffee Shop Window",kh:"បង្អួចហាងកាហ្វេ"},sceneMinimalistStudio:{en:"Minimalist Studio",kh:"ស្ទូឌីយោបែបសាមញ្ញ"},sceneBoutiqueShelf:{en:"Boutique Shelf",kh:"ធ្នើហាងទំនើប"},sceneMarbleCountertop:{en:"Marble Countertop",kh:"តុថ្មម៉ាប"},sceneNatureForestFloor:{en:"Forest Floor",kh:"ប្លង់ក្នុងព្រៃធម្មជាតិ"},sceneGardenPatio:{en:"Garden Patio",kh:"រានហាលសួនច្បារ"},sceneParkBench:{en:"Park Bench",kh:"កៅអីអង្គុយក្នុងសួន"},scenePicnicBlanket:{en:"Picnic Blanket",kh:"ប្លង់ដំណើរកម្សាន្តភីកនិក"},sceneBeachSand:{en:"Beach Sand",kh:"លើខ្សាច់មាត់សមុទ្រ"},sceneUrbanStreetStyle:{en:"Urban Street Style",kh:"បែបផ្លូវក្នុងក្រុង"},sceneDarkMoody:{en:"Dark & Moody",kh:"បែបងងឹតមានអារណ៍"},sceneAreaSunrise:{en:"Angkor Sunrise",kh:"ថ្ងៃរះនៅអង្គរ"},sceneCambodianMarket:{en:"Cambodian Market",kh:"ផ្សារខ្មែរ"},scenePhnomPenhRiverside:{en:"Phnom Penh Riverside",kh:"មាត់ទន្លេភ្នំពេញ"},sceneKepCrabShack:{en:"Kep Crab Shack",kh:"តូបលក់ក្តាមនៅកែប"},sceneMondulkiriCoffee:{en:"Mondulkiri Coffee Plantation",kh:"ចម្ការកាហ្វេមណ្ឌលគីរី"},sceneKhmerStiltHouse:{en:"Khmer Stilt House",kh:"ផ្ទះខ្មែរខ្ពស់ផុតពីដី"},sceneLuxuryHotel:{en:"Luxury Hotel Lobby",kh:"សណ្ឋាគារប្រណិត"},sceneMatcha:{en:"Matcha",kh:"តែបៃតង ម៉ាត់ឆា"},sceneGreenTea:{en:"Green Tea",kh:"តែបៃតង"},sceneHoneyTea:{en:"Honey Tea",kh:"តែទឹកឃ្មុំ"},sceneCoconut:{en:"Coconut",kh:"ទឹកដូង"},scenePassionFruitDrink:{en:"Passion Fruit Drink",kh:"ទឹកផាសិន"},sceneChocolate:{en:"Chocolate",kh:"សូកូឡា"},sceneButterflyPea:{en:"Butterfly Pea",kh:"ផ្កាអញ្ចាញ"},sceneHalloween:{en:"Halloween",kh:"បុណ្យ Halloween"},sceneChristmas:{en:"Christmas",kh:"បុណ្យ Christmas"},sceneNewYear:{en:"New Year",kh:"ចូលឆ្នាំសកល"},sceneKhmerNewYear:{en:"Khmer New Year",kh:"ចូលឆ្នាំខ្មែរ"},lightingNatural:{en:"Natural Window Light",kh:"ពន្លឺពីបង្អួចធម្មជាតិ"},lightingDramatic:{en:"Dramatic Spotlight",kh:"ពន្លឺស្ប៉តឡាយខ្លាំងៗ"},lightingGoldenHour:{en:"Golden Hour",kh:"ពន្លឺម៉ោងមាស"},lightingNeon:{en:"Neon Vibe",kh:"ពន្លឺនេអុង"},lightingVolumetric:{en:"Volumetric / God Rays",kh:"ពន្លឺចាំងចាក់មក"},lightingRim:{en:"Rim Lighting",kh:"ពន្លឺដេញតាមគែម"},shadowNone:{en:"None",kh:"គ្មាន"},shadowSharp:{en:"Sharp & Defined",kh:"ស្រមោលច្បាស់ៗ"},shadowDramatic:{en:"Long & Dramatic",kh:"ស្រមោលវែងៗ"},reflectionNone:{en:"Matte (No Reflection)",kh:"គ្មានចំណាំង"},reflectionHigh:{en:"High Gloss",kh:"ចំណាំងខ្លាំង"},reflectionWet:{en:"Wet Look",kh:"ចំណាំងទឹកសើម"},shotHighAngle:{en:"High-angle",kh:"ប្លង់ពីលើ"},shotLowAngle:{en:"Low-angle",kh:"ប្លង់ពីក្រោម"},shotTopDown:{en:"Top-down / Flat Lay",kh:"ប្លង់ពីលើត្រង់"},shotMacro:{en:"Macro / Close-up",kh:"ប្លង់ជិតបំផុត"},foregroundOverhangingTrees:{en:"Overhanging Trees",kh:"មែកឈើគ្របដណ្តប់ខាងលើ"},foregroundDappledTreeShadows:{en:"Dappled Tree Shadows",kh:"ស្រមោលដើមឈើមានពន្លឺ"},foregroundFramingShadeTree:{en:"Shade Tree Framing",kh:"ដើមឈើម្លប់បាំងចំហៀង"},presetSeries:{en:"Photography Series",kh:"បណ្តុំរូបថតស៊េរី"},entityTooLargeTitle:{en:"Image Data Too Large",kh:"ទិន្នន័យរូបភាពធំពេក"},entityTooLargeDesc:{en:"The total size of your images exceeds the processing limit (413). Please reduce your image count or resize them to 1080p before uploading.",kh:"ទំហំរូបភាពសរុបរបស់អ្នកធំពេកលើសពីដែនកំណត់ (413)។ សូមកាត់បន្ថយចំនួនរូបភាព ឬបង្រួមទំហំរូបភាពឱ្យនៅត្រឹម 1080p មុននឹងបញ្ជូលមកម្តងទៀត។"},sustainabilityNotice:{en:"Sustainability Update",kh:"បច្ចុប្បន្នភាពនិរន្តរភាព"},sustainabilityDesc:{en:"To maintain the high quality of our Pro rendering services, we have adjusted credit costs. This ensures Sombok AI remains sustainable and available for professional design workflows.",kh:"ដើម្បីរក្សាគុណភាពខ្ពស់នៃសេវាកម្ម Pro rendering យើងបានកែសម្រួលតម្លៃ Credits។ នេះធានាថា សំបុក AI នឹងមាននិរន្តរភាព និងបន្តបម្រើការងាររចនាអាជីពរបស់អ្នកបានយូរអង្វែង។"},upscale:{en:"4K Upscale",kh:"ពង្រីកគុណភាព 4K"},upscaling:{en:"Neural Upscaling...",kh:"កំពុងពង្រីកគុណភាព..."},cookieTitle:{en:"Cookies",kh:"ខូឃី (Cookies)"},cookieDescription:{en:'We use essential cookies to keep you signed in automatically and remember your preferences. Clicking "Accept All" ensures you will not need to re-type your email every time you open Sombok AI.',kh:'យើងប្រើប្រាស់ Cookie ដើម្បីរក្សាការ Login របស់អ្នកដោយស្វ័យប្រវត្តិ និងចងចាំការកំណត់ផ្សេងៗ។ ការចុច "យល់ព្រមទាំងអស់" នឹងធានាថាអ្នកមិនចាំបាច់វាយ Email សាជាថ្មីរាល់ពេលបើក សំបុក AI នោះទេ។'},cookieFeatureLogin:{en:"Stay signed in automatically",kh:"រក្សាការ Login ដោយស្វ័យប្រវត្តិ"},cookieFeaturePreferences:{en:"Save custom themes & settings",kh:"ចងចាំរូបរាង និងការកំណត់ផ្ទាល់ខ្លួន"},cookieCheckboxLabel:{en:"I accept cookies to stay signed in automatically",kh:"ខ្ញុំយល់ព្រមប្រើ Cookie ដើម្បីរក្សាការ Login ដោយស្វ័យប្រវត្តិ"},cookieConfirmChoice:{en:"Confirm & Continue",kh:"បញ្ជាក់ & បន្ត"},cookieAcceptAll:{en:"ACCEPT & STAY SIGNED IN",kh:"យល់ព្រម & រក្សាការចូល"},cookieDecline:{en:"DECLINE",kh:"បដិសេធ"},cookieStatusAccepted:{en:"Accepted",kh:"បានយល់ព្រម"},cookieStatusDeclined:{en:"Declined",kh:"បានបដិសេធ"},cookieStatusNotSet:{en:"Not Set",kh:"មិនទាន់កំណត់"},featureVideoAnimation:{en:"Video Animation",kh:"វីដេអូ​អាណ៊ីម៉ាស្យុង"},videoAnimationStudio:{en:"Video Animation Studio",kh:"ស្ទូឌីយោវីដេអូអាណ៊ីម៉ាស្យុង"},videoAnimationDesc:{en:"Transform your renders into cinematic animations",kh:"បំប្លែងរូបភាពអ្នកទៅជាវីដេអូភាពយន្ត"},quickStartTemplates:{en:"Quick Start Templates",kh:"គំរូចាប់ផ្តើមរហ័ស"},templatesDesc:{en:"Choose a pre-configured template to get started quickly",kh:"ជ្រើសរើសគំរូដែលបានកំណត់ជាមុនដើម្បីចាប់ផ្តើមរហ័ស"},storyboardTimeline:{en:"Render History Storyboard",kh:"ស្តូរីបត្រូដប្រវត្តិ Render"},storyboardDesc:{en:"Click to select FIRST FRAME (green), then LAST FRAME (red)",kh:"ចុចជ្រើសរើសស៊ុមដំបូង (បៃតង) បន្ទាប់មកស៊ុមចុងក្រោយ (ក្រហម)"},noRenderHistory:{en:"No renders available. Generate some renders first!",kh:"មិនមានរូបភាព Render។ សូមបង្កើត Render ជាមុនសិន!"},keyframeEditor:{en:"Keyframe Editor",kh:"កែស្ការស៊ុមសំខាន់"},firstFrame:{en:"First Frame",kh:"ស៊ុមដំបូង"},lastFrame:{en:"Last Frame",kh:"ស៊ុមចុងក្រោយ"},cameraMovement:{en:"Camera Movement",kh:"ចលនាកាមេរ៉ា"},transitionEffects:{en:"Transition Effects",kh:"ផលប៉ះពាល់ផ្លាស់ប្តូរ"},videoSettings:{en:"Video Settings",kh:"ការកំណត់វីដេអូ"},credits:{en:"credits",kh:"ពិន្ទុ"},cameraPanLeft:{en:"Pan Left",kh:"ប្រមូលផ្តុំឆ្វេង"},cameraPanLeftDesc:{en:"Smooth horizontal movement left",kh:"ចលនាផ្ដេកទៅឆ្វេង"},cameraPanRight:{en:"Pan Right",kh:"ប្រមូលផ្តុំស្តាំ"},cameraPanRightDesc:{en:"Smooth horizontal movement right",kh:"ចលនាផ្ដេកទៅស្តាំ"},cameraZoomIn:{en:"Zoom In",kh:"ពង្រីក"},cameraZoomInDesc:{en:"Push into the subject",kh:"ចុះជិតទៅវត្ថុ"},cameraZoomOut:{en:"Zoom Out",kh:"បង្រួម"},cameraZoomOutDesc:{en:"Pull back to reveal context",kh:"ថយក្រោយដើម្បីបង្ហាញបរិបទ"},cameraOrbitCW:{en:"Orbit CW",kh:"វិល CW"},cameraOrbitCWDesc:{en:"Clockwise orbital movement",kh:"ចលនាវិលតាមទ្រនិចនាឡិកា"},cameraOrbitCCW:{en:"Orbit CCW",kh:"វិល CCW"},cameraOrbitCCWDesc:{en:"Counter-clockwise movement",kh:"ចលនាវិលច្រាសទ្រនិចនាឡិកា"},cameraCraneUp:{en:"Crane Up",kh:"ឡើងលើ"},cameraCraneUpDesc:{en:"Ascending vertical movement",kh:"ចលនាបញ្ឈរឡើងលើ"},cameraCraneDown:{en:"Crane Down",kh:"ចុះក្រោម"},cameraCraneDownDesc:{en:"Descending movement",kh:"ចលនាចុះក្រោម"},cameraDollyForward:{en:"Dolly Forward",kh:"ទៅមុខ"},cameraDollyForwardDesc:{en:"Forward tracking shot",kh:"ចលនាទៅមុខ"},cameraStatic:{en:"Static",kh:"ថេរ"},cameraStaticDesc:{en:"No movement, static hold",kh:"គ្មានចលនា"},camNone:{en:"None",kh:"មិនមាន"},camStaticCinematic:{en:"Static",kh:"ថេរ"},camSlowDollyIn:{en:"Dolly-In",kh:"ចុះជិត"},camSlowDollyOut:{en:"Dolly-Out",kh:"ថយក្រោយ"},camPanLeft:{en:"Pan Left",kh:"ប្រមូលឆ្វេង"},camPanRight:{en:"Pan Right",kh:"ប្រមូលស្តាំ"},camTiltUp:{en:"Tilt Up",kh:"រំកិលឡើង"},camTiltDown:{en:"Tilt Down",kh:"រំកិលចុះ"},camGlideLeft:{en:"Glide Left",kh:"រំកិលឆ្វេង"},camGlideRight:{en:"Glide Right",kh:"រំកិលស្តាំ"},camAmbientMotion:{en:"Ambient Motion",kh:"ចលនាជុំវិញ"},camDayToNight:{en:"Day to Night",kh:"ពីថ្ងៃទៅយប់"},camAerialReveal:{en:"Aerial Reveal",kh:"បង្ហាញពីលើអាកាស"},camOrbitLeft:{en:"Orbit Left",kh:"វិលឆ្វេង"},camOrbitRight:{en:"Orbit Right",kh:"វិលស្តាំ"},transitionCut:{en:"Cut",kh:"កាត់"},transitionCutDesc:{en:"Instant switch",kh:"ផ្លាស់ប្តូរភ្លាមៗ"},transitionCrossfade:{en:"Crossfade",kh:"លាយបន្តិច"},transitionCrossfadeDesc:{en:"Smooth blend",kh:"លាយរលូន"},transitionWipeLeft:{en:"Wipe Left",kh:"លុបឆ្វេង"},transitionWipeLeftDesc:{en:"Wipe from right to left",kh:"លុបពីស្តាំទៅឆ្វេង"},transitionWipeRight:{en:"Wipe Right",kh:"លុបស្តាំ"},transitionWipeRightDesc:{en:"Wipe from left to right",kh:"លុបពីឆ្វេងទៅស្តាំ"},transitionWipeUp:{en:"Wipe Up",kh:"លុបឡើងលើ"},transitionWipeUpDesc:{en:"Wipe bottom to top",kh:"លុបពីក្រោមឡើងលើ"},transitionWipeDown:{en:"Wipe Down",kh:"លុបចុះក្រោម"},transitionWipeDownDesc:{en:"Wipe top to bottom",kh:"លុបពីលើចុះក្រោម"},transitionZoomThrough:{en:"Zoom Through",kh:"ពង្រីកតាមរយៈ"},transitionZoomThroughDesc:{en:"Zoom transition",kh:"ផ្លាស់ប្តូរតាមរយៈការពង្រីក"},transitionRotate:{en:"Rotate",kh:"បង្វិល"},transitionRotateDesc:{en:"Rotating transition",kh:"ផ្លាស់ប្តូរតាមរយៈការបង្វិល"},transitionPushLeft:{en:"Push Left",kh:"រុញឆ្វេង"},transitionPushLeftDesc:{en:"Push frame left",kh:"រុញស៊ុមទៅឆ្វេង"},transitionPushRight:{en:"Push Right",kh:"រុញស្តាំ"},transitionPushRightDesc:{en:"Push frame right",kh:"រុញស៊ុមទៅស្តាំ"},transitionMorph:{en:"Morph",kh:"បំប្លែង"},transitionMorphDesc:{en:"Seamless morphing",kh:"ការបំប្លែងរលូន"},transitionBlur:{en:"Blur",kh:"ព្រិល"},transitionBlurDesc:{en:"Blur transition",kh:"ផ្លាស់ប្តូរដោយព្រិល"},transitionLightLeak:{en:"Light Leak",kh:"ពន្លឺលេច"},transitionLightLeakDesc:{en:"Cine