undaries.","HARDSCAPE ANALYSIS: Analyze the existing structural hardscape, including tiles, paving, roads, driveways, pathways, retaining walls, boundaries, and architectural surfaces. Respect and preserve all hardscape elements. Where existing soil, planting beds, landscape zones, or grass are visible, intelligently integrate premium architectural greenery that complements the original landscape design.","GARDEN AESTHETIC: High-end architectural greenery real-estate landscape design. Include established sculptural trees with wooden tree supports, elegant low hedges, and a carefully curated selection of tropical plants with balanced density and natural spacing. Prioritize clean, minimalist landscaping that complements the architecture without overwhelming the facade","Capture with professional architectural photography aesthetics, featuring smooth optical clarity, clean high-resolution detail, pristine image quality, realistic light-scattering, and subtle atmospheric depth. Ensure a high dynamic range that preserves detail in both deep shadows and bright highlights without looking digital or flat"],cameraAngle:ie.DEFAULT,dayControl:q.DAWN,siteContext:W.BOREY_GATED_COMMUNITY,selectedObjects:[],lightingControl:J.WARM},[O.PROXY_TO_REAL]:{negativePrompt:be,renderStyle:re.PHOTOREALISTIC,presetInstructions:["PRIMARY CONSTRAINT: Preserve all architectural geometry exactly as in the source image. This includes massing, proportions, rooflines, façade articulation, window and door placement, and all structural relationships. No changes of any kind.","MATERIAL & TEXTURE LOCK (1:1 MATCH): Replicate every material, surface finish, color value, and texture from the source structure with exact fidelity. No substitutions, reinterpretations, stylization, or material changes.","PHOTOREALISM ENHANCEMENT (BOUNDARY-LOCKED): Enhance realism only by increasing material quality within their original, unaltered regions. Do not shift, expand, blend, or redefine material boundaries.","PROXY REPLACEMENT (CRITICAL RULE): Identify all low-poly, white/black box proxies, or silhouette placeholder trees in the source image. Completely replace these placeholder objects with highly detailed, photorealistic, mature trees and plants (such as tropical palms, ficus, or ornamental garden trees) matching the exact location and scale of the proxies.","GARDEN AESTHETIC: Add lush professional real-estate landscaping. Integrate the new vegetation naturally into the environment.","Capture with professional architectural photography aesthetics, featuring smooth optical clarity, clean high-resolution detail, pristine image quality, realistic light-scattering, and subtle atmospheric depth. Ensure a high dynamic range that preserves detail in both deep shadows and bright highlights without looking digital or flat"],cameraAngle:ie.DEFAULT,dayControl:q.DAWN,siteContext:W.BOREY_GATED_COMMUNITY,selectedObjects:[],lightingControl:J.WARM},[O.SB_EXTERIOR]:{negativePrompt:be,renderStyle:re.PHOTOREALISTIC,presetInstructions:["PRIMARY CONSTRAINT: Preserve all architectural geometry exactly as in the source image. This includes massing, proportions, rooflines, façade articulation, window and door placement, and all structural relationships. No changes of any kind.","MATERIAL & TEXTURE LOCK (1:1 MATCH): Replicate every material, surface finish, color value, and texture from the source structure with exact fidelity. No substitutions, reinterpretations, stylization, or material changes.","PHOTOREALISM ENHANCEMENT (BOUNDARY-LOCKED): Enhance realism only by increasing material quality within their original, unaltered regions. Do not shift, expand, blend, or redefine material boundaries.","HARDSCAPE ANALYSIS: Analyze the existing structural hardscape, including tiles, paving, roads, driveways, pathways, retaining walls, boundaries, and architectural surfaces. Respect and preserve all hardscape elements. Where existing soil, planting beds, landscape zones, or grass are visible, intelligently integrate premium architectural greenery that complements the original landscape design.","GARDEN AESTHETIC: manicured foundation garden with layered cloud-pruned ball topiaries, Clusters of variegated agave rosettes and deep burgundy-leaved foliage plants, bird-of-paradise leaves emerging near the entrance, all edged in white river-rock mulch bordering a trimmed lawn, light grey broom-finished","Capture with professional architectural photography aesthetics, featuring smooth optical clarity, clean high-resolution detail, pristine image quality, realistic light-scattering, and subtle atmospheric depth. Ensure a high dynamic range that preserves detail in both deep shadows and bright highlights without looking digital or flat"],cameraAngle:ie.DEFAULT,dayControl:q.PASTEL_SUNSET,siteContext:W.LUXURY_HOUSING_ESTATE,selectedObjects:[A.LANDSCAPE_LIGHTING],lightingControl:J.WARM,isDownlightEnabled:!1,isCabinetLedEnabled:!1},[O.REAL_ESTATE_PHOTO_TYPE_III]:{negativePrompt:be,renderStyle:re.PHOTOREALISTIC,presetInstructions:["PRIMARY CONSTRAINT: Preserve all architectural geometry exactly as in the source image. This includes massing, proportions, rooflines, façade articulation, window and door placement, and all structural relationships. No changes of any kind.","MATERIAL & TEXTURE LOCK (1:1 MATCH): Replicate every material, surface finish, color value, and texture from the source structure with exact fidelity. No substitutions, reinterpretations, stylization, or material changes.","HARDSCAPE ANALYSIS: Analyze the 3D hardscape (tile,pavement, boundaries, paths). Where soil or Grass texture are visible in the 3D model, intelligently place high-end architectural greenery.","GARDEN AESTHETIC: High-end professional real estate landscaping,Lush. Tall, dense perineter hedges providing privacy, structured planting beds featuring low shrubs, flowering plants. and ornamental trees.","Capture with professional architectural photography aesthetics, featuring smooth optical clarity, clea