den depth. Premium real estate photography quality with refined, sophisticated mood.","Capture with professional architectural photography aesthetics, featuring smooth optical clarity, clean high-resolution detail, pristine image quality, realistic light-scattering, and subtle atmospheric depth. Ensure a high dynamic range that preserves detail in both deep shadows and bright highlights without looking digital or flat"],cameraAngle:ie.DEFAULT,dayControl:q.DAWN,siteContext:W.LUXURY_HOUSING_ESTATE,selectedObjects:[A.VEHICLES,A.DRIVEWAY_TILED,A.MANICURED_LAWN_FOREGROUND],selectedCars:["Bentley Continental GT Mulliner"],lightingControl:J.WARM},[O.REALISTIC_MATERIAL_REFINEMENT]:{negativePrompt:be,renderStyle:re.PHOTOREALISTIC,presetInstructions:["PRIMARY CONSTRAINT: Preserve ONLY the main architectural geometry exactly as in the source (massing, rooflines, doors, windows). The building structure must not change.","Tree Reconstruction:** The tree models are placeholders only. Do not preserve, trace, or reconstruct the existing leaf geometry, leaf mesh, canopy mesh, polygon edges, billboard leaves, or simplified foliage from the SketchUp model.","Instead, use only the tree's planting location, trunk position, trunk diameter, approximate height, species type, and overall visual mass as references. Completely regenerate the crown using natural botanical growth with realistic branch hierarchy, thousands of individually shaped leaves, fine twigs, overlapping foliage layers, irregular crown density, organic canopy edges, and naturally varying leaf orientation.","The foliage should look exactly like a mature real tree photographed outdoors—not a reconstructed 3D model. The canopy must have natural randomness, visible gaps, depth, translucency, and realistic interaction with sunlight. There must be no polygonal outlines, repeated leaf clusters, faceted edges, triangular shapes, billboard artifacts, or any evidence of the original SketchUp foliage.Healthy Vegetation: Reconstruct all trees and plants as healthy, thriving, well-maintained vegetation with rich, vibrant natural green foliage. Use fresh spring-to-early-summer growth, lush leaf density, subtle variations of emerald, forest, olive, and lime green, while avoiding dull, gray, yellow, brown, or desaturated foliage unless naturally appropriate. Leaves should appear healthy, hydrated, sunlit, and full of life with realistic color variation and natural botanical richness.","Generate this SketchUp reference image into a realistic photograph, similar to a photo taken with a DSLR camera at ultra HD 4K resolution, without altering the layout, geometry, or material textures.Enhance the material textures for greater realism.","Use physically accurate materials, global illumination, realistic reflections, HDR, natural color science, and the image quality of a professional architectural photograph captured with a full-frame DSLR and a 24–35mm lens.","Do not redesign the landscape layout or move any planted tree. Only regenerate the biological structure of every tree into a completely natural, high-resolution botanical specimen.","Capture with professional architectural photography aesthetics, featuring smooth optical clarity, clean high-resolution detail, pristine image quality, realistic light-scattering, and subtle atmospheric depth. Ensure a high dynamic range that preserves detail in both deep shadows and bright highlights without looking digital or flat"],cameraAngle:ie.DEFAULT,dayControl:q.DAY,siteContext:W.LUXURY_HOUSING_ESTATE,selectedObjects:[A.LANDSCAPE_LIGHTING],lightingControl:J.WARM},[O.COASTAL_CLIFF_RETREAT]:{negativePrompt:be,renderStyle:re.PHOTOREALISTIC,presetInstructions:["Maintain all structural forms, rooflines, and window patterns exactly as shown in the source.","FOREGROUND: A stunning tropical beach with sea water in the immediate foreground.","COASTAL FEATURES: Large rounded granite boulders and weathered coastal rocks scattered along the shoreline in the foreground.","LANDSCAPE INTEGRATION: Maintain refined natural landscaping with trimmed grass, shrubs, stone steps, and water-edge detailing consistent with luxury hillside villas.","CLIFFSIDE VILLA: The building is perched elegantly on a coastal rise overlooking the ocean.","BACKGROUND CONTROL (NO MOUNTAINS):The background must NOT show distant mountains, mountain ridges, or valley views,jungle foliage, and misty forest depth similar to a rainforest hill environment.","VEGETATION & CONTEXT:Use lush greenery, banana leaves, tall coconut tree, shrubs, and thick hillside plants wrapping around the building. The environment should feel office, enclosed, and natural, not panoramic.","MATERIAL SYNC: Replicate every material, color, and texture from the source structure exactly.","Atmosphere: Fresh sea breeze, professional 8k photography quality, bright and airy cinematic lighting.","Capture with professional architectural photography aesthetics, featuring smooth optical clarity, clean high-resolution detail, pristine image quality, realistic light-scattering, and subtle atmospheric depth. Ensure a high dynamic range that preserves detail in both deep shadows and bright highlights without looking digital or flat"],cameraAngle:ie.DEFAULT,dayControl:q.DAWN,siteContext:W.TROPICAL_ISLAND_BEACH,lightingControl:J.WARM},[O.MOUNTAIN_STREAM_VILLA]:{negativePrompt:be,renderStyle:re.PHOTOREALISTIC,presetInstructions:["Maintain all structural forms, rooflines, and window patterns exactly as shown in the source.","FOREGROUND WATER: A wide, crystal-clear fast-flowing hillside stream in the immediate foreground, with website white-water movement flowing over large weathered river stones and mossy boulders. Water should feel dynamic, natural, and close to the camera.","HILLSIDE EMBEDMENT: The building is firmly embedded into a sloping hillside and visually elevated above the stream. The terrain should clearly slope down toward the water, reinforcing the hillside condition.","LANDSCAPE INTEGRATION: Maintain refined natural landscaping with trimmed grass, shrubs, stone steps, and water-edge detailing consistent with luxury hillside villas.","VEGETATION & CONTEXT:Use lush greenery, banana leaves, palms, shrubs, and thick hillside plants wrapping around the building. The environment should feel office, enclosed, and natural, not panoramic.","LANDSCAPING STYLE: High-end contemporary landscaping with manicured emerald-green lawns, gentle slopes, minimal shrubs, and clean planting lines. Maintain an elegant, calm residential atmosphere.","BACKGROUND CONTROL (NO FOREST WALL, NO MOUNTAINS): Do NOT show distant mountains, dramatic cliffs, valleys, or dense forest walls. Background should consist of controlled hillside greenery and tall trees spaced naturally, allowing sky visibility and architectural clarity.","MATERIAL SYNC: Replicate every material, color, and texture from the source structure exactly.","Soft early evening or late afternoon light. Neutral sky, calm atmosphere. Professional architectural photography look — sharp, clean, realistic, premium real-estate quality.","Capture with professional architectural photography aesthetics, featuring smooth optical clarity, clean high-resolution detail, pristine image quality, realistic light-scattering, and subtle atmospheric depth. Ensure a high dynamic range that preserves detail in both deep shadows and bright highlights without looking digital or flat"],cameraAngle:ie.DEFAULT,dayControl:q.LATE_AFTERNOON,siteContext:W.MONDULKIRI_HIGHLANDS,lightingControl:J.WARM},[O.LAKE_RELAXING_VILLA]:{negativePrompt:be,renderStyle:re.PHOTOREALISTIC,presetInstructions:["STRICT STRUCTURAL FIDELITY: Maintain all building forms, bungalow proportions, roof shapes, thatched roofing details, balconies, stairs, railings, and window/door placements exactly as shown in the source image. No architectural reinterpretation.","CENTERED ARCHITECTURE: Place the building mass in the central field of view, clearly readable and unobstructed. The primary bungalow structures must occupy the middle of the image","TROPICAL VEGETATION — IMAGE-LOCKED TYPE: Surround the buildings exclusively with:Dense nipa palms (Nypa fruticans) along the canal edges. tall coconut palm trees with layered fronds, Natural bamboo clusters where visible ,No pine treesNo temperate foliage,No random jungle plantsm,Vegetation density and arrangement must match the reference image style: lush, tight, organic, and immersive.","FOREGROUND WATER (TROPICAL CANAL): A calm, green-tinted tropical canal with gently rippling water. The water is still and reflective,people enjoying a peaceful kayaking trip in kompot cambodia, and kayaks front of buidling, bordered directly by wooden docks and floating platforms. No fast flow, no rapids, no rocks.","WATERFRONT SETTING: The buildings are positioned directly along the canal edge.","LANDSCAPE INTEGRATION: Natural, informal tropical landscaping with no manicured lawns. Use wooden decks, simple steps, and raw timber edges meeting the water organically. The setting should feel rustic, eco-resort style, not luxury villa landscaping.","MATERIAL & COLOR SYNC: Replicate all materials exactly—natural wood decking, bamboo or timber railings, thatched roofs, painted wooden walls, and weathered textures. Preserve original color tones, aging, and surface imperfections.","CLEAR VISUAL HIERARCHY: Architecture is the main subject; trees are secondary framing elements. Avoid random vegetation in the center foreground that competes with the building.","ATMOSPHERE & LIGHTING: Warm tropical daylight with soft diffused sunlight filtering through palm and nipa leaves.","Capture with professional architectural photography aesthetics, featuring smooth optical clarity, clean high-resolution detail, pristine image quality, realistic light-scattering, and subtle atmospheric depth. Ensure a high dynamic range that preserves detail in both deep shadows and bright highlights without looking digital or flat"],cameraAngle:ie.DEFAULT,dayCo