essional architectural photography aesthetics, featuring smooth optical clarity, clean high-resolution detail, pristine image quality, realistic light-scattering, and subtle atmospheric depth. Ensure a high dynamic range that preserves detail in both deep shadows and bright highlights without looking digital or flat"],cameraAngle:ie.DEFAULT,dayControl:q.LATE_AFTERNOON,siteContext:W.LAKESIDE_MANOR,lightingControl:J.WARM},[O.RICE_FIELD]:{negativePrompt:be,renderStyle:re.PHOTOREALISTIC,presetInstructions:["PRIMARY CONSTRAINT: Preserve all architectural geometry, camera perspective, and viewpoint exactly as in the source image. Do not change the camera angle, focal length, field of view, or structural positions.","MATERIAL & TEXTURE LOCK (1:1 MATCH): Replicate every material, surface finish, color value, and texture from the source structure with exact fidelity. No substitutions, reinterpretations, stylization, or material changes.","Dense healthy rice plants with realistic blade variation and natural wind movement.","Authentic rural Cambodian countryside mood with distant small houses and trees softly visible on horizon.","Natural reflections and soft specular highlights on glasses and object.","Capture with professional architectural photography aesthetics, featuring smooth optical clarity, clean high-resolution detail, pristine image quality, realistic light-scattering, and subtle atmospheric depth. Ensure a high dynamic range that preserves detail in both deep shadows and bright highlights without looking digital or flat"],cameraAngle:ie.DEFAULT,dayControl:q.LATE_AFTERNOON,siteContext:W.RICE_PADDIES,lightingControl:J.WARM},[O.KOH_RONG_VILLA]:{negativePrompt:be,renderStyle:re.PHOTOREALISTIC,presetInstructions:["STRICT STRUCTURAL FIDELITY: Maintain all architectural geometry, rooflines, and window patterns exactly as shown in the source image. No changes to the building design.","ENVIRONMENT: Surround the main building with Luxury tropical island resort at Koh Rong beach, Cambodia.","CENTERED ARCHITECTURE: Place the building mass in the central field of view, clearly readable and unobstructed. The primary bungalow structures must occupy the middle of the image","CAMERA VIEW RULE (VERY IMPORTANT): View from shallow sea water looking toward land. Scene depth order: SEA foreground → VERY WIDE WHITE SAND BEACH → OPEN SAND / DRY COASTAL GROUND → BUILDING → MOUNTAIN or LOW TROPICAL TREES background. Building must sit FAR BACK from shoreline","COASTAL RESORT CONTEXT (LIKE REFERENCE): Open, bright beachfront with large sand areas, scattered palm trees, walking paths, and low-density villa arrangement.","BUILDING DISTRIBUTION: Villas spaced apart with sandy ground, small garden patches, decks, and pathways between them. Organized but natural layout.","BEACH SCALE: Very wide white sand beach, smooth, clean, open. Large visual distance between shoreline and villa zone.","BACKGROUND LOCK — LAND ONLY: Behind building show mountains, coastal hills, or light tropical tree line. No sea behind building.","VEGETATION STYLE: Sparse coastal palms, small shrubs, low landscaping. No dense rainforest. No thick tropical walls of trees.","BACKGROUND LOCK: Mountains or coastal hills in far background. Sea only on one side, not surrounding the land.","FOREGROUND: Clear shallow turquoise water touching wide white sand with soft ripples and natural beach texture.","LANDSCAPE STYLE: Resort planning, open air feeling, walkable, breathable space.","VISUAL HIERARCHY: Main building remains hero but supported by surrounding villas and resort environment.","LIGHTING: Bright tropical sun, clear sky, high visibility, fresh coastal atmosphere (not humid jungle shade).","MATERIAL SYNC: Replicate all building materials, wood finishes, and color values from the source image with perfect fidelity.","Capture with professional architectural photography aesthetics, featuring smooth optical clarity, clean high-resolution detail, pristine image quality, realistic light-scatte