 and door placement, and all structural relationships. No changes of any kind.","MATERIAL & TEXTURE LOCK (1:1 MATCH): Replicate every material, surface finish, color value, and texture from the source structure with exact fidelity. No substitutions, reinterpretations, stylization, or material changes.","PHOTOREALISM ENHANCEMENT (BOUNDARY-LOCKED): Enhance realism only by increasing material quality within their original, unaltered regions. Do not shift, expand, blend, or redefine material boundaries.","INTEGRATED ROW HOUSE: The building is part of a continuous urban row. Preserve the adjacent buildings on the left and right exactly as shown in the source image to maintain local urban context.","Street Life: Busy Phnom Penh urban street with pedestrians with motion blur.","Capture with professional architectural photography aesthetics, featuring smooth optical clarity, clean high-resolution detail, pristine image quality, realistic light-scattering, and subtle atmospheric depth. Ensure a high dynamic range that preserves detail in both deep shadows and bright highlights without looking digital or flat"],cameraAngle:ie.DEFAULT,dayControl:q.OVERCAST,siteContext:W.PHNOM_PENH_STREET,lightingControl:J.WARM},[O.TOWN_HOUSE_OP2]:{negativePrompt:be,renderStyle:re.PHOTOREALISTIC,presetInstructions:["Professional commercial town-house photography.","STRICT ARCHITECTURAL FIDELITY: Maintain the target building exactly as shown in the source image.","SIDE CONTEXT LOCK (LEFT & RIGHT): Both sides must remain EMPTY LAND plots with natural bushes, shrubs, wild grass, and existing trees, exactly like the reference image. NO adjacent buildings.","SIDEWALK REQUIREMENT: Clearly visible concrete sidewalk running along the street in front of the property and continuing past both left and right sides, with realistic curb, paving pattern, and urban scale.","URBAN STREET DETAIL: Realistic road surface, curb edges, drainage gaps, and street alignment consistent with a residential neighborhood.",