itectural greenery scaled for high-altitude viewing.","GARDEN & LANDSCAPE AESTHETIC: Add lush professional masterplan landscaping. Include mature tree canopies, structured green buffer zones, and manicured green lawns that are scaled correctly for a large-scale aerial masterplan visualization, fitting precisely within logical planter zones.","Capture with professional architectural photography aesthetics, featuring smooth optical clarity, clean high-resolution detail, pristine image quality, realistic light-scattering, and subtle atmospheric depth. Ensure a high dynamic range that preserves detail in both deep shadows and bright highlights without looking digital or flat"],cameraAngle:ie.DEFAULT,dayControl:q.GOLDEN_HOUR,weather:Xe.NONE,siteContext:W.MODERN_METROPOLIS_MASTERPLAN,lightingControl:J.WARM},[O.MASTER_PLAN_TOP_VIEW]:{negativePrompt:be,renderStyle:re.PHOTOREALISTIC,presetInstructions:["NEURAL MASTERPLAN EXTRUSION: Transform this 2D top elevation into a high-quality 3D realistic top elevation view.","STRICT GEOMETRY LOCK: Preserve all architectural geometry, footprints, roads, and layout exactly as in the source image. 1:1 scale match.","3D TOP VIEW: Render as a realistic 3D aerial view with visible building heights, realistic roof materials, and detailed shadows.","WATER REALISM: Crystal clear turquoise sea water with realistic ripples, underwater depth variations, and caustics along the shoreline.","LANDSCAPE & VEGETATION: Add lush, professional landscaping. Include diverse tropical trees (palms, coconut trees), manicured green lawns, and dense coastal shrubs around the buildings.","MATERIAL FIDELITY: Replicate all colors and materials from the source elevation with high-fidelity photorealistic textures (sand, asphalt, grass, concrete).","QUALITY: Professional 8K architectural visualization, realistic PBR materials, cinematic atmosphere.","Capture with professional architectural photography aesthetics, featuring smooth optical clarity, clean high-resolution detail, pristine image quality, realistic light-scattering, and subtle atmospheric depth. Ensure a high dynamic range that preserves detail in both deep shadows and bright highlights without looking digital or flat"],cameraAngle:ie.DEFAULT,dayControl:q.DAY,siteContext:W.TROPICAL_ISLAND_BEACH,lightingControl:J.NEUTRAL},[O.MASTER_PLAN_REALISTIC]:{negativePrompt:be,renderStyle:re.PHOTOREALISTIC,presetInstructions:["Professional realistic masterplan photography.","GEOMETRIC FIDELITY: Maintain 100% of the architectural massing and environment layout from the source image. No structural changes.","MATERIAL UPGRADE: Enhance all surfaces with high-end realistic materials. Professional PBR shaders for concrete, glass, metal, and pavement.","URBAN GREENERY: Intelligently add high-quality architectural vegetation including mature trees, manicured hedges, and vibrant garden beds into the existing landscape zones.","PRESENTATION: High-fidelity architectural presentation, balanced composition, ultra-sharp focus.","Capture with professional architectural photography aesthetics, featuring smooth optical clarity, clean high-resolution detail, pristine image quality, realistic light-scattering, and subtle atmospheric depth. Ensure a high dynamic range that preserves detail in both deep shadows and bright highlights without looking digital or flat"],cameraAngle:ie.DEFAULT,dayControl:q.MORNING,siteContext:W.MODERN_METROPOLIS_DAY,lightingControl:J.WARM},[O.MASTER_PLAN_ILLUSTRATION]:{negativePrompt:be,renderStyle:re.THREE_D_RENDER,presetInstructions:["TECHNICAL MASTERPLAN ILLUSTRATION: High-end architectural competition style, clean and professional.","WATERCOLOR WASHES: Use subtle, artistic watercolor color fills for landscape zones. Soft blue for water bodies and various shades of muted green for vegetation.","PRECISE LINE WORK: Maintain crisp, thin gray lines for roads, infrastructure, building footprints, and topography contour lines.","MINIMALIST PRESENTATION: Flat 2D-style layout with a clean paper-texture background. Avoid 3D extrusion unless subtle.","SYMBOLIC VEGETATION: Represent trees and shrubs as simplified architectural symbols. Use semi-transparent circular or artistic brush-stroke forms for greenery.","DESATURATED PALETTE: Sophisticated and muted color palette. Professional architectural presentation aesthetic.","CLARITY & PRECISION: High-fidelity composition, balanced and clean layout.","Capture with professional architectural photography aesthetics, featuring smooth optical clarity, clean high-resolution detail, pristine image quality, realistic light-scattering, and subtle atmospheric depth. Ensure a high dynamic range that preserves detail in both deep shadows and bright highlights without looking digital or flat"],cameraAngle:ie.DEFAULT,dayControl:q.DAY,siteContext:W.NONE,lightingControl:J.NEUTRAL},[O.URBAN_NATURE_BALANCE]:{negativePrompt:be,renderStyle:re.PHOTOREALISTIC,presetInstructions:["PRIMARY CONSTRAINT : Preserve all architectural geometry exactly as in the source image. This includes massing, proportions, rooflines, façade articulation, window and door placement, and all structural relationships. No changes of any kind.","MATERIAL & TEXTURE LOCK (1:1 MATCH): Replicate every material, surface finish, color value, and texture from the source structure with exact fidelity. No substitutions, reinterpretations, stylization, or material changes.","PHOTOREALISM ENHANCEMENT (BOUNDARY-LOCKED): Enhance realism only by increasing material quality within their original, unaltered regions using high-fidelity photorealistic PBR shaders. Do not shift, expand, blend, or redefine material boundaries.","GARDEN AESTHETIC: High-end professional real estate landscaping.sculptural garden trees with wooden tree supports, dense Ficus hedges, and vibrant tropical plants.","Professional real estate lighting, high architectural fidelity.","Capture with professional architectural photography aesthetics, featuring smooth optical clarity, clean high-resolution detail, pristine image quality, realistic light-scattering, and subtle atmospheric depth. Ensure a high dynamic range that preserves detail in both deep shadows and bright highlights without looking digital or flat"],cameraAngle:ie.DEFAULT,dayControl:q.DAY,siteContext:W.BOREY_GATED_COMMUNITY,selectedObjects:[A.STREET_Furniture,A.VEHICLES,A.FOREGROUND_OVERHANGING_TREES,A.FOREGROUND_STREET],selectedCars:["Mercedes-Benz G63 AMG Magno Black"],lightingControl:J.OFF},[O.RAIN_TREE_ESTATE]:{negativePrompt:be,renderStyle:re.PHOTOREALISTIC,presetInstructions:["PRIMARY CONSTRAINT: Preserve all architectural geometry exactly as in the source image. This includes massing, proportions, rooflines, façade articulation, window and door placement, and all structural relationships. No changes of any kind.","MATERIAL & TEXTURE LOCK (1:1 MATCH): Replicate every material, surface finish, color value, and texture from the source structure with exact fidelity. No substitutions, reinterpretations, stylization, or material changes.","URBAN RAIN TREE ESTATE AESTHETIC: Create a scene framed by massive, mature Rain Trees (Samanea saman) in the immediate foreground and background. The trees should have broad, spreading canopies that gracefully frame the building mass.","LIGHTING & SHADOWS: Strong sunlight filtering through the dense canopy, creating complex dappled light and shadow patterns across the building facade and the ground surface.","GARDEN AESTHETIC: High-end professional landscaping.Flame trees(Delonix regia) with wooden tree supports, sculptural garden trees with wooden tree supports, dense Ficus hedges, and vibrant tropical plants. Add garden lighting and soft shadows on the ground.","Capture with professional architectural photography aesthetics, featuring smooth optical clarity, clean high-resolution detail, pristine image quality, realistic light-scattering, and subtle atmospheric depth. Ensure a high dynamic range that preserves detail in both deep shadows and bright highlights without looking digital or flat"],cameraAngle:ie.DEFAULT,dayControl:q.DAY,siteContext:W.MODERN_VILLA_GARDEN,selectedObjects:[A.VEHICLES,A.FOREGROUND_OVERHANGING_TREES],selectedCars:["Mercedes-Benz G63 AMG Magno Black"],lightingControl:J.WARM},[O.INTERIOR_REAL_ESTATE]:{negativePrompt:be,renderStyle:re.INTERIOR_PHOTO,presetInstructions:["architectural high-end photography, HDR exposure, balanced interior and exterior lighting,hyper-realistic textures, 8K resolution.","GEOMETRIC LOCK (1:1): Maintain perfect 1:1 real-world geometry. All walls, ceilings, openings, proportions, and camera perspective must remain physically accurate with zero distortion or reinterpretation.","MATERIAL & TEXTURE LOCK (1:1 ABSOLUTE MATCH):Replicate every material, surface finish, color value, gloss level, and texture from the source image with pixel-faithful accuracy. No substitutions, upgrades, reinterpretations, stylization, or material “improvement” is allowed. Materials must remain identical even if they appear imperfect, flat, or low-detail.","HYPER-REALISTIC MATERIAL OVERHAUL: Replace all textures with professionally graded PBR materials featuring physically accurate light interaction. Enhance every surface with sophisticated micro-detail, realistic roughness variations, and high-fidelity texture maps. Objects should exhibit subtle real-world imperfections like fine grain, soft micro-textures, and natural reflections that create a convincing sense of depth and luxury.","ADVANCED TEXTURE REALISM (CRITICAL): Surfaces must show: Subtle roughness variation across the same material ,Fine micro-surface detail visible only in highlights ,Correct real-world texture scale (laminate,painting, fabric weave, stone pattern, grout width),Directional continuity (laminate and fabric flow correctly),Layered material depth (base + finish + micro imperfections)","Upgrade all chandeliers and decorative lighting into ultra-realistic luxury crystal fixtures. Every crystal rod, prism, pendant, and glass element exhibits realistic transparency, refraction, internal reflections, sparkling highlights, subtle rainbow dispersion, and optical depth. Crystal appears clear and premium rather than glowing or opaque. Metal components feature realistic champagne gold, brass, chrome, or brushed finishes with natural reflections and micro-details. Preserve fixture design exactly while maximizing crystal realism, elegance, sparkle, and photographic authenticity. No plastic materials, no fake glow, no overexposed crystals, no CGI artifacts.","EDGE & CONTACT AUTHENTICITY: Slight edge softening, seam definition, and contact wear in high-touch areas. Nothing looks razor-sharp or factory-perfect.","architectural high-end photography, HDR exposure, balanced interior and exterior lighting,hyper-realistic textures, 8K resolution."],cameraAngle:ie.DEFAULT,dayControl:q.NONE,siteContext:W.NONE,selectedObjects:[],lightingControl:J.NONE,isDownlightEnabled:!0,isCabinetLedEnabled:!0,isPubLightEnabled:!1},[O.INTERIOR_PHOTOGRAPHY]:{negativePrompt:be,renderStyle:re.INTERIOR_PHOTO,presetInstructions:["MATERIAL & TEXTURE LOCK (ABSOLUTE — DO NOT OVERRIDE): Preserve every material, surface finish, color value, texture pattern, and design theme from the source image with pixel-faithful accuracy. No substitutions, no redesigns, no reinterpretations, no stylization, and no material replacements are allowed under any circumstance. The user's chosen materials and design intent are final. Enhancement means increasing realism quality of the EXISTING materials only.","SCENE-ADAPTIVE DETECTION: Analyze the source interior scene type (living room, bedroom, kitchen, bathroom, dining room, office, commercial space, restaurant, retail, lobby, corridor, or any other interior) and apply all enhancement rules contextually. Every instruction below applies universally regardless of room type.","GEOMETRIC LOCK (1:1): Maintain perfect 1:1 real-world geometry. All walls, ceilings, floors, openings, furniture placement, fixtures, appliances, cabinetry, built-in elements, proportions, and camera perspective must remain physically accurate with zero distortion or reinterpretation.","ARCHVIZ LIGHT DESIGN (CONTROLLED REALISM): Use professionally designed interior visualization lighting with cinematic quality. Soft directional daylight shapes the space with clean gradients and volumetric atmosphere. Balanced bounce light enhances depth without flattening contrast. Corners remain readable, never muddy. Include subtle light bloom on bright surfaces and realistic caustic patterns through glass elements. Adapt lighting warmth and intensity to the scene context — bright for kitchens and bathrooms, softer for bedrooms, balanced for living areas.","FABRIC & TEXTILE ENHANCEMENT (PRESERVE ORIGINAL): Keep the exact same fabric type, color, and pattern from the source. Enhance with thread-level detail — show realistic weave texture (linen crosshatch, velvet pile direction, bouclé loops, cotton twill, silk sheen) at correct scale. Add natural compression wrinkles on cushions and upholstery, visible seam stitching, and subtle wear in high-use zones. Curtains, drapes, blinds, and sheer panels must show proper fabric weight through realistic fold cascading and light transmission variation. Rugs, carpets, and mats must display fiber direction and pile height variation. Bedding must show realistic sheet layering, duvet loft, and pillow compression. Towels must display terry loop texture. Do NOT change fabric colors, patterns, or types.","MATERIAL ENHANCEMENT — WOOD & LAMINATE (PRESERVE ORIGINAL): Keep the exact same wood or laminate type, color, and finish from the source. Enhance with authentic grain patterns, natural color variation, visible pore structure, realistic joint lines, and edge profiles. Apply to flooring, cabinetry, shelving, furniture, paneling, doors, and trim. Add appropriate sheen levels matching the source finish. Include micro-scratches and patina only in high-use areas.","MATERIAL ENHANCEMENT — STONE, MARBLE & TILE (PRESERVE ORIGINAL): Keep the exact same stone, marble, tile, or terrazzo type, color, and pattern from the source. Enhance with depth, translucency at thin edges, subsurface scattering on marble, correct grout width and depth, and environment reflections with accurate Fresnel falloff. Apply to countertops, backsplashes, floors, walls, shower enclosures, and vanity tops.","MATERIAL ENHANCEMENT — METAL & HARDWARE (PRESERVE ORIGINAL): Keep the exact same metal type, color, and finish from the source. Enhance brushed metal with directional micro-scratches, polished metals with environment reflections, and brass/copper with subtle warm patina. Apply to faucets, handles, cabinet pulls, light fixtures, railings, appliances, towel bars, and decorative hardware. Add realistic machining marks and weight-appropriate mounting.","MATERIAL ENHANCEMENT — LEATHER & VINYL (PRESERVE ORIGINAL): Keep the exact same leather or vinyl color and type from the source. Enhance with natural grain texture, correct pore density, subtle color variation across panels, realistic crease patterns at stress points, and surface sheen variation. Apply to furniture, headboards, seating, and decorative elements.","MATERIAL ENHANCEMENT — GLASS, MIRROR & CERAMICS (PRESERVE ORIGINAL): Keep the exact same glass tint, mirror finish, and ceramic color/pattern from the source. Enhance glass with correct refraction, edge tinting, and subtle surface reflections. Mirrors must show realistic environment reflections. Enhance ceramic and porcelain with authentic glaze variation and realistic grout depth. Apply to windows, shower doors, splashbacks, tableware, vases, and decorative objects.","MATERIAL ENHANCEMENT — PAINT, PLASTER & WALLPAPER (PRESERVE ORIGINAL): Keep the exact same wall color, texture, and pattern from the source. Enhance painted walls with subtle roller or brush texture variation. Plaster and concrete walls must show authentic trowel patterns or formwork lines. Wallpaper must display correct repeat pattern scale, seam lines, and surface texture. Do NOT change any wall color or pattern.","SURFACE REALISM UPGRADE (ENHANCE ONLY): Upgrade all existing textures with PBR-quality micro-detail and physically accurate light interaction while preserving the original material identity. Add sophisticated roughness variations, high-fidelity texture maps, and subtle real-world imperfections (fine grain, micro-textures, natural reflections). Do NOT change any material type, color, or pattern.","EDGE & CONTACT AUTHENTICITY: Slight edge softening on all furniture, cabinetry, and architectural elements. Visible seam definition and contact shadows where objects meet surfaces. Subtle dust accumulation in corners and ledges. Contact wear in high-touch areas. Nothing looks razor-sharp, factory-perfect, or digitally clean.","FURNISHING & OBJECT PHYSICS: All soft furnishings must show realistic deformation from gravity — cushion sag, natural fabric loft, believable weight distribution. Blankets, throws, and bedding must drape with physically correct fold patterns. Hard objects must show correct weight and placement on surfaces. Decorative items, books, kitchenware, and accessories must appear naturally arranged, not digitally placed.","Selective Crystal Upgrade: Detect all lighting fixtures. Keep exact shape and structure. Only convert dark or smoked crystal/glass elements into clear luxurious crystal with realistic transparency, internal refraction, and prismatic light dispersion. Do not change metal frames or fixture geometry. Material refinement only.","ATMOSPHERIC DEPTH & PHOTOGRAPHY: Include subtle atmospheric perspective — very slight haze in deep room areas, natural dust motes in direct sunlight beams, and micro-variation in ambient light color temperature. Capture with professional architectural photography aesthetics featuring smooth optical clarity, clean high-resolution detail, pristine image quality, realistic light-scattering, and 8K resolution clarity."],cameraAngle:ie.DEFAULT,dayControl:q.NONE,siteContext:W.NONE,selectedObjects:[],lightingControl:J.NONE,isDownlightEnabled:!0,isCabinetLedEnabled:!0,isPubLightEnabled:!1},[O.INTERIOR_PRESET_TYPE_III]:{negativePrompt:be,renderStyle:re.INTERIOR_PHOTO,presetInstructions:["Interior high-end photography, HDR exposure, balanced interior and exterior lighting,hyper-realistic textures, 8K resolution.","HYPER-REALISTIC MATERIAL OVERHAUL: Replace all textures with professionally graded PBR materials featuring physically accurate light interaction. Enhance every surface with sophisticated micro-detail, realistic roughness variations, and high-fidelity texture maps. Objects should exhibit subtle real-world imperfections like fine grain, soft micro-textures, and natural reflections that create a convincing sense of depth and luxury.","EDGE & CONTACT AUTHENTICITY: Slight edge softening, seam definition, and contact wear in high-touch areas. Nothing looks razor-sharp or factory-perfect."],cameraAngle:ie.DEFAULT,dayControl:q.NONE,siteContext:W.INTERIOR_WHITE,selectedObjects:[],lightingControl:J.OFF,isDownlightEnabled:!0,isCabinetLedEnabled:!0,isPubLightEnabled:!1},[O.REAL_ESTATE_PHOTO]:{negativePrompt:be,renderStyle:re.PHOTOREALISTIC,presetInstructions:["PRIMARY CONSTRAINT: Preserve all architectural geometry exactly as in the source image. This includes massing, proportions, rooflines, façade articulation, window and door placement, and all structural relationships. No changes of any kind.","MATERIAL & TEXTURE LOCK (1:1 MATCH): Replicate every material, surface finish, color value, and texture from the source structure with exact fidelity. No substitutions, reinterpretations, stylization, or material changes.","PHOTOREALISM ENHANCEMENT (BOUNDARY-LOCKED): Enhance realism only by increasing material quality within their original, unaltered regions using high-fidelity photorealistic PBR shaders. Do not shift, expand, blend, or redefine material boundaries.","GARDEN AESTHETIC: High-end professional landscaping.Flame trees(Delonix regia) with wooden tree supports, sculptural garden trees with wooden tree supports, dense Ficus hedges, and vibrant tropical plants. Add garden lighting and soft shadows on the ground.","Capture with professional architectural photography aesthetics, featuring smooth optical clarity, clean high-resolution detail, pristine image quality, realistic light-scattering, and subtle atmospheric depth. Ensure a high dynamic range that preserves detail in both deep shadows and bright highlights without looking digital or flat"],cameraAngle:ie.DEFAULT,dayControl:q.DAWN,siteContext:W.LUXURY_HOUSING_ESTATE,selectedObjects:[A.VEHICLES,A.MANICURED_LAWN_FOREGROUND,A.DRIVEWAY_TILED,A.FOREGROUND_STREET],selectedCars:["Lexus RX 500h F Sport"],lightingControl:J.WARM},[O.REAL_ESTATE_PHOTO_TYPE_II]:{negativePrompt:be,renderStyle:re.PHOTOREALISTIC,presetInstructions:["PRIMARY CONSTRAINT: Preserve all architectural geometry exactly as in the source image. This includes massing, proportions, rooflines, façade articulation, window and door placement, and all structural relationships. No changes of any kind.","MATERIAL & TEXTURE LOCK (1:1 MATCH): Replicate every material, surface finish, color value, and texture from the source structure with exact fidelity. No substitutions, reinterpretations, stylization, or material changes.","PHOTOREALISM ENHANCEMENT (BOUNDARY-LOCKED): Enhance realism only by increasing material quality within their original, unaltered regions using high-fidelity photorealistic PBR shaders. Do not shift, expand, blend, or redefine material boundaries.","GARDEN AESTHETIC: High-end professional landscaping. Sculptural garden trees with wooden tree supports, dense Ficus hedges, and vibrant tropical plants and Pair of Italian Cypress Trees. Add garden lighting and soft shadows on the ground.","Capture with professional architectural photography aesthetics, featuring smooth optical clarity, clean high-resolution detail, pristine image quality, realistic light-scattering, and subtle atmospheric depth. Ensure a high dynamic range that preserves detail in both deep shadows and bright highlights without looking digital or flat"],cameraAngle:ie.DEFAULT,dayControl:q.DAWN,siteContext:W.LUXURY_HOUSING_ESTATE,selectedObjects:[A.VEHICLES,A.DRIVEWAY_TILED,A.MANICURED_LAWN_FOREGROUND,A.FOREGROUND_STREET,A.GARDEN_PLANTS],selectedCars:["Bentley Continental GT Mulliner"],selectedPlants:[A.PLANT_ARAUCARIA,A.PLANT_SCULPTURAL_PALM_LINED],lightingControl:J.WARM},[O.LESS_GREEN_RENDER]:{negativePrompt:be,renderStyle:re.PHOTOREALISTIC,presetInstructions:["Maintain all structural forms, rooflines, and window patterns exactly as shown in the source.","MATERIAL SYNC: Replicate every material, color, and texture from the source structure exactly.","HARDSCAPE FOCUS: Replace all grass, lawns, and low-level garden beds in the immediate foreground with high-end architectural hardscape. Use large-format architectural dark grey stone tiles with precise grout lines.","GARDEN AESTHETIC: High-end professional landscaping. sculptural garden trees with wooden tree supports, dense Ficus hedges, and vibrant tropical plants.","Capture with professional architectural photography aesthetics, featuring smooth optical clarity, clean high-resolution detail, pristine image quality, realistic light-scattering, and subtle atmospheric depth. Ensure a high dynamic range that preserves detail in both deep shadows and bright highlights without looking digital or flat"],cameraAngle:ie.DEFAULT,dayControl:q.DAWN,siteContext:W.LUXURY_HOUSING_ESTATE,selectedObjects:[A.VEHICLES,A.HARDSCAPE_FLOOR_TILED],selectedCars:["Aston Martin Vantage"],lightingControl:J.WARM},[O.CONSTRUCTION_SITE]:{negativePrompt:be,renderStyle:re.PHOTOREALISTIC,presetInstructions:["Maintain all structural forms, rooflines, and window patterns exactly as shown in the source.","MATERIAL SYNC: Replicate every material, color, and texture from the source structure exactly.","CONSTRUCTION SITE ENVIRONMENT: The building is in a construction or newly-built state.","GROUND SURFACE: Natural soil and dirt ground surrounding the building. Show exposed earth, compacted dirt, and sandy soil texture. NO grass, NO lawns, NO greenery, NO plants, NO trees.","HARDSCAPE: NO tiles, NO paving, NO decorative flooring. Only raw concrete foundation and natural earth.","FENCE: Include a simple construction fence or boundary fence around the property perimeter. Use basic metal or wooden fence posts with wire mesh or simple panels.","MINIMAL LANDSCAPING: Absolutely NO vegetation, NO garden elements, NO decorative plants. Keep the site bare and construction-ready.","FOREGROUND: Show natural soil texture with some construction materials like gravel piles or sand. Realistic dirt and earth tones.","ATMOSPHERE: Bright daylight, clear sky, showing the building in its raw, newly-constructed state before landscaping.","Capture with professional architectural photography aesthetics, featuring smooth optical clarity, clean high-resolution detail, pristine image quality, realistic light-scattering, and subtle atmospheric depth. Ensure a high dynamic range that preserves detail in both deep shadows and bright highlights without looking digital or flat"],cameraAngle:ie.DEFAULT,dayControl:q.DAY,siteContext:W.RICE_PADDIES,selectedObjects:[],selectedCars:[],lightingControl:J.WARM},[O.MOUNTAIN_HILLSIDE_VILLA]:{negativePrompt:be,renderStyle:re.PHOTOREALISTIC,presetInstructions:["Maintain all structural forms, rooflines, and window patterns exactly as shown in the source.","HILLSIDE INTEGRATION:Embed the house smoothly into a sloped hillside terrain. The land must rise gently around the lower level and behind the structure, creating a grounded, carved-into-the-slope feeling — not a hilltop or exposed peak.","ACCESS STREET & DRIVEWAY:Include a clean, modern asphalt access road curving naturally up the hill toward the house, matching the reference image. The road should feel residential, quiet, and premium — smooth black asphalt, subtle curb edge, no heavy traffic elements.","BACKGROUND CONTROL (NO FOREST WALL, NO MOUNTAINS): Do NOT show distant mountains, dramatic cliffs, valleys, or dense forest walls. Background should consist of controlled hillside greenery and tall trees spaced naturally, allowing sky visibility and architectural clarity.","VEGETATION BALANCE:Reduce forest density. Use selective mature trees, trimmed shrubs, and soft groundcover. Vegetation should frame the house lightly, not overpower it. Avoid jungle density or tropical chaos.","LANDSCAPING STYLE: High-end contemporary landscaping with manicured emerald-green lawns, gentle slopes, minimal shrubs, and clean planting lines. Maintain an elegant, calm residential atmosphere.","MATERIAL SYNC: Replicate every material, color, and texture from the source structure exactly.","LIGHTING & MOOD:Soft late afternoon or early evening light with natural shadows that emphasize terrain depth and slop.","CAMERA & COMPOSITION:Camera positioned on the uphill road looking toward the house. Perspective must exaggerate the slope, making the incline clearly readable.","Capture with professional architectural photography aesthetics, featuring smooth optical clarity, clean high-resolution detail, pristine image quality, realistic light-scattering, and subtle atmospheric depth. Ensure a high dynamic range that preserves detail in both deep shadows and bright highlights without looking digital or flat"],cameraAngle:ie.DEFAULT,dayControl:q.LATE_AFTERNOON,siteContext:W.MOUNTAIN,selectedObjects:[],lightingControl:J.WARM},[O.FLOORPLAN_TO_3D]:{negativePrompt:be,renderStyle:re.PHOTOREALISTIC,presetInstructions:["NEURAL FLOORPLAN EXTRUSION: Transform this 2D architectural plan into a high-quality 3D top-down interior render.","STRICT GEOMETRY: Keep exact layout, room sizes, wall thicknesses, door openings, and window positions from the 2D source plan.","3D TOP VIEW: Render as a realistic 3D floor plan with visible wall heights, realistic floor textures (wood, tiles, marble), and modern furniture placement.","INTERIOR STYLE: High-end modern interior design with realistic scaling of assets.","LIGHTING: Soft, professional architectural with realistic ambient occlusion and soft shadows.","BACKGROUND: Clean, neutral white background with no text, annotations, or people.","STYLE: Professional 8k architectural visualization, realistic PBR materials.","Capture with professional architectural photography aesthetics, featuring smooth optical clarity, clean high-resolution detail, pristine image quality, realistic light-scattering, and subtle atmospheric depth. Ensure a high dynamic range that preserves detail in both deep shadows and bright highlights without looking digital or flat"],cameraAngle:ie.DEFAULT,siteContext:W.NONE,selectedObjects:[A.INDOOR_FURNITURE],lightingControl:J.NEUTRAL},[O.ISOMETRIC_CUTAWAY]:{negativePrompt:be,renderStyle:re.PHOTOREALISTIC,presetInstructions:["Create a high-quality, photorealistic with a 45-degree isometric view 3D cutaway render based exactly on the floorplan.","Maintain the absolute structural identity of the original plan by replicating the exact room sizes, wall positions, and furniture locations without changes.","Transform this layout into a bright, modern, and clean aesthetic evenly illuminated by bright, neutral daylight casting soft, realistic shadows.","Set the entire scene against a plain, neutral beige studio background.","Use light grey-toned wood plank flooring for the living, hallway, and bedroom areas, and apply dark grey rectangular stone tiles for the kitchen, bathroom, and balcony.","Keep all walls clean white.","Dress the existing furniture in light neutral fabrics and light wood finishes, adding decorative elements like potted plants, simple area rugs, and light curtains to match the reference aesthetic.","Capture with professional architectural photography aesthetics, featuring smooth optical clarity, clean high-resolution detail, pristine image quality, realistic light-scattering, and subtle atmospheric depth. Ensure a high dynamic range that preserves detail in both deep shadows and bright highlights without looking digital or flat"],cameraAngle:ie.NONE,siteContext:W.NONE,selectedObjects:[A.INDOOR_FURNITURE],lightingControl:J.NEUTRAL},[O.FLOORPLAN_COLOR_2D]:{negativePrompt:be,renderStyle:re.PHOTOREALISTIC,presetInstructions:["From the floor plan/2D drawing I uploaded, please redraw it into an image with 2D colour rendering (top view floor plan) according to the original layout.","The architectural floor plan is modern, clean, sharp, and professional as shown in the drawing: clear bold walls, light-coloured materials.","Keep the room name/symbol/size if it is in the original photo.","The output image is high resolution, super sharp, harmonious, very light shading to create depth but still in accordance with the standard 2D top-down floor plan, no 3D perspective.","STRICT GEOMETRY: Maintain absolute 1:1 structural fidelity to the source plan. No structural changes, no dimension alterations.","Capture with professional architectural photography aesthetics, featuring smooth optical clarity, clean high-resolution detail, pristine image quality, realistic light-scattering, and subtle atmospheric depth. Ensure a high dynamic range that preserves detail in both deep shadows and bright highlights without looking digital or flat"],cameraAngle:ie.DEFAULT,siteContext:W.NONE,selectedObjects:[A.INDOOR_FURNITURE],lightingControl:J.NEUTRAL},[O.URBAN_RAINY_MOOD]:{negativePrompt:be,renderStyle:re.PHOTOREALISTIC,presetInstructions:["SKY & SUN POSITION:Clear to lightly hazy sky with smooth gradient tones. Pale blue transitioning to warm light near the horizon. Low sun positioned behind and partially occluded by the towers.","SUN FLARE:Natural photographic sun flare created by low-angle sunlight. Subtle lens flare streaks and soft bloom around the sun source. Physically plausible, restrained, and realistic — no exaggerated effects.","LIGHTING:Strong backlighting from the low sun. Soft rim light outlining building edges and towers. Foreground slightly darker, background glowing. Balanced exposure so architectural details remain readable.","URBAN ENVIRONMENT:Modern city environment with roads, sidewalks, trees, and urban infrastructure. Clean, contemporary metropolitan setting. No placeholder elements.","TRAFFIC & LIFE:Cars driving naturally through the scene. Subtle motion blur. Headlights may be on due to backlighting. No traffic congestion.","Capture with professional architectural photography aesthetics, featuring smooth optical clarity, clean high-resolution detail, pristine image quality, realistic light-scattering, and subtle atmospheric depth. Ensure a high dynamic range that preserves detail in both deep shadows and bright highlights without looking digital or flat"],cameraAngle:ie.DEFAULT,dayControl:q.OVERCAST,siteContext:W.MODERN_METROPOLIS_DAY,selectedObjects:[A.VEHICLES,A.STREET_Furniture],motionBlur:It.LIGHT,lightingControl:J.WARM},[O.DAY_SCENE]:{negativePrompt:be,renderStyle:re.PHOTOREALISTIC,presetInstructions:["Maintain all structural forms, rooflines, and window patterns exactly as shown in the source.","MATERIAL SYNC: Replicate every material, color, and texture from the source structure exactly.","GARDEN AESTHETIC: High-end professional landscaping. Include manicured emerald-green lawns, sculptural garden trees with wooden tree supports, dense Ficus hedges, and vibrant tropical plants. Add realistic garden lighting and soft shadows on the ground.","Capture with professional architectural photography aesthetics, featuring smooth optical clarity, clean high-resolution detail, pristine image quality, realistic light-scattering, and subtle atmospheric depth. Ensure a high dynamic range that preserves detail in both deep shadows and bright highlights without looking digital or flat"],cameraAngle:ie.DEFAULT,dayControl:q.