items-center gap-4 px-2",children:[e.jsx("div",{className:"h-[1px] flex-1 bg-white/5"}),e.jsx("div",{className:"p-1 px-3 bg-white/5 rounded-full border border-white/5",children:e.jsx("span",{className:"text-[10px] font-black text-text-secondary uppercase tracking-widest opacity-60",children:a("standardViewsTitle")})}),e.jsx("div",{className:"h-[1px] flex-1 bg-white/5"})]}),e.jsx(Be,{...t,configs:w,hideIcons:!0})]})]})},Gc=t=>[{id:"young_couple",category:"lifestyle",angle:"Young Elegant Couple Admires the Villa: Place a beautiful Asian couple (man and woman) in the foreground garden. Show them from a cinematic three-quarter behind angle, looking up at the building.",label:t("cameraYoungCouple"),icon:"M17 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H5a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2M9 7a4 4 0 1 1 0-8 4 4 0 0 1 0 8zm14 14v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75",previewId:"/assets/perspective_gallery/Life_Style/young_couple.webp"},{id:"walk",category:"lifestyle",angle:"A breathtaking professional tight medium CLOSE-UP shot from directly behind an elegant woman. Focus sharply on her bare back and the intricate shimmering textures of her backless white silk couture gown with a dramatic flowing train leading towards the building. ENVIRONMENT SYNC: The background building, landscape, and environment must be 100% IDENTICAL to the source image. Maintain the exact architectural design, materials, and trees from the base rendering. Use a professional shallow depth of field (f/1.2) to create a heavy, creamy cinematic bokeh that artistically blurs the building behind her while keeping its distinct architectural identity recognizable.",label:t("cameraFashionWalking"),icon:"M12 2c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2s-.9 2-2 2-2-.9-2-2 .9-2 2-2zm9 7h-6v13h-2v-6h-2v6H9V9H3V7h18v2z",previewId:"/assets/perspective_gallery/Life_Style/walk.webp"},{id:"owner_relaxing",category:"lifestyle",angle:"A candid professional lifestyle medium close-up of the elegant Asian building owner standing front building or on a high-end balcony or terrace, enjoying a steaming cup of coffee. BACKGROUND: The building is part of an exclusive,NEIGHBORHOOD. In the background, show a wide, clean building street with other building, manicured street-side parkways, and mature leafy trees.creating a sense of building. Medium depth of field so the owner and the immediate architecture are sharp, while neighborhood context remains clearly identifiable but beautifully soft.",label:t("cameraOwnerRelaxing"),icon:"M12 2L2 7l10 5 10-5-10-5zM2 17l10 5 10-5M2 12l10 5 10-5",previewId:"/assets/perspective_gallery/Life_Style/owner_relaxing.webp"},{id:"owner_opening_door",category:"lifestyle",angle:"Action close-up of the owner opening the door. Focus strictly on the owner and the interaction.",label:t("cameraOwnerOpeningDoor"),icon:"M15 7a2 2 0 0 1 2 2m4 0a6 6 0 0 1-7.743 5.743L11 17H9v2H7v2H4a1 1 0 0 1-1-1v-2.586a1 1 0 0 1 .293-.707l5.964-5.964A6 6 0 0 1 21 9z",previewId:"/assets/perspective_gallery/Life_Style/owner_opening_door.webp"},{id:"picnic",category:"lifestyle",angle:"Elite Family Garden Picnic: Place a beautiful Asian family (parents and young child) in the immediate foreground, enjoying a picnic on a blanket on the building's lush green lawn.",label:t("cameraFamilyPicnic"),icon:"M12 2L2 7l10 5 10-5-10-5zM2 17l10 5 10-5M2 12l10 5 10-5",previewId:"/assets/perspective_gallery/Life_Style/picnic.webp"},{id:"playing",category:"lifestyle",angle:"Dynamic lifestyle shot. Close-up focus on a happy Asian mother and father playing with their young child on the grass. High-speed shutter effect to capture joyful movement. The building architecture in the background is heavily blurred (shallow depth of field) to emphasize the family moment.",label:t("cameraFamilyPlaying"),icon:"M16 7a4 4 0 11-8 0 4 4 0 018 0zM12 14a7 7 0 00-7 7h14a7 7 0 00-7-7z",previewId:"/assets/perspective_gallery/Life_Style/playing.webp"},{id:"luxury_couple_car",category:"lifestyle",angle:"Hero lifestyle shot of an elegant Asian power-couple standing next to the vehicle shown in the base image.",label:t("cameraLuxuryCoupleCar"),icon:"M16 7a4 4 0 11-8 0 4 4 0 018 0zM12 14a7 7 0 00-7 7h14a7 7 0 00-7-7zM5 18h14M5 10l3-4h8l3 4M2 10h20v8H2v-8z",previewId:"/assets/perspective_gallery/Life_Style/luxury_couple_car.webp"}],Bc=t=>{const{t:a}=t,r=Gc(a);return e.jsx("div",{className:"mb-8",children:e.jsx(Be,{...t,configs:r,hideIcons:!0})})},Fc=t=>[{id:"car_driving",category:"cinematic",angle:"Cinematic long shot of a Building. Car of building is driving out of the building’s driveway, front wheels visibly turned as it crosses the street, creating a dynamic sense of motion. The car’s headlights and daytime running lights are on. The vehicle is captured mid-turn, suspension slightly compressed, tires angled naturally, realistic steering geometry. Clean modern architecture in the background. Ultra-realistic photography, cinematic lighting, deep perspective, high contrast, professional automotive photography, dramatic yet elegant mood, 8K detail, sharp focus, natural motion realism.",label:t("cameraCinematicDrive"),icon:"M21 15.5l-2-2m-14 2l-2-2M2 13h20m-17 3v-2m14 2v-2M12 4L4 10h16L12 4z",previewId:"/assets/perspective_gallery/Cinematic/car_driving.webp"},{id:"moto_driving",category:"cinematic",angle:"Cinematic long shot of a Building.Motorcycle of building is slow driving out of the building’s driveway, rider leaning slightly as it crosses the street, creating a dynamic sense of motion. Headlight is on. The bike is captured mid-turn. Clean modern architecture in the background. Ultra-realistic photography, cinematic lighting, deep perspective, 8K detail, sharp focus, natural motion realism.",label:t("cameraMotoDrive"),icon:"M21 15.5l-2-2m-14 2l-2-2M2 13h20m-17 3v-2m14 2v-2M12 4L4 10h16L12 4z",previewId:"/assets/perspective_gallery/Cinematic/moto_driving.webp"},{id:"car_rear_glow",category:"cinematic",angle:"A professional low-angle rear-three-quarter cinematic shot of a Car of building driving slowly along the driveway away from the camera towards the building. ENVIRONMENT SYNC: The background building, landscape, and environment must be 100% IDENTICAL to the source image. Focus sharply on the brilliant glowing red LED strip of the car's taillights, which cast a dramatic red ambient glow on the pavement behind it. The car's metallic finish reflects the specific architectural environment, high-end commercial aesthetic. Architecture is lit with warm interior glows.",label:t("cameraCinematicRearDrive"),icon:"M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z",previewId:"/assets/perspective_gallery/Cinematic/car_rear_glow.webp"},{id:"moto_rear_glow",category:"cinematic",angle:"A professional low-angle rear-three-quarter cinematic shot of a Motorcycle of building driving slowly along the driveway away from the camera towards the building. ENVIRONMENT SYNC: The background building, landscape, and environment must be 100% IDENTICAL to the source image. Focus sharply on the glowing red LED taillight of the motorcycle, which casts a dramatic red ambient glow on the pavement behind it, high-end commercial aesthetic. Architecture is lit with warm interior glows.",label:t("cameraMotoRearGlow"),icon:"M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z",previewId:"/assets/perspective_gallery/Cinematic/moto_rear_glow.webp"},{id:"car_closeup",category:"cinematic",angle:"Keep the architecture and vehicles exactly as shown in the reference. Vehicle lock: same cars, same position, same orientation, same spacing, same scale, same parking location. Do not move or replace anything. Only move the camera midium closer to create a cinematic close-up luxury automotive photograph with shallow depth of field and realistic architectural reflections. ",label:t("cameraCarCloseup"),icon:"M6.827 6.175A2.31 2.31 0 015.186 7.23c-.38.054-.757.112-1.134.175C2.999 7.58 2.25 8.507 2.25 9.574V18a2.25 2.25 0 002.25 2.25h15A2.25 2.25 0 0021.75 18V9.574c0-1.067-.75-1.994-1.802-2.169a47.865 47.865 0 00-1.134-.175 2.31 2.31 0 01-1.64-1.055l-.822-1.316a2.192 2.192 0 00-1.736-1.039 48.774 48.774 0 00-5.232 0 2.192 2.192 0 00-1.736 1.039l-.821 1.316z",previewId:"/assets/perspective_gallery/Cinematic/car_closeup.webp"},{id:"rain_reflection",category:"cinematic",angle:"A professional architectural photograph taken shortly after a rain shower. The driveway is not flooded, but has a fresh damp appearance with scattered, clean reflective puddles. The building's warm interior lights shimmer elegantly on the wet ground. The atmosphere is clear and crisp, with a sense of high-end cleanliness. Visual fidelity to building design is 100%. Lighting: Soft overcast with hints of warm light.",label:t("cameraRainReflection"),icon:"M12 2v2m0 16v2M4.93 4.93l1.41 1.41m11.32 11.32l1.41 1.41M2 12h2m16 0h2M4.93 19.07l1.41-1.41m11.32-11.32l1.41-1.41",previewId:"/assets/perspective_gallery/Cinematic/rain_reflection.webp"},{id:"rainy_evening_walk",category:"cinematic",angle:"A breathtaking cinematic tight medium tracking shot from directly behind an elegant silhouette figure holding a sleek black umbrella, walking slowly along the driveway towards the glowing front entrance of the building in a gentle evening rain. ENVIRONMENT SYNC: The background building, landscape, and environment must be 100% IDENTICAL to the source image. Pristine wet asphalt and stone pavement glistening with sharp mirror-like reflections of the warm architectural lights and glowing entryway. Fine glistening raindrops suspended in the air, soft cinematic haze, deep moody shadows, shallow depth of field (f/1.4) creating creamy bokeh on the glowing architecture in the background. High-end film noir commercial cinematography, 8K resolution, photorealistic elegance.",label:t("cameraRainyEveningWalk"),icon:"M12 3c-4.97 0-9 4.03-9 9 0 .68.08 1.34.23 1.97.12.5.58.85 1.1.85h15.34c.52 0 .98-.35 1.1-.85.15-.63.23-1.29.23-1.97 0-4.97-4.03-9-9-9zm0 0v16.5a2.25 2.25 0 004.5 0",previewId:"/assets/perspective_gallery/Cinematic/rainy_evening_walk.webp"},{id:"light_trails",category:"cinematic",angle:"Long exposure night shot with bright energetic light trails from moving vehicles in the foreground framing the illuminated building.",label:t("cameraLightTrails"),icon:"M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z",previewId:"/assets/perspective_gallery/Cinematic/light_trails.webp"}],Kc=t=>{const{t:a}=t,r=Fc(a);return e.jsx("div",{className:"mb-8",children:e.jsx(Be,{...t,configs:r,hideIcons:!0})})},Hc=t=>[{id:"studio_model",category:"studio",angle:"Shot of the architecture as a high-fidelity physical scale model in a professional dark-lit design studio.",label:t("cameraStudioModel"),icon:"M21 7.5l-9-5.25L3 7.5m18 0l-9 5.25m9-5.25v9l-9 5.25M3 7.5l9 5.25M3 7.5v9l9 5.25m0-9v9",previewId:"/assets/perspective_gallery/Studio/studio_model.webp"},{id:"studio_timber_wood",category:"studio",angle:"High-end architectural physical scale model meticulously crafted from premium balsa wood and basswood, placed on an architect's matte worktable in a bright design studio. Natural layered contour topography, delicate laser-cut timber louvers, miniature wooden dowel trees, soft diffused studio light, shallow depth of field, tactile craftsmanship.",label:t("cameraStudioTimberWood"),icon:"M2.25 12l8.954-8.955c.44-.439 1.152-.439 1.591 0L21.75 12M4.5 9.75v10.125c0 .621.504 1.125 1.125 1.125H9.75v-4.875c0-.621.504-1.125 1.125-1.125h2.25c.621 0 1.125.504 1.125 1.125V21h4.125c.621 0 1.125-.504 1.125-1.125V9.75M8.25 21h8.25",previewId:"/assets/perspective_gallery/Studio/studio_timber_wood.webp"},{id:"studio_monolithic_white",category:"studio",angle:"Museum exhibition display of the architecture as a pristine, monolithic matte pure white scale model. Placed on an elevated white pedestal in a minimalist dark art gallery or studio, illuminated by a single crisp directional overhead spotlight casting sharp geometric architectural shadows. Minimalist, sculptural, fine art presentation.",label:t("cameraStudioMonolithicWhite"),icon:"M12 21a9.004 9.004 0 008.716-6.747M12 21a9.004 9.004 0 01-8.716-6.747M12 21c2.485 0 4.5-4.03 4.5-9S14.485 3 12 3m0 18c-2.4