 concrete with clear polished tinted resin glazing. Placed on a black slate plinth with dramatic side rim-lighting, emphasizing tectonic weight, tactile raw cast textures, and crisp modern geometric edges.",label:t("cameraStudioConcreteResin"),icon:"M6.429 9.75L2.25 12l4.179 2.25m0-4.5l5.571 3 5.571-3m-11.142 0L2.25 7.5 12 2.25l9.75 5.25-4.179 2.25m0 0L21.75 12l-4.179 2.25m0 0l4.179 2.25L12 21.75 2.25 16.5l4.179-2.25m11.142 0l-5.571 3-5.571-3",previewId:"/assets/perspective_gallery/Studio/studio_concrete_resin.webp"},{id:"studio_topographic_contour",category:"studio",angle:"Comprehensive physical presentation scale model featuring multi-layered stepped topographic contour terrain, clear acrylic glass building volume, detailed miniature landscaping, tiny model cars, and delicate scale trees. Photographed with professional studio softbox lighting on an exhibition stand.",label:t("cameraStudioTopographicContour"),icon:"M3.75 6A2.25 2.25 0 016 3.75h2.25A2.25 2.25 0 0110.5 6v2.25a2.25 2.25 0 01-2.25 2.25H6a2.25 2.25 0 01-2.25-2.25V6zM3.75 15.75A2.25 2.25 0 016 13.5h2.25a2.25 2.25 0 012.25 2.25V18a2.25 2.25 0 01-2.25 2.25H6A2.25 2.25 0 013.75 18v-2.25zM13.5 6a2.25 2.25 0 012.25-2.25H18A2.25 2.25 0 0120.25 6v2.25A2.25 2.25 0 0118 10.5h-2.25a2.25 2.25 0 01-2.25-2.25V6zM13.5 15.75a2.25 2.25 0 012.25-2.25H18a2.25 2.25 0 012.25 2.25V18A2.25 2.25 0 0118 20.25h-2.25A2.25 2.25 0 0113.5 18v-2.25z",previewId:"/assets/perspective_gallery/Studio/studio_topographic_contour.webp"},{id:"studio_sectional_cutaway",category:"studio",angle:"Meticulously detailed physical architectural cross-section scale model sliced cleanly along one axis to expose multi-level interior spatial layouts, miniature staircases, double-height ceiling voids, and tiny scale furniture. Crafted from crisp white museum board, warm miniature micro-LED accent lighting glowing within the exposed rooms, displayed on an architect's dark slate worktable in a high-end design studio.",label:t("cameraStudioSectionalCutaway"),icon:"M3.75 4.5h16.5a1.5 1.5 0 011.5 1.5v12a1.5 1.5 0 01-1.5 1.5H3.75A1.5 1.5 0 012.25 18V6a1.5 1.5 0 011.5-1.5zM12 4.5v15M2.25 12h19.5",previewId:"/assets/perspective_gallery/Studio/studio_sectional_cutaway.webp"}],Vc=t=>{const{t:a}=t,r=Hc(a);return e.jsx("div",{className:"flex flex-col gap-12 mb-8",children:e.jsxs("div",{className:"space-y-6",children:[e.jsxs("div",{className:"flex items-center gap-4 px-2",children:[e.jsx("div",{className:"h-[1px] flex-1 bg-amber-500/20"}),e.jsxs("div",{className:"flex items-center gap-2",children:[e.jsx("div",{className:"p-1 px-3 bg-amber-500/10 rounded-full border border-amber-500/20",children:e.jsx("span",{className:"text-[10px] font-black text-amber-400 uppercase tracking-widest",children:a("studioScaleModelsTitle")})}),e.jsx("svg",{className:"w-4 h-4 text-amber-400",fill:"none",viewBox:"0 0 24 24",stroke:"currentColor",strokeWidth:2,children:e.jsx("path",{strokeLinecap:"round",strokeLinejoin:"round",d:"M21 7.5l-9-5.25L3 7.5m18 0l-9 5.25m9-5.25v9l-9 5.25M3 7.5l9 5.25M3 7.5v9l9 5.25m0-9v9"})})]}),e.jsx("div",{className:"h-[1px] flex-1 bg-amber-500/20"})]}),e.jsx(Be,{...t,configs:r})]})})},zc=t=>[{id:"site_clearance",category:"construction",angle:"Cambodian site clearance phase. Target building fully removed, showing bare reddish soil and sand. Preserve all neighboring houses fully completed and unchanged. Sidewalks and street remain exactly the same. No cars, no landscaping, no plants on the target lot.",label:t("cameraSiteClearance"),icon:"M21 21l-6-6m2-5a7 7 0 11-14 0 7 7 0 0114 0z",previewId:"/assets/perspective_gallery/Contruction_view/site_clearance.webp"},{id:"foundation",category:"construction",angle:"foundation phase on the target lot only, showing concrete footings, tie beams, and exposed rebar. Neighboring buildings remain completed and unchanged. Sidewalk and street remain identical. No cars, no plants, no garden on the target lot.",label:t("cameraFoundation"),icon:"M12 2L2 7l10 5 10-5-10-5zM2 17l10 5 10-5M2 12l10 5 10-5",previewId:"/assets/perspective_gallery/Contruction_view/foundation.webp"},{id:"structural_shell",category:"construction",angle:"Reinforced concrete structural frame under construction on the target building only. Adjacent houses remain fully completed and untouched. Street, sidewalk, and surrounding urban context remain unchanged.",label:t("cameraStructuralShell"),icon:"M4 5h16v14H4V5zm2 2v10h12V7H6z",previewId:"/assets/perspective_gallery/Contruction_view/structural_shell.webp"},{id:"under_construction",category:"construction",angle:"General Cambodian construction phase on the target building only, with scaffolding and unfinished surfaces. Adjacent houses remain completed. No changes to street, sidewalk, or surrounding properties.",label:t("cameraUnderConstruction"),icon:"M19 21V5a2 2 0 00-2-2H7a2 2 0 00-2 2v16m14 0h2m-2 0h-5m-9 0H3m2 0h5M9 7h1m-1 4h1m4-4h1m-1 4h1m-5 10v-5a1 1 0 011-1h2a1 1 0 011 1v5m-4 0h4",previewId:"/assets/perspective_gallery/Contruction_view/under_construction.webp"},{id:"focus_facade_install",category:"construction",angle:"Facade installation in progress on the target building only. Neighboring buildings remain finished and unchanged. Sidewalk and street preserved. No landscaping or vehicles on the target lot.",label:t("cameraFacadeInstall"),icon:"M9 17v-2m3 2v-4m3 4v-6m2 10H5a2 2 0 01-2-2V5a2 2 0 012-2h14a2 2 0 012 2v14a2 2 0 01-2 2z",previewId:"/assets/perspective_gallery/Contruction_view/focus_facade_install.webp"},{id:"night_site",category:"construction",angle:"Night construction scene with floodlights focused only on the target building. All surrounding buildings remain completed and unchanged. Street and sidewalk remain identical to the original image. No cars, no garden on the target lot.",label:t("cameraNightSite"),icon:"M20.354 15.354A9 9 0 018.646 3.646 9.003 9.003 0 0012 21a9.003 9.003 0 008.354-5.646z",previewId:"/assets/perspective_gallery/Contruction_view/night_site.webp"}],Wc=t=>{const{t:a}=t,r=zc(a);return e.jsx("div",{className:"mb-8",children:e.jsx(Be,{...t,configs:r,hideIcons:!0})})},$c=t=>[{id:"blueprint_technical",category:"blueprint",angle:"Convert this 3D rendered view into clean architectural drawings. Produce precise technical line views including: front elevation, side elevations, and a top-down floor plan. Use thin, uniform black-ink style lines, similar to architectural blueprints. Keep all proportions accurate, straighten all vertical and horizontal elements, and remove shading or textures. Present the drawings on a white background, organized clearly like a construction document sheet.",label:t("cameraBlueprintTechnical"),icon:"M9 12h6m-6 4h6m2 5H7a2 2 0 01-2-2V5a2 2 0 012-2h5.586a1 1 0 01.707.293l5.414 5.414a1 1 0 01.293.707V19a2 2 0 01-2 2z",previewId:"10tY1mjg4hGZaMMH851OSrZtuEOiPbl1F"},{id:"blueprint_neon",category:"blueprint",angle:"Create a futuristic neon blueprint visualization of the image elements, transforming the architecture into glowing wireframe geometry with bright cyan and electric-blue contours. Add small floating annotations around the scene, labeling key elements with short technical notes and minimalistic callouts. Keep the underlying render softly visible but stylized, blending realism with a holographic sci-fi mapping effect. The final image should look like a high-tech architectural interface, with clean neon linework, depth layering, and elegant, unobtrusive annotation labels.",label:t("cameraBlueprintNeon"),icon:"M12 21a9.004 9.004 0 008.716-6.747c1.05-3.6-1.565-7.304-5.165-7.794a9.004 9.004 0 00-11.102 11.102c.49 3.6 4.194 6.215 7.794 5.165A9.004 9.004 0 0012 21z",previewId:"1uFJV2Pkq2JnwYA8ZZ0CilYQ5LngFWuZl"},{id:"blueprint_ar",category:"blueprint",angle:"Create a photorealistic image of the space with an overlaid transparent technical drawing. Show glowing white CAD-style linework outlining all cabinetry, shelves, drawers, plumbing fixtures, lighting elements, and construction details. Blend the technical blueprint lines seamlessly with the real 3D render, maintaining precise measurements, annotations, arrows, and small text labels. The overall effect should look like a futuristic AR technical overlay-clean, bright, professional, and highly detailed",label:t("cameraBlueprintAR"),icon:"M15 12a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0z M19 21l-4.35-4.35",previewId:"1jGBg-LukX22_QIAB_uQpdn-av4maH9TC"},{id:"blueprint_concept",category:"blueprint",angle:"Create an architectural concept board that illustrates at least five stages of the design process, including initial assumptions, massing studies, spatial layout, lighting analysis, and material exploration. Present each stage as expressive hand-drawn sketches with ink or pencil linework. Add small diagrams, arrows, and handwritten notes that explain design decisions and highlight key observations. Make the whole composition feel like an architect’s creative working board, analytical yet artistic.",label:t("cameraBlueprintConcept"),icon:"M19 11H5m14 0a2 2 0 012 2v6a2 2 0 01-2 2H5a2 2 0 01-2-2v-6a2 2 0 012-2m14 0V9a2 2 0 00-2-2M5 11V9a2 2 0 012-2m0 0V5a2 2 0 012-2h6a2 2 0 012 2v2M7 7h10",previewId:"1ZbluroEQSWx0ytl06EwtB4NJ81F4Wl2m"}],Yc=t=>{const{t:a}=t,r=$c(a);return e.jsx("div",{className:"mb-8",children:e.jsx(Be,{...t,configs:r,hideIcons:!0})})},qc=t=>[{id:"int_ext_living",category:"interior_from_exterior",angle:"Design interior matching this exterior. Perfect consistency with original style, window frames, and materials. Space: Living Room. 8k interior photo. IMPORTANT: Generate one single, unified, full-frame image. Do not create a grid, collage, tiles, or mosaic composition.",label:t("cameraInteriorLivingRoom"),icon:"M3 12l2-2m0 0l7-7 7 7M5 10v10a1 1 0 001 1h3m10-11l2 2m-2-2v10a1 1 0 01-1 1h-3m-6 0a1 1 0 001-1v-4a1 1 0 011-1h2a1 1 0 011 1v4a1 1 0 001 1m-6 0h6"},{id:"int_ext_bedroom",category:"interior_from_exterior",angle:"Design interior matching this exterior. Perfect consistency with original style, window frames, and materials. Space: Bedroom. 8k interior photo. IMPORTANT: Generate one single, unified, full-frame image. Do not create a grid, collage, tiles, or mosaic composition.",label:t("cameraInteriorBedroom"),icon:"M3 10h18M3 14h18m-9-4v8m-7 0h14a2 2 0 002-2V8a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v8a2 2 0 002 2z"},{id:"int_ext_kitchen",category:"interior_from_exterior",angle:"Design interior matching this exterior. Perfect consistency with original style, window frames, and materials. Space: Kitchen. 8k interior photo. IMPORTANT: Generate one single, unified, full-frame image. Do not create a grid, collage, tiles, or mosaic composition.",label:t("cameraInteriorKitchen"),icon:"M12 6V4m0 2a2 2 0 100 4m0-4a2 2 0 110 4m-6 8a2 2 0 100-4m0 4a2 2 0 110-4m0 4v2m0-6V4m6 6v10m6-2a2 2 0 100-4m0 4a2 2 0 110-4m0 4v2m0-6V4"},{id:"int_ext_dining",category:"interior_from_exterior",angle:"Design interior matching this exterior. Perfect consistency with original style, window frames, and materials. Space: Dining Room. 8k interior photo. IMPORTANT: Generate one single, unified, full-frame image. Do not create a grid, collage, tiles, or mosaic composition.",label:t("cameraInteriorDining"),icon:"M12 8v13m0-13V6a2 2 0 112 0v2m-2 0H8m4 0h4m-4 0a2 2 0 00-2 2v3m0 0h8m-8 0H4m16 0a2 2 0 002-2V8a2 2 0 00-2-2h-4"},{id:"int_ext_study",category:"interior_from_exterior",angle:"Design interior matching this exterior. Perfect consistency with original style, window frames, and materials. Space: Study Room. 8k interior photo. IMPORTANT: Generate one single, unified, full-frame image. Do not create a grid, collage, tiles, or mosaic composition.",label:t("cameraInteriorStudyRoom"),icon:"M12 6.253v13m0-13C10.832 5.477 9.246 5 7.5 5S4.168 5.477 3 6.253v13C4.168 18.477 5.754 18 7.5 18s3.332.477 4.5 1.253m0-13C13.168 5.477 14.754 5 16.5 5c1.747 0 3.332.477 4.5 1.253v13C19.832 18.477 18.247 18 16.5 18c-1.746 0-3.332.477-4.5 1.253"},{id:"int_ext_bathroom",category:"interior_from_exterior",angle:"Design interior matching this exterior. Perfect consistency with original style, window frames, and materials. Space: Bathroom. 8k interior photo. IMPORTANT: Generate one single, unified, full-frame image. Do not create a grid, collage, tiles, or mosaic composition.",label:t("cameraInteriorBathroom"),icon:"M8 7V3m8 4V3m-9 8h10M5 21h14a2 2 0 002-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v12a2 2 0 002 2z"},{id:"int_ext_corridor",category:"interior_from_exterior",angle:"Design interior matching this exterior. Perfect consistency with original style, window frames, and materials. Space: Corridor. 8k interior photo. IMPORTANT: Generate one single, unified, full-frame image. Do not create a grid, collage, tiles, or mosaic composition.",label:t("cameraInteriorCorridor"),icon:"M13 5l7 7-7 7M5 5l7 7-7 7"},{id:"int_ext_closeup",category:"interior_from_exterior",angle:"Design interior matching this exterior. Perfect consistency with original style, window frames, and materials. Space: Close-up. 8k interior photo. IMPORTANT: Generate one single, unified, full-frame image. Do not create a grid, collage, tiles, or mosaic composition.",label:t("cameraInteriorCloseUp"),icon:"M21 21l-6-6m2-5a7 7 0 11-14 0 7 7 0 0114 0zM10 7v3m0 0v3m0-3h3m-3 0H7"},{id:"int_ext_balcony",category:"interior_from_exterior",angle:"Design interior matching this exterior. Perfect consistency with original style, window frames, and materials. Space: Balcony / Garden. 8k interior photo. IMPORTANT: Generate one single, unified, full-frame image. Do not create a grid, collage, tiles, or mosaic composition.",label:t("cameraInteriorBalconyGarden"),icon:"M12 21a9.004 9.004 0 008.716-6.747c1.05-3.6-1.565-7.304-5.165-7.794a9.004 9.004 0 00-11.102 11.102c.49 3.6 4.194 6.215 7.794 5.165A9.004 9.004 0 0012 21z"},{id:"int_ext_grand_hall",category:"interior_from_exterior",angle:"Design interior matching this exterior. Perfect consistency with original style, window frames, and materials. Space: Grand Entrance Hall with high ceilings. 8k interior photo. IMPORTANT: Generate one single, unified, full-frame image. Do not create a grid, collage, tiles, or mosaic composition.",label:t("cameraInteriorGrandHall"),icon:"M12 21V3m9 18l-9-9 9-9M3 21l9-9-9-9"}],Xc=t=>{const{t:a}=t,r=qc(a);return e.jsx("div",{className:"mb-8",children:e.jsx(Be,{...t,configs:r,hideIcons:!0})})},Zc=t=>[{id:"storyboard_6_shot_documentary",category:"storyboard",angle:`Based on the uploaded image, generate an ultra-realistic 6-frame architectural documentary storyboard arranged in a clean 2×3 contact sheet grid:
Frame 1 (Establishing Perspective): Sweeping architectural view presenting the complete building massing, landscaping, and site context.
Frame 2 (Spatial Geometry): Angled perspective emphasizing architectural depth, facade layers, pathways, and circulation.
Frame 3 (Medium Architectural Experience): Medium shot highlighting key exterior features—entrance canopy, terrace, courtyard, or balcony.
Frame 4 (Architectural Macro Detail): Close-up texture study featuring authentic wall textures, cladding, lighting, and craftsmanship.
Frame 5 (Atmospheric Spatial Moment): Cinematic perspective capturing light, shadow interplay, and seamless connection between spaces.
Frame 6 (Cinematic Hero Panorama): Master concluding perspective framing the architecture in its full glory and atmospheric mood.

LIFESTYLE & ACTIVITY:
- Random and natural lifestyle moments can occur organically across frames where appropriate (e.g. people walking along pathways, relaxing, having coffee, or admiring views in realistic human scale and natural unscripted postures). Some frames can be purely architectural while others naturally feature everyday life.

STRICT CONTINUITY & QUALITY:
- Maintain 100% strict visual continuity across all 6 frames: identical architectural design, materials, facade geometry, site layout, landscaping, lighting direction, and atmosphere.
- Clean contact sheet mosaic presentation: No text, captions, labels, shot numbers, watermarks, logos, or decorative borders.`,label:t("storyboard6ShotDocumentary")||"6-Frame Architectural Documentary",icon:"M3.75 6A2.25 2.25 0 016 3.75h2.25A2.25 2.25 0 0110.5 6v2.25a2.25 2.25 0 01-2.25 2.25H6a2.25 2.25 0 01-2.25-2.25V6zM3.75 15.75A2.25 2.25 0 016 13.5h2.25a2.25 2.25 0 012.25 2.25V18a2.25 2.25 0 01-2.25 2.25H6A2.25 2.25 0 013.75 18v-2.25zM13.5 6a2.25 2.25 0 012.25-2.25H18A2.25 2.25 0 0120.25 6v2.25A2.25 2.25 0 0118 10.5h-2.25a2.25 2.25 0 01-2.25-2.25V6zM13.5 15.75a2.25 2.25 0 012.25-2.25H18a2.25 2.25 0 012.25 2.25V18A2.25 2.25 0 0118 20.25h-2.25A2.25 2.25 0 0113.5 18v-2.25z",previewId:"/assets/perspective_gallery/Storyboard/storyboard_6_shot_documentary.webp"},{id:"storyboard_cinematic_grid_2x2",category:"storyboard",angle:`Based on the image, generate 4 storyboard frames for an architectural documentary. Ensure consistency in the building and environment, and generate them from different angles. Finally, merge them into a complete master image. This image should be a "cinematic contact sheet/storyboard grid 2*2" containing all 4 key frames. Each storyboard should maintain master-level photographic quality and a sense of architectural spatial scenes. Enhance the realistic photographic texture, cinematic lighting, high definition, 2K.

STRICT RULES & VISUAL CONTINUITY:
- Maintain 100% strict visual continuity across all 4 frames: identical architectural design, materials, facade geometry, site layout, landscaping, lighting direction, and atmosphere from the source reference.
- Clean contact sheet mosaic presentation: No text, captions, labels, shot numbers, watermarks, logos, or decorative borders. Only the architectural storyboard panels themselves.`,label:t("storyboardCinematicGrid2x2")||"Cinematic Storyboard Grid 2×2 (4 Shots)",icon:"M3.75 6A2.25 2.25 0 016 3.75h2.25A2.25 2.25 0 0110.5 6v2.25a2.25 2.25 0 01-2.25 2.25H6a2.25 2.25 0 01-2.25-2.25V6zM3.75 15.75A2.25 2.25 0 016 13.5h2.25a2.25 2.25 0 012.25 2.25V18a2.25 2.25 0 01-2.25 2.25H6A2.25 2.25 0 013.75 18v-2.25zM13.5 6a2.25 2.25 0 012.25-2.25H18A2.25 2.25 0 0120.25 6v2.25A2.25 2.25 0 0118 10.5h-2.25a2.25 2.25 0 01-2.25-2.25V6zM13.5 15.75a2.25 2.25 0 012.25-2.25H18a2.25 2.25 0 012.25 2.25V18A2.25 2.25 0 0118 20.25h-2.25A2.25 2.25 0 0113.5 18v-2.25z",previewId:"/assets/perspective_gallery/Storyboard/storyboard_cinematic_grid_2x2.webp"},{id:"storyboard_people_activity_3_shot",category:"storyboard",angle:`Based on the image, generate 3 cinematic storyboard close-up views of people engaged in everyday activity on scene within the environment, capturing natural interaction and cinematic depth of field. Dynamically merge them into a complete master contact sheet collage containing all 3 key frames. Capture natural, unscripted human interaction with the space in realistic human scale—such as enjoying coffee, reading, relaxing on seating, conversational moments, or admiring the architecture and garden. Each frame features beautiful cinematic depth of field with realistic photographic texture, cinematic lighting, and high definition 2K.

STRICT RULES & VISUAL CONTINUITY:
- Maintain 100% strict visual continuity across all 3 frames: identical architectural design, materials, facade geometry, site layout, landscaping, lighting direction, and atmosphere from the source reference.
- Clean contact sheet mosaic presentation: No text, captions, labels, shot numbers, watermarks, logos, or decorative borders. Only the storyboard panels themselves.`,label:t("storyboardPeopleActivity3Shot")||"People & Everyday Activity (3 Shots)",icon:"M15.75 6a3.75 3.75 0 11-7.5 0 3.75 3.75 0 017.5 0zM4.501 20.118a7.5 7.5 0 0114.998 0A17.933 17.933 0 0112 21.75c-2.676 0-5.216-.584-7.499-1.632z",previewId:"/assets/perspective_gallery/Storyboard/storyboard_people_activity_3_shot.webp"},{id:"storyboard_day_to_night_4_shot",category:"storyboard",angle:`Based on the uploaded image, generate an ultra-realistic architectural storyboard contact sheet capturing a 24-hour Day-to-Night lighting cycle across 4 frames arranged in a clean 2×2 grid. The camera position, building architecture, and surrounding environment remain 100% fixed while the solar lighting and atmosphere transform sequentially:
Frame 1 (Top-Left): Soft morning dawn with gentle golden sunrise light and long morning shadows.
Frame 2 (Top-Right): Bright midday architectural sunlight with crisp shadows and high natural sky illumination.
Frame 3 (Bottom-Left): Golden hour twilight and sunset with vibrant amber sky and warm horizon glow.
Frame 4 (Bottom-Right): Cinematic night scene with glowing interior windows, warm architectural spotlights, landscape lighting, and starry night sky.

STRICT CONTINUITY & QUALITY:
- Maintain 100% architectural geometry and material fidelity across all 4 frames.
- Clean contact sheet layout with no text, watermarks, labels, shot numbers, or decorative borders.`,label:t("storyboardDayToNight")||"Day-to-Night Cycle (4 Shots)",icon:"M12 3v2.25m6.364.386l-1.591 1.591M21 12h-2.25m-.386 6.364l-1.591-1.591M12 18.75V21m-4.773-4.227l-1.591 1.591M5.25 12H3m4.227-4.773L5.636 5.636M15.75 12a3.75 3.75 0 11-7.5 0 3.75 3.75 0 017.5 0z",previewId:"/assets/perspective_gallery/Storyboard/storyboard_day_to_night_4_shot.webp"},{id:"storyboard_arrival_sequence_4_shot",category:"storyboard",angle:`Based on the uploaded image, generate a cinematic 4-frame architectural arrival walkthrough storyboard arranged in a clean 2×2 contact sheet:
Frame 1 (Distant Approach): Wide street-level perspective presenting the complete property within its neighborhood context.
Frame 2 (Entrance & Gate): Medium shot approaching the driveway, perimeter wall, and entry landscaping.
Frame 3 (Main Portico / Foyer): Close architectural framing of the front entrance door, canopy, and entryway steps.
Frame 4 (Stepping Inside): Looking through the open entrance into the illuminated primary foyer and living space.

STRICT CONTINUITY & QUALITY:
- Strict visual consistency of building massing, materials, colors, landscape, and lighting direction across all 4 frames.
- Professional architectural photography style, no text, captions, shot numbers, or watermarks.`,label:t("storyboardArrivalSequence")||"Arrival Sequence Walkthrough (4 Shots)",icon:"M15.75 9V5.25A2.25 2.25 0 0013.5 3h-6a2.25 2.25 0 00-2.25 2.25v13.5A2.25 2.25 0 007.5 21h6a2.25 2.25 0 002.25-2.25V15m3 0l3-3m0 0l-3-3m3 3H9",previewId:"/assets/perspective_gallery/Storyboard/storyboard_arrival_sequence_4_shot.webp"},{id:"storyboard_three_seasons_3_shot",category:"storyboard",angle:`Based on the uploaded image, generate an ultra-realistic 3-season transformation storyboard contact sheet arranged in a clean 3-frame layout from the same camera view:
Frame 1 (Spring): Fresh vibrant green budding foliage, blooming garden flowers, and soft clear morning light.
Frame 2 (Summer): Lush dense greenery, bright direct sunlight, deep blue sky, and clear pool/terrace shadows.
Frame 3 (Winter / Rain): Overcast atmospheric mood with wet reflective pavement, subtle fog/mist, and cozy warm interior lighting glowing through glass.

STRICT CONTINUITY & QUALITY:
- Maintain 100% architectural geometry, wall finishes, and structural layout across all 3 frames.
- Clean contact sheet with no text, watermark, shot numbers, or borders.`,label:t("storyboardThreeSeasons")||"Seasonal Transformation (3 Shots)",icon:"M12 21a9.004 9.004 0 008.716-6.747c1.05-3.6-1.565-7.304-5.165-7.794a9.004 9.004 0 00-11.102 11.102c.49 3.6 4.194 6.215 7.794 5.165A9.004 9.004 0 0012 21z",previewId:"/assets/perspective_gallery/Storyboard/storyboard_three_seasons_3_shot.webp"},{id:"storyboard_interior_flow_4_shot",category:"storyboard",angle:`Based on the uploaded reference image, generate an ultra-luxurious 4-frame interior spatial flow storyboard arranged in a 2×2 contact sheet capturing a sequential room-to-room journey:
Frame 1: Grand double-height living reception area with contemporary designer sofa and expansive windows.
Frame 2: Gourmet open-concept kitchen and marble island dining area.
Frame 3: Serene master bedroom suite overlooking private garden views with soft ambient lighting.
Frame 4: Spa-inspired master bathroom or private attached outdoor terrace.

STRICT CONTINUITY & QUALITY:
- Consistent interior design style, cohesive luxury material palette (wood, stone, metal), matching architectural language, and uniform daylighting across all 4 spaces.
- Professional interior photography, no text, captions, shot numbers, or watermarks.`,label:t("storyboardInteriorFlow")||"Interior Spatial Flow (4 Shots)",icon:"M2.25 12l8.954-8.955c.44-.439 1.152-.439 1.591 0L21.75 12M4.5 9.75v10.125c0 .621.504 1.125 1.125 1.125H9.75v-4.875c0-.621.504-1.125 1.125-1.125h2.25c.621 0 1.125.504 1.125 1.125V21h4.125c.621 0 1.125-.504 1.125-1.125V9.75M8.25 21h8.25",previewId:"/assets/perspective_gallery/Storyboard/storyboard_interior_flow_4_shot.webp"},{id:"storyboard_aerial_drone_3_shot",category:"storyboard",angle:`Based on the uploaded image, generate a 3-frame cinematic aerial drone flight sequence storyboard dynamically merged into a high-definition contact sheet:
Frame 1 (High Altitude): Expansive high-altitude drone overview showing the entire property footprint, access roads, and surrounding landscape context.
Frame 2 (45° Bird's-Eye Oblique): Angled aerial shot capturing the building's roof design, facade depth, and private boundary walls.
Frame 3 (Low Altitude Glide): Low-altitude drone fly-by hovering smoothly above the garden, pool, or main entrance facade.

STRICT CONTINUITY & QUALITY:
- Strictly preserve the exact building geometry, roof forms, materials, driveway layout, and site boundaries.
- Ultra-realistic drone photography, 8k resolution, no text, logos, shot numbers, or watermarks.`,label:t("storyboardAerialDrone")||"Aerial Drone Flight (3 Shots)",icon:"M6 12L3.269 3.126A59.768 59.768 0 0121.485 12 59.77 59.77 0 013.27 20.876L5.999 12zm0 0h7.5",previewId:"/assets/perspective_gallery/Storyboard/storyboard_aerial_drone_3_shot.webp"},{id:"storyboard_real_estate_pitch_4_shot",category:"storyboard",angle:`Based on the uploaded image, generate a luxury commercial real-estate marketing pitch contact sheet featuring 4 essential sales frames in a clean 2×2 layout:
Frame 1 (The Hero Exterior): Premium eye-level front facade architectural photograph bathed in natural sunlight.
Frame 2 (The Aerial Overview): Elevated 45-degree oblique drone perspective displaying the complete site plan and private grounds.
Frame 3 (The Signature Interior): Stunning primary living space with floor-to-ceiling glass and high-end furnishings.
Frame 4 (The Twilight Showcase): Dramatic evening twilight shot with illuminated pool, garden lighting, and warm glowing interior.

STRICT CONTINUITY & QUALITY:
- Perfect structural and stylistic continuity across all frames: same architecture, materials, and luxury styling.
- High-end commercial real estate marketing editorial standard, no text, branding, shot numbers, or watermarks.`,label:t("storyboardRealEstatePitch")||"Commercial Pitch Sheet (4 Shots)",icon:"M16.5 18.75h-9m9 0a3 3 0 013 3h-15a3 3 0 013-3m9 0v-3.375c0-.621-.503-1.125-1.125-1.125h-.871M7.5 18.75v-3.375c0-.621.504-1.125 1.125-1.125h.872m5.007 0H9.497m5.007 0a7.454 7.454 0 01-.982-3.172M9.497 14.25a7.454 7.454 0 00.982-3.172M5.25 4.236c-.982.143-1.954.317-2.916.52A6.003 6.003 0 007.73 9.728M5.25 4.236V4.5c0 2.108.966 3.99 2.48 5.228M5.25 4.236V2.721C7.483 2.244 9.81 2 12 2s4.517.244 6.75.721v1.515c0 2.108-.966 3.99-2.48 5.228m2.48-5.228c.982.143 1.954.317 2.916.52a6.003 6.003 0 01-5.395 4.972m0 0a10.468 10.468 0 01-3.855 0",previewId:"/assets/perspective_gallery/Storyboard/storyboard_real_estate_pitch_4_shot.webp"},{id:"storyboard_weather_moods_3_shot",category:"storyboard",angle:`Based on the uploaded image, generate an ultra-realistic 3-shot architectural storyboard contact sheet capturing diverse atmospheric weather moods from the same camera perspective:
Frame 1 (Crisp Sunny Daylight): Bright clear sky, sharp clean architectural cast shadows, and brilliant sunlight reflecting off glass and smooth wall surfaces.
Frame 2 (Cinematic Rain & Reflections): Dramatic moody overcast sky, gentle rain streaks, glistening wet stone pavement with mirror-like reflections, and droplets on glazing.
Frame 3 (Ethereal Morning Fog): Soft misty atmospheric fog drifting past surrounding trees and architecture, diffused morning daylight, with warm interior lighting gently glowing through the haze.

STRICT CONTINUITY & QUALITY:
- Maintain 100% strict architectural geometry, materials, facade design, and site layout across all 3 frames.
- Clean contact sheet mosaic presentation: No text, captions, labels, shot numbers, watermarks, logos, or decorative borders.`,label:t("storyboardWeatherMoods")||"Atmospheric Weather Study (3 Shots)",icon:"M2.25 15a4.5 4.5 0 004.5 4.5H18a3.75 3.75 0 001.332-7.257 3 3 0 00-3.758-3.848 5.25 5.25 0 00-10.233 2.33A4.502 4.502 0 002.25 15z",previewId:"/assets/perspective_gallery/Storyboard/storyboard_weather_moods_3_shot.webp"},{id:"storyboard_raw_land_site_prep_3_shot",category:"storyboard",angle:`Based on the uploaded image, generate an ultra-realistic 3-shot architectural pre-development storyboard contact sheet showing the original land transformation leading to construction while STRICTLY MAINTAINING THE EXACT SAME CAMERA PERSPECTIVE AND VIEWPOINT of the property:
Frame 1 (Existing Raw Land / Untouched Site): The wild untouched plot of land in its raw natural state before any construction—natural soil, wild grass, native trees, and open sky matching the environment of the reference house.
Frame 2 (Site Clearing & Earthmoving): Active land preparation with bulldozers and excavators clearing wild brush, grading terrain, compacting earth, and leveling the ground.
Frame 3 (Cleared Pad & Survey Pegs): Clean flat graded building pad with white survey chalk lines and wooden corner stakes laid out marking the exact architectural footprint of the future house.

STRICT CONTINUITY & CAMERA PERSPECTIVE:
- CRITICAL: Lock the exact camera viewpoint, angle, and horizon height across all 3 frames matching the uploaded reference image.
- Strictly preserve the exact plot boundaries, surrounding natural environment, trees, and neighboring context.
- Clean contact sheet mosaic presentation: No text, captions, labels, shot numbers, watermarks, logos, or decorative borders.`,label:t("storyboardRawLandSitePrep")||"Raw Land & Site Preparation (3 Shots)",icon:"M12 21v-8.25M15.75 21v-8.25M8.25 21v-8.25M3 9l9-6 9 6m-1.5 12V10.332A48.36 48.36 0 0012 9.75c-2.551 0-5.056.2-7.5.582V21M3 21h18M12 6.75h.008v.008H12V6.75z",previewId:"/assets/perspective_gallery/Storyboard/storyboard_raw_land_site_prep_3_shot.webp"},{id:"storyboard_blueprint_to_foundation_3_shot",category:"storyboard",angle:`Based on the uploaded image, generate an ultra-realistic 3-shot architectural pre-construction storyboard contact sheet leading to foundation, where all stages UNMISTAKABLY REFLECT THE EXACT SHAPE, WINGS, COLUMNS, AND FOOTPRINT OF THE REFERENCE HOUSE:
Frame 1 (CAD Blueprint Displaying Exact House Form): Architect's hands holding an unfolded architectural drawing in the foreground. The blueprint visibly displays the detailed technical 2D front elevation and floor plan of the EXACT house from the uploaded image (matching its specific roof pitch, window rhythm, and entrance proportions). In the background, survey stakes and chalk lines on the cleared building pad map out that exact footprint.
Frame 2 (Identifiable Excavation Footprint): From the exact same camera view: active ground excavation where the dug foundation trenches and formwork precisely match the complex shape, wings, corner setbacks, and entrance portico of the reference house. The excavated trench pattern on the ground is instantly recognizable as the base of this specific building.
Frame 3 (Foundation Plinth & Column Rebar Matching House Form): From the exact same camera view: poured concrete grade beams, raised ground slab, and tall vertical steel rebar cages rising at every structural pillar position corresponding precisely to the columns, corners, and load-bearing walls of the reference house. The foundation plinth clearly establishes the unmistakable massing and footprint of the final building.

STRICT CONTINUITY & RECOGNIZABLE HOUSE FORM:
- CRITICAL: Lock the exact camera viewpoint, angle, and horizon height across all 3 frames matching the uploaded reference image. Do not change camera angle or generate flat 2D documents.
- UNMISTAKABLE ARCHITECTURAL FORM: The footprint, dimensions, column grid, and setbacks must 100% reflect the specific building form of the uploaded house—never a generic rectangular slab. The viewer must immediately recognize the distinctive shape of the reference house in every frame.
- Clean contact sheet mosaic presentation: No text, captions, labels, shot numbers, watermarks, logos, or decorative borders.`,label:t("storyboardBlueprintToFoundation")||"Blueprint to Foundation (3 Shots)",icon:"M16.862 4.487l1.687-1.688a1.875 1.875 0 112.652 2.652L10.582 16.07a4.5 4.5 0 01-1.897 1.13L6 18l.8-2.685a4.5 4.5 0 011.13-1.897l8.932-8.931zm0 0L19.5 7.125M18 14v4.75A2.25 2.25 0 0115.75 21H5.25A2.25 2.25 0 013 18.75V8.25A2.25 2.25 0 015.25 6H10",previewId:"/assets/perspective_gallery/Storyboard/storyboard_blueprint_to_foundation_3_shot.webp"},{id:"storyboard_structure_to_reality_3_shot",category:"storyboard",angle:`Based on the uploaded image, generate an ultra-realistic 3-shot architectural storyboard contact sheet showing the progressive evolution of the building from raw construction to finished masterpiece:
Frame 1 (Structural Skeleton): The exposed architectural framing stage featuring raw reinforced concrete columns, floor slabs, structural steel beams, and open scaffolding.
Frame 2 (Envelope & Glazing Installation): Architectural enclosure stage with exterior facade panels being mounted, large floor-to-ceiling glass installed, and roof cladding fitted.
Frame 3 (Completed Finished Masterpiece): The finalized luxury building in pristine finished condition with polished surfaces, warm lighting, designer furnishings, and lush garden landscaping.

STRICT CONTINUITY & QUALITY:
- Strictly adhere to the exact same architectural massing, building dimensions, rooflines, and spatial orientation across all 3 stages.
- Clean contact sheet mosaic presentation: No text, captions, labels, shot numbers, watermarks, logos, or decorative borders.`,label:t("storyboardStructureToReality")||"Structure to Reality (3 Shots)",icon:"M6.429 9.75L2.25 12l4.179 2.25m0-4.5l5.571 3 5.571-3m-11.142 0L2.25 7.5 12 2.25l9.75 5.25-4.179 2.25m0 0L21.75 12l-4.179 2.25m0 0l4.179 2.25L12 21.75 2.25 16.5l4.179-2.25m11.142 0l-5.571 3-5.571-3",previewId:"/assets/perspective_gallery/Storyboard/storyboard_structure_to_reality_3_shot.webp"},{id:"storyboard_drive_up_car_3_shot",category:"storyboard",angle:`Based on the uploaded image, generate an ultra-realistic 3-shot cinematic automotive arrival storyboard contact sheet arranged in a clean 3-frame layout:
Frame 1 (Driver POV Through Windshield): Cinematic driver's perspective from inside a luxury vehicle looking forward through the clean windshield over the dashboard and leather steering wheel as the private driveway approaches the illuminated house facade.
Frame 2 (Curbside Arrival & Reflections): Exterior medium shot of the sleek vehicle gliding to a stop beside the entrance portico, with its polished paintwork and side mirror reflecting the modern architecture, glazing, and landscaping.
Frame 3 (Stepping Out Toward Entrance): Eye-level cinematic view beside the vehicle framing the illuminated entry steps, welcoming front canopy, and glowing entryway lighting.

STRICT CONTINUITY & QUALITY:
- Strictly preserve the exact house architecture, materials, driveway layout, landscape, and lighting direction from the uploaded reference.
- High-end automotive commercial cinematography, realistic reflections, natural depth of field, no text, logos, or watermarks.`,label:t("storyboardDriveUpCarApproach")||"Drive-Up Car Approach (3 Shots)",icon:"M8.25 18.75a1.5 1.5 0 01-3 0m3 0a1.5 1.5 0 00-3 0m3 0h6m-9 0H3.375a1.125 1.125 0 01-1.125-1.125V14.25m17.25 4.5a1.5 1.5 0 01-3 0m3 0a1.5 1.5 0 00-3 0m3 0h1.125c.621 0 1.125-.504 1.125-1.125V14.25m-19.5 0h19.5m-19.5 0l2.647-5.955A2.25 2.25 0 016.108 7.5h11.784a2.25 2.25 0 012.057 1.345L22.5 14.25",previewId:"/assets/perspective_gallery/Storyboard/storyboard_drive_up_car_3_shot.webp"},{id:"storyboard_property_infographic_3_shot",category:"storyboard",angle:`Based on the uploaded image, generate an ultra-realistic 3-shot commercial real estate infographic storyboard contact sheet combining regional location mapping, cadastral lot boundary, and building footprint data:
Frame 1 (Phnom Penh Regional Location & Distance Map): High-altitude 3D satellite terrain map view of Phnom Penh showing the iconic Mekong and Tonle Sap river systems, major expressways, Ring Roads, and urban layout. Features a glowing yellow/gold boundary contour tracing the local municipality/district, a prominent red 3D pin marking the property site, and white landmark pins with curved dashed connection lines and distance badges (e.g. "15 min to BKK1 / City Center", "25 min to Airport", "10 min to Aeon Mall").
Frame 2 (Micro Cadastral Plot Boundary & Land Size): Oblique aerial drone view looking down at the property with a bright glowing neon-orange laser boundary line precisely tracing the property lot perimeter and road frontage. Bold 3D perspective typography stands on the ground terrain displaying total lot size (e.g. "1,200 m²").
Frame 3 (Building Footprint & Floor Area): Closer aerial drone perspective focusing on the house architecture with an illuminated subtle contour outlining the building base and roofline, accompanied by bold 3D extruded dimensional typography indicating the building area (e.g. "400 m²").

STRICT CONTINUITY & COMMERCIAL INFOGRAPHIC QUALITY:
- Maintain 100% architectural and site fidelity: the house in Frames 2 and 3 must strictly match the design, rooflines, and materials of the uploaded reference.
- High-end professional real estate marketing infographic style, sharp glowing neon vector graphics, crisp 3D dimensional numbers, cinematic lighting. Clean contact sheet layout.`,label:t("storyboardPropertyInfographic")||"Location & Boundary Infographic (3 Shots)",icon:"M15 10.5a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0z M19.5 10.5c0 7.142-7.5 11.25-7.5 11.25S4.5 17.642 4.5 10.5a7.5 7.5 0 1115 0z",previewId:"/assets/perspective_gallery/Storyboard/storyboard_property_infographic_3_shot.webp"},{id:"storyboard_host_property_review_3_shot",category:"storyboard",angle:`Based on the uploaded image, generate an ultra-realistic 3-shot architectural video tour storyboard arranged in a clean 3-frame contact sheet featuring a professional presenter/host reviewing the property:
Frame 1 (Front Facade Introduction): The stylish professional presenter stands on the front driveway in elegant smart-casual attire, gesturing warmly toward the impressive front facade and roofline of the house behind them.
Frame 2 (Highlighting Facade Craftsmanship): Medium shot of the presenter pointing out and reviewing the exterior architectural craftsmanship—natural stone masonry, timber cladding, or large architectural glass windows.
Frame 3 (Inviting Inside / Grand Portico): The presenter stands beside the grand entrance steps and welcoming front canopy, smiling and gesturing toward the front entrance as if inviting the viewer inside.

STRICT CONTINUITY & QUALITY:
- 100% strict architectural fidelity: the house in all 3 frames must strictly preserve the exact design, materials, geometry, landscaping, and lighting of the reference image.
- Natural human scale, professional editorial cinematography, realistic anatomy and expressions, no text, captions, logos, or watermarks.`,label:t("storyboardHostPropertyReview")||"Property Review Host Tour (3 Shots)",icon:"M15.75 6a3.75 3.75 0 11-7.5 0 3.75 3.75 0 017.5 0zM4.501 20.118a7.5 7.5 0 0114.998 0A17.933 17.933 0 0112 21.75c-2.676 0-5.216-.584-7.499-1.632z",previewId:"/assets/perspective_gallery/Storyboard/storyboard_host_property_review_3_shot.webp"},{id:"storyboard_architect_client_review_3_shot",category:"storyboard",angle:`Based on the uploaded image, generate an ultra-realistic 3-shot architectural design consultation storyboard arranged in a clean 3-frame contact sheet showing the architect walking the clients through the completed home:
