Frame 2 (Reviewing Finishes & Blueprint): Over-the-shoulder medium shot as the architect points toward the custom entrance canopy, modern exterior lighting, and wall textures while holding a design portfolio folder.
Frame 3 (Handshake & Satisfaction): A warm, professional moment in front of the illuminated front entrance portico at golden hour, with the client and architect smiling and shaking hands in front of the completed villa.

STRICT CONTINUITY & QUALITY:
