Frame 1 (Phnom Penh Regional Location & Distance Map): High-altitude 3D satellite terrain map view of Phnom Penh showing the iconic Mekong and Tonle Sap river systems, major expressways, Ring Roads, and urban layout. Features a glowing yellow/gold boundary contour tracing the local municipality/district, a prominent red 3D pin marking the property site, and white landmark pins with curved dashed connection lines and distance badges (e.g. "15 min to BKK1 / City Center", "25 min to Airport", "10 min to Aeon Mall").
Frame 2 (Micro Cadastral Plot Boundary & Land Size): Oblique aerial drone view looking down at the property with a bright glowing neon-orange laser boundary line precisely tracing the property lot perimeter and road frontage. Bold 3D perspective typography stands on the ground terrain displaying total lot size (e.g. "1,200 m²").
Frame 3 (Building Footprint & Floor Area): Closer aerial drone perspective focusing on the house architecture with an illuminated subtle contour outlining the building base and roofline, accompanied by bold 3D extruded dimensional typography indicating the building area (e.g. "400 m²").

STRICT CONTINUITY & COMMERCIAL INFOGRAPHIC QUALITY:
- Maintain 100% architectural and site fidelity: the house in Frames 2 and 3 must strictly match the design, rooflines, and materials of the uploaded reference.
- High-end professional real estate marketing infographic style, sharp glowing neon vector graphics, crisp 3D dimensional numbers, cinematic lighting. Clean contact sheet layout.`}],td=({customPerspectivePrompt:t,onPromptChange:a,onGenerate:r,isGenerating:i,isAnyGalleryItemLoading:s,isLoading:o,unitCost:c,t:l})=>{const u=i||s||o,g=t.trim().length>0&&!u,m=gt.useRef(null),[p,v]=gt.useState(!1),T=w=>{w.preventDefault();const d=w.clientY,C=m.current?m.current.offsetHeight:120,I=K=>{if(!m.current)return;const $=Math.max(100,Math.min(750,C+(K.clientY-d)));m.current.style.height=`${$}px`},M=()=>{document.removeEventListener("mousemove",I),document.removeEventListener("mouseup",M),document.body.style.cursor="",document.body.style.userSelect="",v(!1)};document.body.style.cursor="ns-resize",document.body.style.userSelect="none",document.addEventListener("mousemove",I),document.addEventListener("mouseup",M),v(!0)},L=w=>{const d=w.touches[0].clientY,C=m.current?m.current.offsetHeight:120,I=K=>{if(!m.current||!K.touches[0])return;const $=Math.max(100,Math.min(750,C+(K.touches[0].clientY-d)));m.current.style.height=`${$}px`},M=()=>{document.removeEventListener("touchmove",I),document.removeEventListener("touchend",M),v(!1)};document.addEventListener("touchmove",I),document.addEventListener("touchend",M),v(!0)};return e.jsx("div",{className:"w-full max-w-4xl mx-auto space-y-6 mb-8 animate-fadeIn",children:e.jsxs("div",{"data-feature-panel":"custom-viewpoint",className:"rounded-3xl border border-white/10 bg-gradient-to-b from-white/[0.04] via-bg-secondary/60 to-bg-tertiary/40 backdrop-blur-2xl p-5 sm:p-7 shadow-2xl space-y-6 group/custom-viewpoint",children:[e.jsxs("div",{className:"flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-4 pb-5 border-b border-white/5",children:[e.jsxs("div",{className:"flex items-center gap-3.5",children:[e.jsx("div",{className:"w-10 h-10 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-purple-500/20 to-fuchsia-500/10 border border-purple-500/30 flex item